window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_MADAMS_IDENTITIES_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3501,"title":"Chapter 3501: Sister Nian Is Undoubtedly The Focus","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian instinctively looked around for someone.","Today, all the major factions in the independent continent sent people to Mingshui Mansion. People entered one after another from the main door, but her corner was relatively quiet.","Looking around and not seeing Ye Wangchuan, she frowned and looked down at the words \"where you can see\" on her phone screen.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes, not understanding what he meant.","Since she couldn't figure it out, she decided not to think about it. She looked at the time. It was almost time to go in.","She returned her cell phone to her pocket and walked into Mingshui Mansion.","***","The Mingshui Mansion was extremely lively today.","Everyone from the various alliances had arrived.","Other than the slightly higher-ups in the independent continent, many factions on the same level as the Tongji Society had also arrived.","Where there were people, there was no lack of small talk.","Simon was a social butterfly and had undoubtedly become the most popular person in the crowd.","From time to time, someone would walk over to greet him.","Simon was also good at dealing with these occasions. Sometimes, when two or three people came at the same time, he took the opportunity to introduce them to each other.","However, he seemed 'busy' and kept a portion of his attention on the Ji family.","The Ji family was also here today.","But it was different from what he had expected.","He thought that since Ji Lingfeng had not fully recovered from his hospitalization, the Ji family should have fallen into the hands of Second Elder and Fourth Elder. He thought the elders would step in this time.","Unexpectedly, Ji Nan came early.","He wasn't the only one to come from the Ji family. Second Elder accompanied him. Logically speaking, Second Elder was unlikely to give Ji Nan face.","However, no one understood the reason behind this. This time, the Second Elder seemed to have been convinced by Ji Nan. At the very least, the entire process was dominated by Ji Nan. Both parties seemed harmonious.","If not for the commotion at the harbor, everyone present would have thought there was no internal conflict in the Ji family.","Not far away.","How could Second Elder not feel the inquisitive gazes from all directions? It was just that he was used to scheming so others couldn't notice anything amiss from his behavior.","He looked at the time and asked Ji Nan uneasily, \"Miss Qiao isn't here yet?\"","It was Ji Nan's first time attending such an event in the independent continent. No one came to greet him. Still, he was happy and relaxed. Hearing this, he lowered his voice. \"It's not time yet, right? She should be almost here.\"","Seeing how confident he was, Second Elder pursed his lips and swallowed what he was about to say. He only reminded sternly, \"We should rather give up on this competition than run away at the last minute. If Miss Qiao doesn't come, the Ji family will probably—\"","Ji Nan interrupted him with an indifferent expression. \"She will come.\"","Second Elder's brows twitched, but before he could say anything, a small commotion ensued at the door.","Right on the heels of that, he heard exchanges such as 'Qiao Nian', 'She's indeed going to represent the Ji family in this treasure hunt', 'It's not that she doesn't want to have anything to do with the Ji family', and 'It's over this time'.","Ji Nan and Second Elder looked at the entrance at the same time. Indeed, they saw someone walking over from the center of the crowd.","The girl was wearing a hoodie and a baseball cap. With her hands in her pockets and a black shoulder bag slung over her shoulder, she looked neat.","She walked step by step, through all the discussions in the room.","She did not say a word, but she attracted the attention of everyone in the room and became the center of attention."]},{"number":3502,"title":"Chapter 3502: Sister Nian: I Only Trust Myself","paragraphs":["Ji Nan's lips curled up slightly. He left the others behind and quickly walked towards the girl. \"Nian Nian, you're here.\"","\"Where should I sign in?\" The girl hummed and looked at him casually.","Not everyone in Mingshui Mansion was participating in this treasure hunt. Only those who signed up were real participants.","Ji Nan told her about a place and brought her there.","The staff at the signing office looked at Ji Nan's young face and the girl and paused.","\"You're participating?\"","\"Mm.\"","Qiao Nian responded calmly. She picked up the pen on the table and took the form from her. She glanced at 10 lines at a time. The words 'life and death contract' were written very clearly. She no longer had to look at the rules and regulations.","In any case, one sentence meant everything—the participants would be responsible for their own life and death.","Qiao Nian signed her name on the paper. The pen moved like a dragon and snake, majestic and imposing. It did not look like a girl's handwriting at all.","After signing, she returned the form to the staff.","The staff asked a few simple questions according to the rules-her name, age, and who she was representing in the event.","Then, he issued her an armband.","A serial number was written on it.","Since Qiao Nian arrived late, her assigned number was '36'.","The armband was completely black except for the number '36', written in red. The color combination made her look like an idiot!","She held the armband and played with it without any intention of putting it on.","Recalling Xie Yun's reminder, before she put on the armband, Ji Nan asked in a low voice, \"Are you sure you want to participate in this event?\"","Qiao Nian looked up, her expression asking why he was asking such a boring question. \"Isn't it obvious since I'm standing here?\"","Ji Nan took a deep breath and clenched his fists. \"It's not too late. I can clear things with Mingshui Mansion and say that we forfeit.\"","Qiao Nian looked at him seriously, then restrained the surliness in her eyes and said arrogantly, \"I wouldn't have come if I was afraid.","\"Don't worry, I don't care about those people!\"","Seeing that she had made up her mind, Ji Nan said in a low voice, \"I've already spoken to Second Elder. They've arranged for people to protect you inside. If you encounter danger, you can look for numbers 9 and 15. They're our people and can be trusted.\"","This was the result of his negotiation with the elders after his talk with Xie Yun.","No matter what, Qiao Nian represented the Ji family this time.","Everyone was bound together for good or ill.","Ji Nan made it clear to them that if something happened to Qiao Nian this time, he didn't care if the Ji family could maintain the superficial harmony.","Second Elder and the others had been in the independent continent for all their lives and still had some connections. They had only arranged for two people to enter through two small forces.","Qiao Nian pinned the armband on her sleeve. It was unknown if she had listened to him. In the end, she said, \"I only trust myself.\"","She had only trusted herself in the past.","Someone else was backing her, but it was definitely not someone arranged by the elders.","That person-","Qiao Nian had just finished speaking to Ji Nan when another commotion ensued at the entrance.","\"Bright Gate?\"","\"Is that Bright Gate's Mo Dong?\"","\"What are they doing here? Don't tell me Bright Gate is also participating in the treasure hunt. What's going on? Could it be that Bright Gate also wants to take a share of the loot?\""]},{"number":3503,"title":"Chapter 3503: Master Wang Is Participating Too?","paragraphs":["\"Who's the man beside Mo Dong? Why are those people from Bright Gate surrounding him?\" \"...No way.\"","Some people guessed the person's identity and found it unbelievable.","Bright Gate was different from the Ji family and the other forces in the independent continent.","It was very mysterious.","At least, Bright Gate's boss was very mysterious.","Usually, when Bright Gate handled matters, only Mo Dong and Mo Xi appeared. Everyone in the independent continent knew them, but they didn't know the young man beside Mo Dong.","Oriental.","Young.","These two points were very similar to one person.","Qiao Nian!","Back then, Qiao Nian had also appeared out of nowhere like this. When everyone thought she was just a wild girl from the outside, she slowly became the successor Feng Yu valued in the First Research Institute.","Now, there was another young Oriental man!","Only Simon and a few others had seen Ye Wangchuan before.","Simon's eyes darkened and his tone changed. \"Why is he here!\"","Of course, he knew that Qiao Nian had such a person by her side, but he didn't know why he came to Mingshui Mansion today.","\"President Simon knows him?\" Someone heard him and asked curiously, \"Could this person be the Bright Gate's boss...\"","Simon didn't say anything. His gaze was fixed on the group entering.","It was Ye Wangchuan!","He had looked up the name.","There wasn't much information, only surface-level information, such as he was from Beijing's Ye family and the like.","Nothing more could be found!","Because of this, Simon had never dared to look down on this man. He even felt that he couldn't understand this man.","And he came today...?","Simon was still trying to figure it out when Mo Dong, walking beside Ye Wangchuan, greeted Qiao Nian warmly. \"Yo, Miss Qiao!\"","Qiao Nian immediately remembered the WeChat message she received when she saw them. Feeling a headache, her black eyes locked onto the man. \"What are you trying to do?\"","Ye Wangchuan walked to her side and told the staff, \"Give me a form. I want to sign up too.\" Qiao Nian's nerves suddenly tightened. Her temples throbbed, and the veins on her forehead bulged as she stared at him. \"Is this what you meant by 'where I can see'?\"","Ye Wangchuan did not deny it. He picked up the pen she had just used and casually signed his name. Then, he casually told the staff his name.","\"Ye Wangchuan, Bright Gate.\"","\"They're really from Bright Gate.\"","\"Ye Wangchuan? I remember the code name behind Bright Gate is Y. According to the Chinese text, Y is Ye's initial letter.\"","\"This year's treasure hunt is amazing.\"","\"Bright Gate's boss appeared in public. And he's participating in the treasure hunt. What's with this situation?\"","\"President Simon of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance doesn't look too good. I heard that...\" The rest of the sentence was too soft. It involved confidential information, and the words were vague.","However, some people heard it and looked at President Simon.","When Simon saw Ye Wangchuan go straight to register and get the armband, his mixed-race face did not look good.","He thought of something and his blue eyes turned dark and gloomy.","\"He... did not hesitate to appear in public just to participate in this treasure hunt?\"","Simon didn't believe it.","He felt something wrong, as if things were starting to deviate from his plan.","However, the arrow was already notched, so he had no choice but to shoot.","He couldn't call his men back now."]},{"number":3504,"title":"Chapter 3504: Doesn’t He Know What Happened to the Last Person?","paragraphs":["Simon forced himself to calm down and rubbed his twitching eyelids. Pretending that nothing had happened, he said to the person beside him, \"Remember to check what the participants have brought later.\"","\"Yes, President, don't worry,\" the person beside him replied in a low voice.","Simon glanced in Qiao Nian's direction again before retracting his gaze. He tried to calm down, not wanting anyone to notice anything amiss.","On the other side.","After signing up, Ye Wangchuan got the number next to Qiao Nian.","Qiao Nian was 36, and he was 37.","He showed the same reaction as Qiao Nian upon receiving the armband. He sized it up, his face filled with undisguised disdain.","It was quite ugly.","Ji Nan relaxed and took the initiative to chat with Ye Wangchuan.","Seeing how familiar they were with each other and Ji Nan's nonchalant reaction just now, Qiao Nian had already guessed most of it.","Not beating around the bush, she asked Ji Nan directly, \"You knew all along?\"","Feeling guilty, Ji Nan rubbed his nose and pretended to be stupid. \"Ahem, not much earlier than you. Young Master Ye consulted with me two days ago, but I didn't tell you.\"","\"Huh.\"","Qiao Nian was so angry that her head hurt. Considering that time was tight and so many people were around, she did not settle the score with him right now.","Instead, she solemnly said, \"I'll settle the score with you later!\"","Ji Nan touched the bridge of his nose silently.","Of course, he knew that Qiao Nian would be angry.","However, compared to her anger, he hoped that Ye Wangchuan could protect her more.","On the surface, this event was calm, but undercurrents surged. He couldn't participate, he knew his own strength. He knew he wouldn't be able to help even if he participated. He would only drag Qiao Nian down.","But Ye Wangchuan was different.","Ji Nan didn't know much about him, but he knew that Ye Wangchuan and Qiao Nian were the same kind of people.","With Ye Wangchuan around...","Even if Qiao Nian didn't trust Second Elder's people, at least she would have a companion she trusted!","Therefore, even though he knew that Qiao Nian would be angry, he took the risk and hid this matter from her.","\"When you get out safely, I'll let you beat me up to appease your anger.\"","After Ji Nan finished speaking, someone informed the participants to prepare to leave Mingshui Mansion for the treasure hunt's location.","Qiao Nian didn't say anything. She didn't want to talk to him.","Mo Dong glanced at him and patted his shoulder. He even gave him a thumbs-up and mouthed something.","Ji Nan could tell he was saying 'awesome'.","He didn't understand what he meant, and Second Elder sent someone to rush him.","He reminded Qiao Nian to be careful before turning around.","Mo Dong watched him walk away before looking at the girl. Not as worried as Ji Nan, he said half-jokingly, \"Miss Qiao, Young Master Ji doesn't know that the person who said this last time was beaten up by you and landed in hospital for three months?\"","He had seen Qiao Nian's information.","He knew she beat up someone in Rao City.","He didn't know where Ji Nan got the courage to ask Miss Qiao to beat him up.","With Young Master Ji's small body, if Miss Qiao really beat him up, he would surely vomit blood.","However, he also knew that Qiao Nian wouldn't really beat him. If she wanted to bicker, she wouldn't care about the Ji family's matters.","He could tell that Qiao Nian did not want to talk, so he took the initiative to say, \"Master Wang, Miss Qiao, I'll go talk to my brothers.\"","He strode away.","He was perceptive and left Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan alone to talk."]},{"number":3505,"title":"Chapter 3505: Sister Nian Even Brought Gum","paragraphs":["Chapter 3505: Sister Nian Even Brought Gum","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Let’s go too.” Qiao Nian pulled up the zipper of her sweater and turned to leave.","However, Ye Wangchuan grabbed her left wrist and stood rooted to the ground. His tone was still the same as before, taking on the personality of Young Master Ye from Beijing, as he asked in a lazy tone, “Are you angry?”","Qiao Nian frowned, not shaking off his hand. “No.”","Ye Wangchuan looked unconvinced.","Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows with her other hand. Looking at his hand holding hers, her eyes flickered with emotions. “There were times when I didn’t tell you about things.”","She paused before continuing, “This is your first time.”","This was the first time Ye Wangchuan withheld information from her.","Hence, she felt uncomfortable at first, but on second thought, her anger dissipated.","Qiao Nian had never been pretentious. She could roughly tell that Ye Wangchuan thought she was angry, so she smiled and emphasized with a serious expression on her usually sloppy face. “I’m really not angry. But you have to listen to me later. Be careful. They won’t go easy on me.”","Ye Wangchuan let go of her wrist. His nose was straight and his lips thin.md there seemed to be a small hook in his eyes. “Yes, I’ll listen to Goddess Qiao.”","Qiao Nian looked at him sideways.","He was wearing a long black windbreaker and a high-collared sweater. His well-defined fingers and narrow phoenix eyes made him look like a young master leisurely strolling.","Her head rang, and the string pulled tighter. She tugged at her shoulder bag and said to him, “Let’s go.”","* * *","Many people were participating this time.","Qiao Nian’s number was 36.","Ye Wangchuan’s number was 37.","The two of them were not the last to report.","After that, more than 10 people signed the life and death agreement.","In other words, 50 to 60 people were participating in this treasure hunt. Most of them were muscular men.","Before the participants entered Mingshui Mansion, they had to ask the staff to check if any items were prohibited among the items they brought.","Qiao Nian was at the back.","She raised her bright eyes and glanced at the queue in front. She lowered her voice and said, “Pfft, did you see that? The seven or eight people in front are all mercenaries.”","Ye Wangchuan’s dark eyes were immersed. He did not seem surprised and only smiled. “Yes, it’s quite interesting.”","Qiao Nian glanced at him.","Was this interesting?","Their opponents spent so much money to hire these mercenaries. It was obvious they wouldn’t let them leave Mingshui Mansion today. But in his eyes, this had become ‘interesting’.","Was this not too damn interesting!","However, she was indeed not in a hurry. At least, she wasn’t intimidated by these people.","They didn’t have to wait long before it was their turn.","Ye Wangchuan didn’t bring anything, so he quickly passed the inspection.","Then, it was Qiao Nian’s turn.","The staff said in a businesslike manner, “Please empty your backpack on the table.”","Qiao Nian nimbly put down her bag, unzipped it, and poured the contents onto the table.","A pile of things fell out.","There were headphones, a charger box, a charger cable, and something that looked like an eyeglass box. There were also some messy things. It was impossible to tell what they were used for, but they were within the rules.","She even brought a box of chewing gum.","Stunned, the staff picked up the chewing gum box. Then, he looked up at the girl with a strange gaze and silently put Qiao Nian’s things back into the bag.","Then, he returned the black shoulder bag to the girl."]},{"number":3506,"title":"Chapter 3506: Don’t Worry, I Won’t Be Playful About This","paragraphs":["\"Alright, everything is fine.\"","Yes, there was no problem.","However, this was the first time he had seen someone take up space with something as 'impractical' as chewing gum.","Qiao Nian took her bag and said politely, \"Thank you.\"","Seeing the coldness between her eyebrows, the staff thought she was the kind of person who didn't like to talk to people. He didn't expect her to be so polite. Instead, it made the staff feel a little embarrassed. \"All the people who have been checked can go in. The diamond is hidden somewhere in the villa. You can come out as long as you find the diamond.\"","The game of treasure hunting in the independent continent was simple and crude. The person who found the diamond and successfully brought it out of the villa won.","Qiao Nian glanced at the staff and nodded kindly.","Observing as she grabbed her bag and entered Mingshui Mansion with the man, the staff thought of something and revealed a hint of pity in his eyes.","Although he was just a small staff member, he could sense that this year's treasure hunt was unusual.","In any case, under the calm surface, anyone could feel the surging waves.","Hopefully, that girl would be lucky enough to come out safely!","The staff member didn't zone out for long and quickly called the next person.","**","\"Let's go too.\"","Second Elder watched Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan enter. Then, he turned around and patted Ji Nan's shoulder, indicating for them to leave.","Today, they would all wait for the results at another villa not far from Mingshui Mansion.","There would be a broadcast over there. They would be able to see everything happening in the Mingshui Mansion.","Now that the participants had entered one after another, it was time for them to go to where they should stay.","Ji Nan didn't follow immediately. Instead, he looked in Qiao Nian's direction and frowned uneasily. \"Are the people we arranged alright?\"","Second Elder knew he was talking about the people with numbers 9 and 15. It was rare for him to be stunned. After a while, he didn't know whether to laugh or cry. He patted Ji Nan's shoulder harder. \"This concerns the Ji family's dignity. I'm not that muddle-headed! Don't worry, I've already explained it to those people. They'll do their best to help her.\"","Only then did Ji Nan turn around. Without looking at him, he only said, \"That's good.\"","Then, he walked in front of Second Elder with a calm expression. Without even greeting the rest of the family, he rushed to the villa next door alone.","Second Elder looked at his back view.","When he turned around, the Ji family's group followed and surrounded him. Someone asked, \"What's up with Young Master Nan? Why did he leave alone?\"","It was rare for Second Elder to remain silent. He only said, \"Let's go over too!\"","Qiao Nian's willingness to represent the Ji family in the competition had already exceeded his imagination. He knew what was good for him.","At the very least, even if he couldn't be of much help in this matter, he didn't want to be a burden.","In addition, he was in the same mood as Ji Nan. He also wanted to see the broadcast to check if Qiao Nian was safe and sound.","***","The Ji family left the earliest.","Old Madam Xie had just arrived and was chatting with Simon from the Chamber of Commerce Alliance.","Seeing Ji Nan leave in a hurry without even saying goodbye to her, his grandmother, the corners of her mouth immediately curled downwards, and her sharp face fell."]},{"number":3507,"title":"Chapter 3507: Watching to See Sister Nian’s Outcome","paragraphs":["Chapter 3507: Watching to See Sister Nian’s Outcome","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Hehe, an outsider made him estranged from his own grandmother.”","Silence.","Standing opposite her, even if Simon wanted to pretend he couldn’t hear, he couldn’t really pretend to be deaf. He covered his lips with the champagne glass and said awkwardly and politely, “Young Master Ji is too concerned about this event.”","Old Madam Xie pursed her lips, her face filled with displeasure. Obviously, she did not take Simon’s words seriously. Her face was full of disapproval.","Simon was just being polite. He didn’t treat people like Old Madam Xie the same way he treated Ji Lingfeng and Feng Yu.","Seeing that the other party was taking advantage of her old age and did not know how to be tactful, his smile faded. He placed the champagne glass on the waiter’s tray, brushed the creases on his suit, and told Old Madam Xie, “Matriarch, I still have something on, so I won’t be accompanying you.”","His expression turned apologetic, but his attitude was casual.","Old Madam Xie’s expression stiffened. She could tell Simon did not take her seriously, so she could only swallow her anger and nod. “President Simon, go ahead.”","Simon apologized and gestured to his assistant. Then, he strode away.","“Mom.” Mother Xie came over to support Old Madam Xie’s arm.","The old lady was furious and looked at her with a bad expression. She even pretended that Mother Xie did not exist. She suppressed her eyes and gritted her teeth. “Who does he think he is to show such an attitude towards me!”","Old Madam Xie knew well.","These people were not as friendly to her as before because she had fallen out with Xie Tingyun and Xie Yun.","However, she was used to being domineering all her life. Seeing the huge difference in treatment, she couldn’t accept it and felt even more uncomfortable.","Whenever she felt uncomfortable, she would think of Xie Yun, who did not return home. She also thought of how Ji Nan had left without even saying goodbye to her today.","Old Madam Xie couldn’t hide her meanness and lowered her voice. “Hmph, I’ll wait to see them make a fool of themselves!”","Without looking at Mother Xie’s expression, she turned around and said coldly, “Let’s go too.”","She couldn’t wait to see the Ji family fall from grace.","Mother Xie’s lips curled into a smile. She wasn’t as obviously gloating as Old Madam Xie, but her eyes flickered with gloating and joy.","She carefully held Old Madam Xie’s arm and said in a relaxed and happy tone, “Mom, slow down.”","**","Mingshui Mansion.","The participants who went through the inspection had already entered the villa.","This was an adjoined villa.","Although it was called a villa, from the floor area and architectural style, it was more like an ancient castle.","The villa was big and there were many rooms. The various similar rooms and corridors looked like a maze. If one wasn’t careful, they would get lost inside.","When Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan entered, they did not see the people who entered first anywhere.","Based on her experience sniping in Continent F...","Those people must have found a safe hiding place and were checking the terrain before doing anything.","Some people would just sit back and wait to reap the benefits. They would not come out early on and would hide themselves well.","When the competition was almost over and others had drained their energy, they would come out and easily pocket the loot."]},{"number":3508,"title":"Chapter 3508: The Prepared \"Accident\"","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian had yet to think of a plan. Instead, she observed her surroundings.","Her sharp eyes spotted the pinhole cameras all around the villa.","Needless to say, Ji Nan and the others gathered at the villa next door saw the situation inside.","\"Let's go in first.\"","Ye Wangchuan grabbed her hand, pushed open one of the doors, and pulled her in. Then, he closed the door.","Qiao Nian was caught off guard. She twisted her wrist and looked at him in surprise. \"What do you mean?\"","Ye Wangchuan walked straight to the southeast corner of the room. He picked up the blanket and covered the surveillance camera above before returning to her.","\"Have you thought of a countermeasure?\"","What?","Qiao Nian was still thinking about it when he suddenly spoke. She sat on the bed listlessly and looked at him roguishly. \"I didn't. I was prepared to do nothing and let you carry me through.\"","Ye Wangchuan knew she was only joking, but he still raised his eyebrows. His dark eyes were deep and dark.","\"Sure.","\"Follow me later. Don't run around.\"","Qiao Nian sized him up before asking, \"Are you serious?\"","Ye Wangchuan pressed down on her baseball cap, not wanting to look into her eyes. \"What else?\"","His tone was a little bitter.","However, according to normal relationships, it was normal for a man to say he wanted to protect his woman. It was just that Qiao Nian was no ordinary girl and did not have so many twists and turns. He wasn't explicit in asking her to hide behind him either, thus her subconscious question.","There was no malice behind it.","It was just a little hurtful to a man's pride.","It felt like his girlfriend did not believe in his abilities.","Fortunately, Qiao Nian turned around and was about to explain to him.","At this moment, there was a loud bang outside.","Qiao Nian frowned and a thought flashed across her mind.","Before she could think about it carefully, she heard an alarm, sharp and ear-piercing. Right on the heels of that, she heard a line burning.","At the same time, all the curtains automatically closed.","It was still daylight outside.","The entire room, or rather, the entire Mingshui Mansion, was plunged into complete darkness.","All of this happened too fast.","It was so fast that no one had time to react.","It was as if the change had happened in an instant, or as if it was a 'coincidence' that was premeditated.","\"Heh. Looks like they not only want the Ji family's glory, but they also want my life.\" In the darkness, the girl's voice was quite dry.","There were frustrations about not liking the dark, some surliness and arrogance, but there was no fear or panic that the person who designed this \"coincidence\" wanted.","In the darkness.","Qiao Nian unhurriedly took out her lighter from her pocket and lit it. Her dark eyes suppressed the blood and coldness that was about to come. She threw her shoulder bag on the bed and asked the person beside her, \"Do you know how to assemble guns?\"","Ye Wangchuan watched as she poured out the things in her shoulder bag. Among them were the black items that looked useless.","Those parts were extremely obedient in her hands. They were put together in no time and actually became a handy pistol.","Qiao Nian poured a few bullets from the glasses box and stuffed them in one by one before saying casually, \"These are empty bullets, but I added some ingredients.\"","Empty bullets did not kill people, but some people had a death wish.","She did not want to kill, so she asked Zhong Yiliu for anesthetics. These bullets had been","soaked in anesthetics, so she guaranteed they would be effective.","She threw the gun at the man, raised her chin slightly, and looked at him seriously. \"Have you played real CF before?\""]},{"number":3509,"title":"Chapter 3509: Master Wang Isn’t To Be Someone Not To Be Trifled With (1)","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan took the gun from her and checked it unhurriedly. He also loaded it and stretched out his long arm. He narrowed his eyes and aimed. Then, he lowered his hand and looked at the girl with a smile. His tone was light and relaxed, indescribably arrogant and reserved.","\"A Sig Sauer P322.22LR rimfire pistol?\"","Qiao Nian propped herself on the bed with one hand and looked up casually. \"You know it?\" Ye Wangchuan threw the weapon back to her. \"Catch it.\"","Qiao Nian quickly caught the weapon that had fallen back into her hand in the darkness. She twirled it as if she was playing with a toy. Her long eyelashes drooped, and her tone was not very good. \"It won't be safe later. You don't have a self-defense weapon on you... It's too risky.\"","\"If you give this to me, what about yourself?\" Ye Wangchuan's tone was light, not in the least panicked. It was unknown if he did not realize the danger.","Qiao Nian frowned, her eyes cold. She was about to say she would think of a way.","At this moment, Ye Wangchuan shushed her and leaned close to the door to listen for footsteps.","Qiao Nian also sensed footsteps approaching them from outside.","She walked over and lowered her voice. \"How many people are out there?\"","\"Two.\"","The man's figure was blurry in the dark, but she could feel the faint fragrance of cold mint from him. It made her feel at ease for no reason.","'Okay.\" Qiao Nian composed herself and held the mini pistol. Then, she lowered her voice and said, \"Don't move behind me later.\"","\"Pfft.\" Ye Wangchuan chuckled in the darkness. \"Do you know what the Old Master sent me to learn when I was 10?\"","Qiao Nian didn't know how to react.","She didn't know why he brought this up.","At this moment, footsteps approached them from outside.","Then, she heard murmurs. \"I haven't checked this room yet. Be careful. They might be hiding inside.\"","... They were really here for her!","Her attention was attracted, and her lips curled into a cold smile. Her eyes were filled with coldness as she tightened her grip on the loaded pistol.","The next second, Qiao Nian only felt that someone was blocking her view. Ye Wangchuan opened the door, like a cheetah in the night, staring at its prey outside.","Then, she heard two grunts.","Qiao Nian saw two men with armbands lying on the ground. The man she said she wanted to protect just now bent down leisurely to pick up the weapons they had dropped. He even tossed her a flashlight.","\"Take it.\"","Steady and domineering.","This was the true appearance of Master Wang in Beijing.","He moved like a cheetah and was as fast as the wind.","He never needed a woman's protection.","Qiao Nian caught the flashlight steadily and did not say anything else. She took the initiative to leave her back to him and said calmly, \"Drag them into the room. Others should be looking for us.\"","Ye Wangchuan was already dragging the two unconscious men into the room without her saying anything. He easily threw the two sacks in the corner of the room.","Seeing that he had already taken a weapon, Qiao Nian did not mention sharing her weapon with him again. However, in the dark room, she couldn't help but ask, \"I didn't expect you to know how to fight.\"","\"It's not fighting.\"","Ye Wangchuan threw the two \"trash\" on the ground and elegantly rotated his wrist. A smile appeared on his lips. \"The children of the Beijing circle are expected to learn close combat when young. When I was 10, the Old Master sent me to learn how to fight for a few years. I'm not specialized, but I'm more than enough to protect you.\""]},{"number":3510,"title":"Chapter 3510: It Was Never One’s Reliance on the Other, but Mutual Reliance","paragraphs":["Chapter 3510: It Was Never One’s Reliance on the Other, but Mutual Reliance","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Nian Nian, walk behind me later.”","He spoke casually, but Qiao Nian heard the seriousness in his voice.","She smiled as she looked into his deep eyes and said arrogantly, “What a coincidence. I’ve also learned some close combat. Then let’s go together. I’ll leave my back to you.”","Ye Wangchuan knew her personality. She wasn’t the kind of girl who would hide behind men. Wasn’t this why he liked her?","He didn’t dwell on who was protecting who. In the blink of an eye, he returned to his usual lazy and noble self. “Okay.”","“Pack up. Let’s go find the diamond.”","* * *","At the same time, in the big villa where Ji Nan and the rest were watching the show.","All the forces of the independent continent were gathered here. Everyone was watching the broadcast on the big screen.","Then, an accident happened.","The big screen made a cracking sound. Then, the image shook and flickered.","Soon, it turned dark on Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan.","The surveillance cameras... were broken?!","Ji Nan was the first to stand up and sternly ask, “What’s going on? Why can’t we watch them all of a sudden?!”","The others were also surprised by the sudden change.","“Are the surveillance cameras broken?”","“It seems to have suddenly turned black.”","“Could it be that the signal over there is unstable?”","“That’s impossible.”","There were all sorts of comments.","Ji Nan showed the biggest reaction. The veins on his forehead bulged as he immediately called someone from the Hacker Alliance to adjust the computer in an attempt to find out the reason for the black screen.","The Hacker Alliance was not participating in this treasure hunt and only sent someone to see the results.","Who knew he would experience such a thing?","As it involved a problem in their professional field, they could only bite the bullet and help.","The bird’s nest-haired man sat in front of the computer and typed on the keyboard with both hands. Everyone only saw dazzling green codes on the big screen.","About 20 minutes later.","The bird’s nest-haired man frowned and slowly stopped. He turned to the crowd, wanting to say something but hesitating.","Ji Nan was worried about Qiao Nian’s safety. He supported himself against the back of his chair and asked, “What’s going on? Can it be fixed?”","Seeing he asked, Bird’s Nest Head did not hide it and said truthfully, “I took a look. The reason for the black screen is not a signal problem, nor is there a bug. It’s because the power switch at Mingshui Mansion is broken. We lost contact with the inside. That’s why we can’t capture the surveillance footage.”","“The power switch is broken?” Ji Nan’s heart skipped a beat.","Before he could react, someone jogged over in a panic.","“Oh no!”","“The main power switch at Mingshui Mansion exploded, and the entire electrical room was burned. An alarm was sounded, and the emergency system at the mansion was activated. It has already blocked all the exits. Now, no one can come out. We have to wait for the owner of Mingshui Mansion to enter the code before we can open the closed gate.”","The veins on the back of Ji Nan’s hand bulged. He glanced at Simon and the others’ expressions—it was as if they already knew. What else was there to be unclear about!","He gritted his teeth and tried to calm down. “We have to wait for the owner of Mingshui Mansion to come? Can’t she tell us the password?”","The person shook his head and said awkwardly, “No. Apart from the password, the ending code also requires fingerprints. If the owner doesn’t come, there won’t be any fingerprints. We can’t end the emergency defense system in the residence.”"]},{"number":3511,"title":"Chapter 3511: These People Have Already Calculated","paragraphs":["\"Ah!\"","Ji Nan had long expected this reason.","He felt that it was ridiculous, and his heart turned cold.","Simon did not give him a chance to continue. He took a step forward, looking mature. \"When will the owner of Mingshui Mansion come?\"","\"Madam Sally is on her way.\"","Finally a piece of good news.","However, Ji Nan felt that things weren't that simple.","Reality proved that he was right.","In this gloomy atmosphere, everyone waited for a full half an hour.","Logically speaking, Madam Sally should have arrived by now.","But at this moment, someone ran in with the same panicked expression as the person who had reported the bad news.","This time, what he said was even more unacceptable.","\"Madam Sally was in a car accident on the way. She has been rushed to the hospital with an injured left hand.\"","Ji Nan's temples throbbed fiercely. His hawk-like gaze landed on Simon and the others. Before Simon could speak, already having guessed who was behind this, he said coldly, \"President Simon, could the fingerprint to end the defense system happen to be from the left hand?\"","Simon's eyes turned cold. \"What do you mean, Young Master Ji?\"","Ji Nan did not retreat and stared at him coldly. \"You know what I mean.\"","Simon's face instantly turned cold as he scolded with a dark expression, \"I don't want this to happen, either. Young Master Ji seems to imply this matter has something to do with me. That's too abrupt! Is this how the Ji family sees the Chamber of Commerce Alliance? Or is this just Young Master Ji's take?!\"","Ji Nan did not speak, but his cold gaze did not leave. It was as if a mountain was pressing down on Simon's heart, not giving him a way out.","Ji Nan's attitude made it clear that regardless of whether the investigation pointed to him eventually, it had to be blamed on him. This wasn't the outcome Simon expected at the beginning.","He could only emphasize with a dark expression, \"This has nothing to do with me! I only found out about this just like you. We can think of a way together.\"","\"Then stop the activity,\" Ji Nan said resolutely.","The crowd was in an uproar.","\"Stop the activity at this time?\"","\"No way? We've been preparing for a long time.\"","\"They've already gone in, and you're asking to stop just like that. Isn't this nonsense?\"","As if he couldn't hear them, Ji Nan forcefully continued, \"Didn't you say you wanted to solve the immediate problem? Since the surveillance cameras are broken and the electric switch has been burned, to ensure the participants' safety, I request to stop the event immediately.\"","None of the Ji family members stood up to stop him.","It was obvious that they tacitly agreed with his actions.","Even the Second Elder, who had always valued the family's reputation, did not speak up this time. He only frowned and glanced at Ji Nan.","If he didn't stand out to object, the others would naturally not object either.","The Ji family seemed to be on his side.","\"President Simon, stop the activity!\"","Ji Nan showed a faint trace of Ji Lingfeng's usual sharp style. After all, the Ji family was the Ji family, and the fire in their bones could not change.","Simon fell into a daze and took a deep breath. He couldn't agree. \"This time, not only are the people from the Chamber of Commerce Alliance and the Ji family participating but also other large factions. It's not up to us to decide. Even if we want to solve the problem, we must agree on a solution that most people will accept. We can't do whatever you say.\"","Sure enough.","As soon as he finished speaking, many voices rose to support him."]},{"number":3512,"title":"Chapter 3512: Ji Nan: I’ll Wait Another Two Hours At Most","paragraphs":["Chapter 3512: Ji Nan: I’ll Wait Another Two Hours At Most","Editor: Atlas Studios","The main reason was that they had received confidential news a few days ago. That was, Qiao Nian had the Tsar’s blueprint.","These people had already reached a tacit understanding in private. They wanted to take this opportunity to obtain the priceless blueprint from the girl!","Therefore, no one would give up this excellent opportunity.","Moreover, the broken surveillance cameras, the burned power switch, Madam Sally’s car accident, and her injured left hand... All of this was part of their plan.","Qiao Nian was their prey.","Everything was ready.","How could these people be willing to give up?","Most of the forces participating in this event opposed Ji Nan’s request to stop the event. Some even retorted unhappily.","“The power switch in Mingshui Hall is burned, so we can’t see the surveillance footage. It’s not like they’re really in any danger. If Young Master Ji is worried, isn’t the Hacker Alliance’s person still around? Later, get him to contact Madam Sally and ask about the emergency defense system. Then, we can think of a way to open the gate. Young Master Ji, do you have to be so agitated?”","“That’s right. I think this is a good idea.”","“Let’s follow this!”","Silence.","Ji Nan knew that this was a premeditated scheme. He was so angry that his shoulders trembled. He gritted his teeth and was about to say something.","However, at this moment, Old Madam Xie interjected sarcastically from the corner, “It’s not a big deal. How can the participants bite and eat her? With her personality, it’s good enough if she doesn’t harm others. How can others harm her?”","Mother Xie supported Old Madam Xie and elegantly tucked her hair behind her ear before gently saying, “That’s right, Ji Nan. You’re still young and too impulsive. Don’t let everyone think the Ji family can’t afford to lose.”","One mentioned Qiao Nian, while the other mentioned the Ji family.","It sounded like they were worried about Ji Nan.","In reality, they were forcing him.","If Ji Nan insisted on stopping the event, it would be a clear sign to everyone that worrying about Qiao Nian’s safety was not the point. It was that they couldn’t afford to lose!","If Ji Nan insisted on stopping the event, it would be a clear sign to everyone that his worry about Qiao Nian’s safety was fake. In fact, even if the Ji family was afraid of losing, they couldn’t afford to lose!","At this moment, the Second Elder grabbed his hand and gestured for him to calm down. He whispered in his ear, “Miss Qiao did now enter unprepared.”","“But...”","Ji Nan still felt that Qiao Nian was facing too much danger inside.","Second Elder exerted more strength and reminded him, “You forgot, we even arranged for people to help her inside. Things aren’t as bad as you think. We have to believe in Miss Qiao’s ability, and also the ability of that person from Bright Gate. At least don’t drag them down.”","Ji Nan’s expression changed slightly. It was obvious that he knew Qiao Nian’s ability.","However, he was still worried. “Two hours. I’ll wait at most two hours. If I don’t hear from them in two hours, I’ll stop the competition no matter what.”","Second Elder actually did not go against him this time. He nodded. “Yes, that’s what I mean.”","Two hours was a suitable time frame.","After all, Qiao Nian was representing the Ji family this time. He also prioritized her safety.","Otherwise, if word got out, the Ji family would become a laughingstock.","When Ji Nan looked up again, his handsome face was much calmer. He only glanced in the direction of the Xie family and no longer looked at Old Madam Xie and Mother Xie.","It was obvious that he didn’t want to talk to them anymore."]},{"number":3513,"title":"Chapter 3513: It’s Good That He’s Inside","paragraphs":["Chapter 3513: It’s Good That He’s Inside","Editor: Atlas Studios","Seeing his attitude, Old Madam Xie’s temples throbbed as she suppressed her anger. “What does he mean by this?”","Mother Xie’s mind was filled with Qiao Nian’s matters. She patted her arm nonchalantly and comforted her. “Ji Nan is just too young and likes to act on impulse. Mom, ignore him.”","“I’m his biological grandma!”","Old Madam Xie still couldn’t take it lying down. “I’m his biological grandma. So what if I say something to him? He has to show me face in public.”","And it was for an outsider.","In Old Madam Xie’s opinion, Qiao Nian and Ji Nan’s blood relations were not worth mentioning. They definitely couldn’t compare to her.","She really could not understand why Xie Yun, Ji Nan, Xie Tingyun, and Nan Tianyi... all fell out with her for Qiao Nian.","“What kind of bewitching potion did Qiao Nian give them? Are all of them clueless?!”","Mother Xie comforted her patiently, unable to suppress the gloating in her voice. “Mom, don’t be angry. It’s not worth it.”","Silence.","Not waiting for Old Madam Xie to speak, she leaned close to her ear and said meaningfully, “Why do you care about her? It’s not certain if this person will still be alive after today.”","According to what she had heard that night, many forces in the independent continent wanted to take this opportunity to get rid of Qiao Nian, this uncontrollable person.","Mother Xie couldn’t suppress her smile. “We just have to wait for the good news.”","...","While waiting, Feng Yu rushed over.","He first asked someone what was going on.","He learned there was a ‘small accident’ in Mingshui Mansion and that the electric switch had been triggered, and no one outside could enter.","Qiao Nian and the others were also locked up inside.","Feng Yu’s face immediately darkened.","Like Ji Nan, he looked for Simon and the others to discuss the suspension of the event.","However, Simon and the others still said the same thing. They did not reject it outright, but they didn’t give a definite answer either. They shied away from so many factions participating and said they wanted to organize a meeting to vote and decide if they should stop the event...","Feng Yu was no fool.","He understood the sly old foxes of the independent continent better than Ji Nan. He knew that Simon and the others were just trying to stall for time.","He would drag it out until the dust settled inside.","Feng Yu was furious.","However, he wasn’t Ji Lingfeng.","The First Research Institute was no longer under the Ji family.","The First Research Institute had a high status but no real power. Feng Yu really didn’t know what to do when faced with such a situation.","He could only look for Ji Nan and the others.","“Elder Feng.”","Ji Nan knew about his relationship with Qiao Nian and greeted him respectfully.","“Mm.” Feng Yu’s expression was still not good. Seeing he was staring at the Hacker Alliance’s person trying to repair the system, he raised his chin slightly and asked, “How’s the progress?”","Ji Nan’s gaze landed on the computer in front of Bird’s Nest Head. His expression was serious and inexplicably cold. “The hospital just sent the code. I don’t know how long it will take.”","Silence.","Feng Yu had already expected this. He pinched his eyebrows. His sharp gaze landed on him again. “Before the surveillance cameras broke, did you see what Nian Nian was doing?”","Ji Nan and the others came early, and the surveillance cameras weren’t broken yet.","The scene flashed to Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan and then the screen went black.","Ji Nan told Feng Yu everything.","Feng Yu’s tense muscles relaxed when he heard that Ye Wangchuan was also inside. With some color back on his face, he said in a daze, “It’s good that he’s inside.”"]},{"number":3514,"title":"Chapter 3514: Sister Nian: Do You Want to Bet on It?","paragraphs":["Seconds ticked by.","In the big villa outside Mingshui Mansion, everyone had their own thoughts.","The people from the Xie family were still waiting to watch the show.","Simon and the others were also thinking about how to stall for time.","Everyone seemed to have agreed to wait for the final 'result' before performing the last scene.","***","However, the situation in Mingshui Mansion was different from what they had imagined. \"17.\"","The girl's voice was a little casual, cold, and dry.","At the same time, she heard someone kicking the door behind her, right on the heels of the muffled sound of the silent gun found by Ye Wangchuan.","\"18, 19.\"","He was still in the mood to chuckle. He seemed quite happy.","\"Looks like I'm luckier than you. Two at the same time. Opened a double-yolked egg.\"","Qiao Nian glanced at him. She couldn't see his expression clearly in the dark and felt quite speechless.","Where did his desire to win come from?","However, she only thought so in her heart.","She was even more straightforward than before. She looked up from the corner of her eye and said, \"Be careful.\" Then, she pulled him back before shooting accurately.","Qiao Nian lowered the pistol and reloaded the gun. There was a coldness between her eyebrows, and her movements were smooth as she reloaded the firearm.","The entire process took less than 1.5 seconds.","This speed was enough in the professional field.","She didn't hide anything. She was quite good at it.","Qiao Nian changed the magazine and pulled down her hoodie to cover her eyes, revealing only her sharp chin. Her lines were smooth and beautiful.","She wanted to have fun, so she deliberately gave a certain someone a look in return. She licked her red lips and said arrogantly, \"We're even.\"","Ye Wangchuan immediately reacted.","She meant that they were even in terms of numbers.","He curled his thin lips and invited her lazily, \"Isn't there still more than half left? Continue?\" \"Sure.\"","The girl agreed readily. But she felt that it was meaningless to continue. She took the initiative to mention it. \"I remember you have a modified Aston Martin in your garage.\"","Ye Wangchuan had several cars in his garage in Beijing, except for the Phaeton he used every day.","He also had a few sports cars collecting dust.","In any case, Qiao Nian had never seen him drive them.","However, she sharply remembered seeing a modified racing car.","The lines of the fiery red sports car were smooth and arrogant. It looked very cool.","She had taken a fancy to it at first glance.","However, she had just reported to Qing University then. She was only a student, so it was not suitable for her to drive such a flashy car.","She suddenly remembered Bo Jingxing mentioning a mountain road dedicated to sports cars in the suburbs of Beijing.","In the past, the few of them often arranged to meet at the mountain road to race.","Qiao Nian suddenly wanted it.","\"Do you want to bet on it?\"","The girl's long eyelashes lowered, quite stylish. Her tone was relaxed. It wasn't like they were surrounded, but rather like they surrounded dozens of people.","\"If I win, the car is mine.","\"If I lose, you can do whatever you want with me.\"","\"How about it?\"","In the darkness, Ye Wangchuan was silent for a second, mainly because he did not expect her","to remember what cars were in his garage and even take a fancy to his favorite modified sports","car.","Actually, as long as Qiao Nian asked, he would give her 10 such cars. It wasn't like he couldn't afford it."]},{"number":3515,"title":"Chapter 3515: They’re Still in the Mood to Chat?","paragraphs":["However, he could hear the excitement in Qiao Nian's tone. She seemed to want to drive that car out to play.","He rubbed his swollen temples and reminded her, \"The old man will mess with me if he finds out.\"","\"Mm.\"","Silence.","Ye Wangchuan added, \"There's also Old Master Jiang and your father. Jiang Li and the others will settle scores with me when they find out.\"","Qiao Nian stood casually with her hands by her side as she said self-righteously, \"Otherwise, how can it be called a bet?\"","She was undoubtedly saying, \"Otherwise, I'd be letting you win for nothing.\"","Ye Wangchuan's thin lips curled up, but he did not refuse. \"You're at my mercy if you lose?\"","Qiao Nian had said it casually, mainly because she felt that it was unlikely that she would lose. After all, she had never lost except when she was willing.","However, hearing his smiling tone, her elbow suddenly felt sore, and she recalled a certain bad memory.","However, she was the one who said it. There was no reason for her to admit defeat.","\"Mm.\"","\"Then it's a bet.\" Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and reloaded his gun. He restrained his laziness and finally became a little serious. \"Don't cry if you lose.\"","Qiao Nian was speechless.","**","Not far away, the people hiding in the dark watched the leisurely conversation between man and woman in the corridor.","For a moment, they doubted their ears.","\"They... are chatting? They're even talking and laughing?\"","\"I see her.\"","The place where they were hiding was relatively hidden. They spoke softly and were difficult to detect, so they could still barely communicate.","However, their heartbeats were louder than their voices.","It was unbelievable.","\"Did they make a mistake? They're still in the mood to chat at such a time? And the atmosphere is good.\"","Compared to his unbelievable tone, the other person was dejected and uneasy.","\"Didn't you see that the people who ambushed them just now are all gone?\"","He was being polite.","He had seen the situation clearly just now. The other forces were not lying in ambush at all. It was more like they had been wiped out by Qiao Nian and the others.","However, the two targets this time seemed to be hunting them instead... He couldn't accept such a huge psychological contrast for a moment.","\"Are all the people from the First Research Institute so fierce? Aren't they in the research field? Do they even know how to use guns?\"","He saw it clearly.","It took the girl at most two seconds to change magazines.","Her movements were adept.","Moreover, her blind sniping was exceptionally accurate.","Her accuracy was comparable to that of a professional sniper. She was extremely talented.","And that man was also omnipotent.","The second he kicked the door open.","From his angle, he couldn't see how that person did it, but from the results, the two people inside had no room to fight back.","Fast, accurate, and ruthless.","Like a werewolf.","It was fine if it was just a ruthless person, but they both were ruthless.","If this continued, his instinct told him that the outcome would be beyond the President's expectations. It was completely different from what they had imagined.","Previously, they had planned to ambush the girl and kill her first. They would control her and force her to tell them the Tsar's blueprint. Then, they would create an accident.","The goal was to make her disappear from this world reasonably.","And yet...","They were ambushed.","The two of them were searching for their existence layer by layer. They captured and dealt with anyone in their way faster than in a Crossfire game.","He also noticed that Qiao Nian had stuck something on it with chewing gum.","The signals they brought in all failed.","Without signal and communication, these people who had originally discussed attacking together immediately turned into a pile of scattered sand. They could only hide in the darkness and not dare come out of their hiding spots."]},{"number":3516,"title":"Chapter 3516: Who Is Surrounding Whom?","paragraphs":["\"Do you think we'll fail?\" he muttered softly for some reason.","His companion also wasn't confident. He barely managed to calm down. \"That won't happen. We still have a trump card. Have you forgotten?\"","They weren't afraid of Qiao Nian's power, as long as they still had that trump card.","It would be very difficult for her to leave Mingshui Mansion alive!","It was dark outside.","In Mingshui Mansion, the people from the various factions looked as if they had seen a ghost.","Previously, Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan had been restraining themselves. Now, they seemed to have gone crazy. One was faster and more ruthless than the other.","A good treasure-hunting game turned into hide-and-seek.","The key was that everyone else was hiding.","Once they were found, if they did not resist, they would be shot. If they resisted... they might as well not resist.","They couldn't beat them in close combat, nor could they beat them in a sneak attack.","Mingshui Mansion was filled with miserable winds and rain.","The members of the various forces participating in this operation complained endlessly. They all regretted participating in this operation back then.","Especially the mercenaries.","Logically speaking, this dark space due to the power outage should be their home ground.","They brought a lot of professional tracking equipment, but who knew they would be tracked instead?","The most ruthless person was that Asian man.","After capturing one of their people, he didn't finish him off, he just knocked him out and threw him in the corridor. In the end, the people who went to check on him were sent up one after another like the Calabash Brothers saving their grandfather.","Finally.","The last floor of Mingshui Mansion had almost been fully searched.","Qiao Nian turned her wrist and counted. \"25.\"","Ye Wangchuan smiled. \"What a coincidence. I took out 25 too.\" \"The same?\"","Qiao Nian was stunned. She didn't expect such a coincidence.","Coincidentally, her gaze landed on the last room not far away. She raised her eyebrows, pulled her baseball cap, and walked forward.","\"There's one last room.\"","Ye Wangchuan didn't let her open the door this time. He pulled her back and opened the door. His hawk-like gaze swept the room and found someone lying on the ground. He didn't know who did it.","He did not move aside immediately. Instead, he locked his gaze on the closet and suddenly said lazily, \"Come out.\"","Qiao Nian heard a giggle from the closet. Soon, someone rolled out, looking quite miserable. He immediately raised his hands in surrender and muttered, \"D-Don't attack. We're on the same side.\"","Ye Wangchuan narrowed his eyes and looked back at Qiao Nian.","Qiao Nian looked at him with an inexplicable expression before suddenly remembering something. She glanced at the person's armband. It was number 15.","She remembered Ji Nan telling her that Number 9 and 15 were their people.","At this moment, the person hurriedly said, \"Second Elder sent me. Did Second Elder not mention me to you? I'm not a bad person.\"","Qiao Nian only asked him, \"Why are you here?\"","The man hesitated before explaining in a low voice, \"When I came in, I realized that the power had suddenly been cut off, so I looked for you. I couldn't find you, but I found Number 9. I saw him lying here holding the diamond. I didn't know what to do, so I've been guarding here.\"","Seeing that Qiao Nian was silent, he took the initiative to say worriedly, \"Number 9 seems to be injured.","\"He might have been injured trying to get the diamond. He barely made it here before he passed out, perhaps because of blood loss.\""]},{"number":3517,"title":"Chapter 3517: Sister Nian Doesn’t Trust Him, She Trusts Master Wang","paragraphs":["Ye Wangchuan could tell at a glance that the man was hiding evil intentions. He narrowed his eyes and looked at Qiao Nian.","It was unclear if she had realized something was wrong, but she casually pulled the collar of her sweater. Her slightly cold chin hidden under the sweater did not show any emotions.","\"Oh, so you've been waiting for me here.\"","Silence.","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and looked at her again.","Number 15 couldn't figure out what she meant and mumbled, \"I'm indebted to Second Elder. He heard that I was going to represent the Three Nine Gate in this treasure hunt and especially called me over. He mentioned you and asked me to take care of you.","\"Although I'm just a small fry, I know how to repay favors. So...\" He didn't know if it was because Qiao Nian's gaze was too sharp, but his throat was slightly blocked, and he couldn't continue.","However, Qiao Nian stood at the door with her hands in her pockets. Seeing that he stopped, she smiled and urged him, \"Continue.\"","Number 15's scalp went numb. \"So don't worry, Miss Qiao. I'll definitely stand on your side.\"","\"Oh.\" The girl leaned against the door lazily. Her shadow was sharp, and it was impossible to tell if she believed him.","However, he had already said so much.","Number 15 could only brace himself and go on. \"Miss Qiao, aren't you going to take a look at Number 9? He hasn't woken up yet.","\"I heard from Second Elder that you know medicine. Can you take a look at him?\"","After saying that, he felt uncertain.","He wondered if Qiao Nian would fall for it.","Just as he hesitated, he heard the girl's heavenly voice.","\"Okay, let me take a look.\"","Number 15 was pleasantly surprised to see that the other party had retracted her undisciplined aura and was walking towards them unguarded. Moreover, he was squatting beside Number 9 with his hands clasped, as if he was checking on him....","Lup-dup lup-dup lup-dup.","His heart raced. He knew that opportunity waited for no man.","Number 15 did not hesitate. Just as the girl lowered her head to check on the unconscious man on the ground, his hand touched the pistol on his waist.","At that moment, the black muzzle was aimed at the person before him.","It was impossible to miss at this distance.","He would definitely take Qiao Nian's life!","A trace of nervousness flashed across his eyes. At the same time, his mouth curled into a pitiful smile, as if he was sympathizing with a young life that was about to be lost. But that was true.","The order he received was that it would be best if he could get the Tsar's blueprint before taking action. If he couldn't get it, he would have no choice but to take Qiao Nian's life! Which meant that...","He had only received one order-Qiao Nian had to die!","A trace of pity flashed across the man's turbid brown eyes like a shooting star. What a pity. She was quite a beautiful Asian woman.","His finger was already on the trigger, pushing down-","Qiao Nian did not seem to feel any danger. Her head was still lowered, and her fragile back was exposed as she checked the person on the ground.","\"Bang!\"","A muffled gunshot rang out.","She looked up and saw that the man who had just said \"Second Elder did me a favor\" and \"Although I'm a small fry, I know how to repay favors\", his face was filled with disbelief. In an instant, he lost his strength. The gun slid from his hand and fell to the ground with a thud. It rolled twice before stopping at Qiao Nian's feet as if silently mocking her.","He saw the girl's cold and fair hand pick up the gun by her feet. Without looking back, she said to the man behind her, \"26. You win.\""]},{"number":3518,"title":"Chapter 3518: Who Else Could It Be, My Good Grandma","paragraphs":["Chapter 3518: Who Else Could It Be, My Good Grandma","Editor: Atlas Studios","The Asian man who was leaning against the door, whom he had not taken seriously, sneered and said in a contemptuous and hoarse voice, “He’s not considered a human.”","The sounds around him gradually disappeared.","He fell to the ground feeling endless shock and panic. His limbs began to turn cold, and his vision fell into darkness...","That person had only said to be careful of Qiao Nian. He had never told him that Qiao Nian had a companion. Moreover, he shot faster than him.","What went wrong?","Therefore, it was a trap when she ‘trusted’ him, walked up to them unguardedly, and squatted down to check on the downed person’s injuries.","She had trusted her back to another person.","From the beginning, he had ignored the existence of a third person!","...","Qiao Nian heard the thud and expressionlessly asked, “Is he dead?”","Ye Wangchuan did not look.","He didn’t need to look to know the result, so he did not answer the girl’s question directly. Instead, he walked over and squatted beside her to feel Number 9’s pulse.","His heart was still beating.","He wasn’t dead yet.","He changed the topic without a trace. “Do you think those old men want you dead?”","Qiao Nian had already checked on Number 9 and knew he was just unconscious. Hearing this, she retracted her hand. Her clear eyes were emotionless as she stood up and said casually, “No.”","Ye Wangchuan asked just to be sure.","Qiao Nian lowered her black eyelashes and stuffed her hands into her pockets. She actually explained to him, “I’m representing the Ji family this time. No matter how much they want me to die, they won’t go after me now.","“There’s another reason.”","Qiao Nian said calmly, “I’ve interacted with him a few times. He values benefits but doesn’t go after the Ji family because of Ji Hongyuan and the others.”","Second Elder wasn’t a good person, nor was he very likable.","However, he could be considered someone with a bottom line.","Even when it came to the pier, he only pursued benefits and did not plot against Ji Lingfeng or Ji Nan’s lives.","Therefore, Qiao Nian’s sixth sense told her it wasn’t him.","“Then who do you think it is?” Ye Wangchuan asked with interest, not knowing she was relying purely on her sixth sense.","Qiao Nian pursed her lips and did not speak. After about two seconds, she slowly spoke in the darkness. “Pfft, my good grandmother.”","In this world, only Nie Qingru simply wanted her dead, even if there were no benefits!","* * *","Outside.","Two hours passed in the blink of an eye.","The Hacker Alliance had yet to crack Mingshui Mansion’s defense system. Ji Nan gradually became anxious and urged Bird’s Nest Head to hurry up a few times.","Bird’s Nest Head was also having a headache. He tried his best to speed up.","However, he understood by now that Mingshui Mansion’s defense system was created by the illegal district’s Red Alliance. It wasn’t that simple to crack it.","“Can you do it or not?”","Ji Nan was a little frustrated.","Bird’s Nest Head stared at the computer screen without moving. He was clueless and still wanted to talk to him. “I can decipher it, but I still need some time.”","“Is this damn system that difficult?” Ji Nan opened his mouth. “Didn’t you say there’s no system that your Hacker Alliance can’t crack?”","Bird’s Nest Head finally stopped and turned around to look at him. With dark circles under his slovenly face, he was so pale that he looked malnourished. However, he had no expression and his words were quite infuriating."]},{"number":3519,"title":"Chapter 3519: Someone Hacked the Computer and Was Breaking This System","paragraphs":["\"Young Master Ji, you should be glad that this system wasn't created by that person from the Red Alliance but by their main member, Slim Waist Control. Otherwise, even if you strangle me to death today, I won't be able to crack it.\"","Silence.","Bird's Nest Head didn't want to talk to him anymore. There was no expression on his face, but","his eyes flashed with excitement as he continued deciphering.","This kind of competition between top hackers excited him to no end.","Even if Ji Nan didn't rush him, he would still try his best to see how long it would take to decipher Slim Waist Control's defense system.","On the other side.","Feng Yu could no longer sit still.","He found Simon and the others again and said with a serious expression, \"It's been more than two hours, and there's still no news from Mingshui Mansion. President Simon, can we officially talk about stopping this event now?\"","Simon was also waiting for news.","He straightened his suit and pretended to be calm as he took a sip of coffee. He said calmly, \"Isn't Dean Feng too anxious?\"","He looked meaningfully at Ji Nan and Bird's Nest Head.","\"Isn't the Hacker Alliance deciphering the defense system? When they're done, we'll naturally know what's happening inside.\"","\"But...\" Who knew what would happen in this period?","\"The First Research Institute isn't participating in this event. Isn't Dean Feng a little too concerned about it?\"","Simon didn't give him a chance to finish and ambiguously said, \"Qiao Nian doesn't seem to be from the First Research Institute anymore.\"","Feng Yu's gaze sharpened. His old and wise eyes almost saw through the scheme and malice in the other party's eyes.","The series of 'accidents' in Mingshui Mansion were not accidents.","Simon was definitely involved in this.","Feng Yu had two thoughts in his mind. He was almost certain that Qiao Nian was in danger, and the other party had made up their mind to achieve their goal.","What other motives could they have?","Feng Yu couldn't sit still anymore.","His expression turned ugly as he stared fixedly at the mature man before him, with an additional trace of power in his eyes.","\"President Simon, are you sure you want to go against me now? Then I'll put it this way. Although Qiao Nian has nothing to do with the First Research Institute, she will always be my successor. Whoever touches her will be going against me!\"","Feng Yu continued, \"I'm old, but I can still move. I'm not a pushover!\"","Simon felt his fierce hostility. It seemed he was serious. His mouth stiffened as he forced a smile and tried to smooth things over. \"Dean Feng, you're being too serious. That's not what I meant. I'm just saying that most of the forces in the independent continent are involved this time. I can't make the decision even if you ask me to stop the activity... We still have to discuss this slowly...\"","Just as they were talking...","On Ji Nan's side, Bird's Nest Head, squatting on the swivel chair, stared at the code on the computer screen. He grabbed his messy hair and said in disbelief, \"Oh my god, it's been hacked again?\"","He wasn't loud.","However, all of Ji Nan's attention was on him. He immediately grabbed his shoulder. \"What do you mean by hacked again? Your computer was hacked? Then Mingshui Mansion...\" \"No.\"","Bird's Nest Head knew what he was worried about and grabbed his arm for him to see. \"I'm saying that someone hacked into the computer and is also trying to crack this system.\""]},{"number":3520,"title":"Chapter 3520: Sun, It’s The Qiao Nian You’re Talking About","paragraphs":["Chapter 3520: Sun, It’s The Qiao Nian You’re Talking About","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ji Nan was a little dumbfounded. His brain couldn’t process what was going on, and he was speechless.","Who, aside from them, would try to crack Mingshui Mansion’s defense system at this time?","The more Bird’s Nest Head looked at it, the more excited he became. Afraid that Ji Nan would not understand, he pointed at the rapidly refreshing code on the computer screen and said, “Look, they took over after I analyzed half of the code, but they’re much faster than me. At this speed, they’ll crack the defense system in a few minutes.”","In the beginning, he explained a few sentences to Ji Nan, but later on, he completely forgot about Ji Nan’s existence. He was so engrossed in looking at the code on the screen that he wondered if he was exclaiming.","“Gosh, this is really tricky!”","“Hiss~ Why didn’t I think from this angle... Is this hand speed real?”","Bird’s Nest Head saw the hidden trap in the defense system and opened his mouth slightly. “I didn’t expect Slim Waist Control to hide a self-destruct program. If I had continued just now, I’m afraid I would have triggered it.”","10 minutes.","Qiao Nian used only 10 minutes.","The progress bar went from 0% to 100% in only 10 minutes.","Bird’s Nest Head saw with his own eyes the program that the other party had deciphered. It was even solved without using the password of the owner of Mingshui Mansion.","‘Eliminating Danger’ popped up on the computer screen.","Then, there was a beeping sound.","Bird’s Nest Head scratched his head, his eyes emitting a burning light. “...Is this the standard of the Red Alliance in the illegal district?”","Or rather, was this Sun’s true standard?","No wonder every hacker treated her as their lifelong pursuit.","Some people were born to be a lighthouse in this field. It was enough to illuminate the path ahead of those who pursued the limit in this field and show them what the peak was like.","Bird’s Nest Head felt he had witnessed the peak of hacking today. His blood surged, and he was no longer in the mood to stay.","He pushed the chair aside and stood up, then said to Ji Nan, “The door to Mingshui Mansion is already open. I still have something on, so I’ll take my leave first.”","After saying that, he hurriedly left.","Ji Nan also saw the words ‘eliminating danger’ on the display screen above his head. However, he was still a little confused and could not recover from the unforeseen event. He reflexively grabbed Bird’s Nest Head, who was about to leave, and asked, “You just said that the door of the Mingshui Mansion has opened... Who deciphered the defense system?”","Bird’s Nest Head glanced at him. “You know the person. Sun, the person you people refer to as Qiao Nian.”","... It was Nian Nian.","Ji Nan relaxed and let go.","Bird’s Nest Head left without looking back. He was busy recalling the C-language operation he had just seen.","...","They weren’t the only ones present. Simon, Feng Yu, Old Madam Xie, Mother Xie, and the others were all there.","Ji Nan did not deliberately lower his voice when he spoke to Bird’s Nest Head. In addition, everyone was paying attention to them. As long as one wasn’t deaf, they would hear what Bird’s Nest Head said.","Old Madam Xie’s face showed disbelief. “She’s not dead?”","Mother Xie’s face showed an ugly expression. She couldn’t hide her disappointment. “How could that be? Didn’t they say that she was doomed this time? So many people and they still couldn’t take her life?”","They spoke softly, but Feng Yu wasn’t far away and happened to hear them.","He frowned but did not question them.","He knew the Xie family had a conflict with Qiao Nian because of Xie Xinyao, but he did not expect them to look forward to Qiao Nian’s death."]},{"number":3521,"title":"Chapter 3521: Let’s Go Take a Look Too","paragraphs":["Chapter 3521: Let’s Go Take a Look Too","Editor: Atlas Studios","Unexpectedly, Old Madam Xie wasn’t done yet. With strong resentment, she let out a curse before saying, “No, we must have heard wrong. The person from the Hacker Alliance didn’t go in. How would he know the situation inside? That person might have died inside long ago.”","Feng Yu couldn’t take it anymore. He frowned and turned to Ji Nan, about to ask him what he thought.","Ji Nan spoke first. “He said that the door of Mingshui Mansion is open. Elder Feng, let’s go over and take a look.”","Feng Yu’s belly was full of words, but he only said, “Alright.”","Updated by N○vG○.c○","Compared to those trivial matters, the most important thing now was to ensure Qiao Nian’s safety. The rest could be discussed later.","Ji Nan and Feng Yu did not greet the others. They brought the Ji family members and went to Mingshui Mansion.","The others in the villa looked at each other, not understanding what was going on.","“Did you hear what the person from the Hacker Alliance said? They said that Qiao Nian unlocked Mingshui Mansion’s defense system from the inside.”","“It must be fake! I didn’t see a computer among the things she brought.”","“But the Hacker Alliance didn’t participate in the treasure hunt. There’s no need to lie...”","The large group of people led by Simon did not look good.","Someone couldn’t hold it in anymore and asked with a low voice, “President Simon, didn’t you say nothing would go wrong this time? I only got involved because I believe in your Chamber of Commerce Alliance. If Qiao Nian is fine, what should we do?!”","Qiao Nian was backed by the Ji family and Bright Gate, and Feng Yu’s reaction just now did not seem like he had cut ties with her.","Updated by N○vG○.c○","They vaguely regretted participating in this conspiracy.","However, some people remained optimistic.","“What’s the hurry?”","Silence.","“Did you see for yourself that she’s fine?” The speaker was a man with a goatee. He made small talk with his hand and his triangular eyes were sinister. His mouth curled up in disdain. It was obvious that he didn’t take Qiao Nian seriously. “We’ve called all the experienced mercenaries this time. No matter how powerful she is, she’s just a little girl in her early twenties. She didn’t bring any weapons. How much trouble can she cause? You’re too timid. Even a small commotion can scare you.”","“You!”","“Ding Xu, if you’re so afraid, let’s go over and take a look.”","The people from Three Nine Gate had always had a good relationship with the Chamber of Commerce Alliance. The goatee man did not give the person who questioned Simon any face, calling him by name.","He was so confident because, not only did he not believe that Qiao Nian, a little girl in her early twenties, could cause trouble, but also because of a secret that only he and Simon knew.","That was Number 15, whom they had arranged.","In fact, after the Ji family’s Second Elder approached their people, they immediately knew about this matter. Then, they beat them at their own game and made Number 15 a sharp blade, just waiting for a suitable opportunity to stab Qiao Nian in the back!","This was also the reason why he was fearless.","He was confident that Qiao Nian was already a dead person.","Hence, the goatee man curled his lips and invited the others with disdain. “Let’s not stand here either. Let’s go to Mingshui Mansion to take a look.”","He deliberately lowered his voice when arguing with Ding Xu, but he did not deliberately lower his voice when he called everyone to Mingshui Mansion. Many people heard him.","Old Madam Xie and the others all looked at him."]},{"number":3522,"title":"Chapter 3522: Only Sister Nian Walked Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 3522: Only Sister Nian Walked Out","Editor: Atlas Studios","The Three Nine Gate could only be considered an inferior faction in the independent continent. They barely qualified to participate in the treasure hunt.","This was the goatee man’s most glorious time.","The goateed man enjoyed everyone’s gazes very much.","“If the door of Mingshui Mansion is really opened, someone should have already come out with the diamond.”","Updated by N○vG○.c○","He did not forget to keep them in suspense. “I wonder who got the diamond this time.”","The Xie family did not participate. Whoever got the diamond had nothing to do with them.","However, Old Madam Xie interrupted, “In the past, it was always the Ji family. I’m afraid there will be a change this year.”","She was certain that the Ji family would not be able to get first place this year.","Not all the factions participated in the encirclement this time. Some factions chose to protect themselves and not go after either side.","Hence, when Old Madam Xie spoke up for an outsider, they couldn’t help but look at her sideways.","Father Xie did not come today.","If he was here, he might be so angry at his mother that he would have a heart attack again.","Unfortunately, it was Mother Xie there. Mother Xie only held the old lady’s arm and did not even try to persuade her. She couldn’t wait for the old lady to say more.","Updated by N○vG○.c○","Someone in the crowd took the initiative to mention it.","“I think the Chamber of Commerce Alliance might win this year.”","“They’re strong this year. Their mercenary seems to be one of the top on the dark web. He’s known as the King of the Jungle.”","“Ah, it just so happens that in a dark environment, his chances of winning are very high.”","“Looks like the Chamber of Commerce Alliance won this time.”","“I also think the Chamber of Commerce Alliance won.”","Many people were whispering.","Simon heard them. Logically speaking, he should be happy, but for some reason, he felt a strong sense of uneasiness in his heart.","The words of the Hacker Alliance’s person kept replaying in his mind. “Who else could it be? It’s that person you know, Sun, who you people call Qiao Nian.”","His fingers curled into a fist. Dressed in a suit and an upright posture, no one could tell he was feeling uneasy.","If it was really Qiao Nian, it meant that their plan had failed.","If his plan failed, could the Chamber of Commerce Alliance still win this treasure hunt as expected?!","Simon had no idea.","However, most of the people present were waiting for him to speak. Simon could only brace himself and say calmly, “Everyone, let’s go take a look.”","* * *","They rushed to Mingshui Mansion.","Outside were the people from the Ji family and the First Research Institute.","Ji Nan and Feng Yu should have already gone in.","Simon frowned and was about to go in... when he saw the people coming out.","Ji Nan walked in front, looking normal.","A girl followed closely behind him. Wearing a sweater and a baseball cap, a bag was slung over her shoulder, her hands were in her pockets, and she did not look injured. In fact, her footsteps were relaxed, and she looked calm and carefree.","Her head was lowered and she was playing with her cell phone.","It seemed like Ji Nan had handed it to her.","The moment the girl appeared, the large group following Simon fell silent as if they were mute...","Everyone stared fixedly at the girl, their expressions white as if they had seen a ghost.","Mother Xie’s face was even paler. She couldn’t believe it. “S-She’s really fine...”","Qiao Nian was actually fine. She walked out without even a scratch.","If they had not seen it with their own eyes, who would have believed it?","One had to know that just a second ago, everyone tacitly agreed that she must have died inside!"]},{"number":3523,"title":"Chapter 3523: Throwing the Diamond to Ji Nan","paragraphs":["\"Miss Qiao.\"","Mo Dong had also rushed over with the people from Bright Gate. Seeing Qiao Nian coming out, he greeted the girl without any surprise.","Then, he seemed to notice the man walking beside Qiao Nian. He lowered his head slightly and respectfully greeted him, \"Master Wang.\"","Ye Wangchuan only glanced at the stunned crowd. He restrained the darkness in his eyes and replied, \"Mm.\"","Feng Yu walked at the back, nagging the girl. \"Did you already know? If you knew, why didn't you tell me? You took too much risk! If anything happens to you, how am I going to explain it to your mother? Aren't you making me unable to rest in peace even after I die?","\"And Deputy Director, he still doesn't know about you. He's been making trouble for the past few days. If anything happens to you again, I... won't be able to explain it to him.\"","Everyone looked at him. Feng Yu was so angry that he didn't care about them. He ignored them all and followed the girl.","The girl felt a headache from his nagging. Her gaze finally left the cell phone and landed on him. Her voice was slightly hoarse but patient. \"I understand. It won't happen again.\"","Feng Yu was stunned and immediately relented. \"You're coaxing a child? With your temper, next time... Sigh! Forget it! It's good as long as you're fine.\"","Seeming to have just noticed the others, he stopped talking and turned to Simon and the others, returning to his usual coldness.","\"President Simon, I'm afraid you won't be able to see the commotion.\"","Simon's expression was ugly. He probably did not expect Feng Yu to call him out. After a short moment of shock, he forced a smile. \"Dean, you must be joking. I also came to see how","everyone was doing. It's good to see that they're fine.\"","He struggled to say the last few words.","If Qiao Nian was fine, it meant that... he had failed.","\"That's strange. Where are the others? Why are you the only ones out?\" Old Madam Xie noticed that only Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan had come out. It seemed that no one had come out after them.","With her interruption, everyone present realized this problem. That's right, why were Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan the only ones who came out?","What about the others?","They looked at Ji Nan in unison.","The main reason was that both Qiao Nian and Ye Wangchuan's auras were strong and were not to be trifled with. Feng Yu's status in the independent continent was extraordinary, and he was also not someone they could provoke.","Ji Nan came from a prestigious family, but he was young and had low qualifications, so it was easier to ask him.","To their surprise, Ji Nan seemed to have only just noticed this. Like them, he turned around and looked inside.","This time, there was silence outside.","Everyone had no choice but to look at the girl.","Noticing the gazes from all directions, the girl slowly put her cell phone back into her pocket.","She glanced at everyone, took something from her pocket, and tossed it to Ji Nan.","\"See if this is it.\"","\"What?\" Ji Nan only saw a flash of white and subconsciously caught it. Looking down, he saw a diamond the size of a pigeon egg in his palm.","Second Elder and the others reacted faster, and they were pleasantly surprised.","\"Isn't this the raw diamond we were looking for this time?!\"","\"Miss Qiao got the raw stone.\"","\"Then this treasure hunt is still...\"","The others saw the diamond in Ji Nan's hand and instantly started arguing.","\"The Chamber of Commerce Alliance didn't get the diamond?\"","\"The Ji family still won this year.\"","\"Looks like the rumors circulating about the Ji family aren't true. There were rumors about in-fighting in the family. It seems like the rumors are just rumors.\""]},{"number":3524,"title":"Chapter 3524: I Don’t Know. Why Don’t You Go In and See For Yourself?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3524: I Don’t Know. Why Don’t You Go In and See For Yourself?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Second Elder and Ji Nan’s performance this time was exceptionally harmonious. Indeed, it did not seem like they were in-fighting.","Especially now that Qiao Nian gave the diamond to Ji Nan, the Ji family members surrounded him. Everyone was happy.","It looked like Ji Lingfeng’s hospitalization did not affect anything. They were still as stable as an iron bucket.","Only Simon’s ears were ringing. He forced himself to calm down and walked over to the girl warmly. “Miss Qiao, may I ask when... the people inside will come out?”","He really wanted to know what was going on.","What happened in the past three hours? Why did Qiao Nian come out with the diamond unscathed?","Where were their men?","Why didn’t he see any of them?","Could it be that they were still looking for the diamond?","Unexpectedly, the girl glanced at him and pulled down the brim of her baseball cap. “I don’t know. Why don’t you go in and take a look for yourself?”","She didn’t know?","Simon did not believe her. He thought that Qiao Nian was deliberately embarrassing him. His face was ashen and stiff, but he suppressed his anger. “Alright. Thank you, Miss Qiao.”","After saying that, he strode in.","He really wanted to take a look.","“President!” Someone immediately followed him.","The goatee man and the others from the Three Nine Gate couldn’t care less and followed.","Old Madam Xie looked at the girl who came out unscathed. The veins on her forehead bulged. She grabbed Mother Xie’s arm and gritted her teeth. “Let’s go in and take a look too!”","She wanted to see what was going on inside. Why did Qiao Nian come out fine?","* * *","Seeing that more than half of the people had entered, Ji Nan looked at the girl hesitantly.","“They’re not dead.” Qiao Nian seemed to know what he was thinking and answered before he could ask. “The empty bullets I used have an anesthetic effect.”","The people were not dead.","She just didn’t know when they would wake up.","As for the people Ye Wangchuan had dealt with, besides the one with a death wish, he didn’t kill the rest. He just did not let them catch up.","Of course, those people would die if they were left untreated.","Ji Nan opened his mouth before realizing he had nothing else to ask.","Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows. Her half-squinted eyes were filled with sleepiness as she said to him, “I’m tired. I’m leaving first. Is it okay to leave this place to you?”","Ji Nan saw the fatigue in the girl’s eyes. He nodded and regained his composure. “You can go back first. Leave this to me.”","“Okay.”","Qiao Nian did not dispute with him. She was really tired. Coupled with her bloody stench, she wanted to shower and change clothes. She was very uncomfortable right now.","Ye Wangchuan also gave Mo Dong brief instructions before taking the car keys from him, walking to her, and taking her bag. “Let’s go. I’ll send you back.”","Bright Gate participated this time, but they didn’t get the diamond. They let the Ji family win for nothing.","However, he wasn’t after the victory.","Bright Gate did not typically participate in matters in the independent continent, so it did not affect them much.","Qiao Nian walked out with him. The scene was harmonious and beautiful.","...","The atmosphere wasn’t good after Simon and the others entered Mingshui Mansion.","The more they saw the situation inside, the more frightened they became.","They saw downed people on almost every floor.","They were still breathing.","When they reached the last floor and saw Number 15 lying in a pool of blood, the goatee man from Three Nine Gate couldn’t stand it anymore."]},{"number":3525,"title":"Chapter 3525: Not Afraid of a God-like Opponent, But a Pig-like Teammate","paragraphs":["Chapter 3525: Not Afraid of a God-like Opponent, But a Pig-like Teammate","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Everyone else is fine. Why is it that only our man from the Three Nine Gate is dead?”","Silence.","Simon squatted down and checked the breathing of the person lying on the ground. He ignored his question and turned around to call for someone.","“There’s someone else here.”","The medical staff hurried over to save him.","Simon moved aside and stood at the corner. No emotion could be seen on his mature and handsome face.","Even so, the goatee man did not let him off, still shouting like a brainless person.","“Can someone give me an explanation?”","“Why is it that everyone else is fine except for our man!”","“Who did this!”","The Three Nine Gate could only be considered an inferior faction in the independent continent. If not because they were close to the Chamber of Commerce Alliance, no one would have cared about them.","Therefore, everyone looked at Simon and carefully observed his reaction, as if they wanted to see something from Simon’s face.","Simon’s cheek muscles twitched uncontrollably. He tried his best to calm down and not give himself away.","However, upon hearing the goatee man’s brainless questions and his clamoring for an explanation... he finally couldn’t help but shout in a low voice, “Enough!”","The goatee man’s face darkened. He was indignant and wanted to say something, but Simon looked at him warningly with bloodshot eyes.","He immediately quietened down like a chicken whose neck was stuck.","* * *","Xie Yun, Xie Tingyun, Zhou Zhou, and the others called Qiao Nian as soon as she left Mingshui Mansion.","She rolled down the window, rested her elbow outside, bent her long legs, and leaned back as she answered one call after another.","It was practically the same sentence to everyone: “I’m fine. Don’t worry.”","The news that she was representing the Ji family in this treasure hunt should have just spread. Even the usually taciturn Shi Fu, who did not like to use communication devices, called her to ask about the situation.","Being able to reach Qiao Nian, and hearing that she was safe...","Everyone was relieved.","Most of them just gave her a few reminders. Knowing that she was tired, they hung up without delay.","Qiao Nian answered more than 10 calls in one go.","The kids from the First Research Institute also called.","Besides the noisy Xue Zhu, Shen Qingfeng, Cao Yanhua, and Xu Yi were relatively calm.","Xu Yi was the calmest.","He only sent a WeChat message asking about the situation, as if he was certain that she could settle the mess at Mingshui Mansion.","Qiao Nian answered the calls and replied to the messages.","By then, the big black car had just reached the residence.","Compared to Mingshui Mansion’s ancient castle-like magnificence, Ye Wangchuan’s villa was really refreshing.","It was a white four-story villa, with a small garden outside displaying local roses climbing the walls and growing wild, blooming dazzlingly.","It was a flamboyant style.","Not like his house in Beijing, which was low-class and reserved. It was more like the indulgence hidden in his upbringing.","After parking the car, Ye Wangchuan realized that Qiao Nian was staring at the roses in the flowerbed.","He raised his eyebrows before unbuckling his seatbelt. He leaned over, unbuckled her seatbelt with his slender hand, and asked in a low and seductive voice, “Are you in a daze?”","Qiao Nian retracted her gaze and lazily opened the door. “I’m thinking about the antidote Elder Zhong mentioned.”"]},{"number":3526,"title":"Chapter 3526: Sister Nian Is Thinking About the Antidote","paragraphs":["Chapter 3526: Sister Nian Is Thinking About the Antidote","Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhong Yiliu had told her a few days ago that if Ji Lingfeng wanted to live for a few more years, he had to detoxify the poison. Otherwise, even the heavens would not be able to save him.","However, Ji Lingfeng’s poison was due to Nie Qingru. It had been a long time, and Nie Qingru had to be willing to take out the antidote to cure him.","Nie Qingru... If she were a kind-hearted person, she would not have attacked an innocent child back then.","Hence, this path was not feasible!","“Other than Mingshui Mansion, I’ve been thinking about this for the past few days.” Qiao Nian got out of the car and pulled down the brim of her cap.","She smelled a faint bloody smell on the sweater. It smelled a little stuffy and uncomfortable.","However, as Ye Wangchuan exited the car, she was in no hurry to enter. Instead, she endured the disturbing bloody smell and waited for him to join her.","“If I go to her directly, with her personality, if she still has the antidote from back then, I’m afraid she won’t give it to me, but destroy it immediately.”","She didn’t know Nie Qingru well, but she had a rough understanding of her cold-hearted style of doing things.","Qiao Nian smirked. “But only she knows the specific formula for this poison. Elder Zhong implied that if he can’t get the antidote, it’s best if he can get the formula. If he has the formula, he can develop a similar antidote.”","Ye Wangchuan had already walked past her to open the door. He turned around and looked at the girl before nodding slightly. “Go take a shower first.”","Silence.","Qiao Nian paused and followed him, not continuing the topic.","* * *","In the second-floor room.","Water splashed in the bathroom.","Qiao Nian took half an hour to wash off the annoying bloody smell on herself before drying her hair and coming out.","She was exhausted, and a sharp clamoring at her temples pierced her nerves.","However, she only half-dried her hair before walking to bed, letting her wet hair fall on her shoulders and dry naturally. She walked to the computer table, opened her notebook, and sent a video call request to Jiang Li.","The video call was quickly connected.","Jiang Li’s young and handsome face appeared on the screen. “Nian Nian.”","“Mm.”","Qiao Nian’s nasal voice was heavy as she responded.","She looked at the person on the screen and realized it was a little dark, so she walked to the curtains and pulled them open, causing sunlight to shine in.","Walking back, she dragged a chair and sat down so the camera captured her face. “How’s it at home?”","“Still the same. With you not here, Elder Ye often goes to the sanatorium to accompany Grandpa. The two old masters play chess and walk their birds. Occasionally, he’ll even call Principal Liang and invite him to play cards.","“As for your father, the Ninth Branch’s taking care of him. He’s usually busy.","“In addition to completing the collaboration project with Tian Chen, Master Cheng is preparing to start a new project—a semiconductor that has something to do with IT.","“Master Cheng asked your father for help. Uncle is often in the Ninth Branch, home, and school.”","“You’re outside?”","Qiao Nian noticed he seemed to be in a car, and screams sounded outside.","From the camera’s angle, she couldn’t see the situation clearly. Qiao Nian’s sharp eyes captured many girls holding light signs through the window.","Jiang Li hummed uncomfortably and touched his nose. He was about to say that he had to attend an event.","However, he thought about the first time he saw Qiao Nian.","His sister said he looked familiar, implying he had a common face. Now, he was too embarrassed to say that the people outside were his fans.","Jiang Li found something to say. “Where’s Master Wang? Is he not with you?”"]},{"number":3527,"title":"Chapter 3527: You Should Repost On Weibo","paragraphs":["Chapter 3527: You Should Repost On Weibo","Editor: Atlas Studios","Jiang Li wasn’t alone in the van.","His manager and assistant were also there. The chauffeur had parked the van by the roadside at Jiang Li’s request. Now that the fans had surrounded them, they couldn’t leave for a while.","Everyone knew who he was video calling and thus tacitly kept quiet.","At the mention of “Master Wang”, even if they weren’t from Beijing’s top circles, they had probably heard of this title.","That person from the Ye family.","Tsk.","The manager couldn’t help but smack his lips.","Many big shots in the entertainment industry could barely meet the entry threshold. Even then, they were already above many.","However, he brought this young master along purely for fun.","Without having to mix around, this circle was something ordinary people could not come into contact with even if they stood on tiptoes. Not to mention that Jiang Li had a good sister. In the future, both Jiang Li and the Jiang Family would get better and better in this circle.","That Miss Qiao was really...","The manager momentarily couldn’t find a suitable adjective.","Qiao Nian’s relationship with Ye Wangchuan...","At first, he thought he was a sugar daddy. Later on, he slowly understood that it did not involve a one-sided dependence.","The love between a big boss and another big boss.","“He should be showering,” Qiao Nian said casually.","Jiang Li choked on his saliva and covered his mouth in anger. “F*ck! Is he shameless?! You’re not even of legal age!”","Qiao Nian was just stating the facts. But she wasn’t a fool. She could tell he had misunderstood.","However, she did not panic and did not try to explain. Instead, her eyes flashed and she lazily supported her chin with her hand. “Why do you think he took the initiative? What if it was me?”","Jiang Li was speechless.","He wanted to refute her, but he knew that with Qiao Nian’s personality, she was capable of it.","Could it be that... Master Wang was the bottom?!!","As soon as this thought popped up, Jiang Li’s mind exploded. He could not recover from his shock for a while.","Qiao Nian called to ask about the family’s situation. Seeing he had gone silent, she said, “Since you still have something to do, go ahead. I’m hanging up.”","“Wait a minute.” She had finally taken the initiative to contact him. How could he bear to let the call end so quickly? He instinctively stopped her.","The girl looked at him. Her dark eyes were quite beautiful, but she was not impatient.","“Your new song is out. Auntie Wen uploaded it for you. The feedback online is pretty good. Many people in the industry are discussing it. Do you want to repost it on Weibo?”","“...Is there such a need?”","Qiao Nian rubbed her eyebrows. She had almost forgotten about this.","Since Jiang Li mentioned it, she indeed remembered helping write a publicity song before leaving Beijing. She was busy with too many things in the independent continent after that, so she had forgotten.","“If you need it, I’ll go repost it.”","Her account had not been used for a long time.","Mainly, she did not need a Weibo account on the independent continent. In addition, she didn’t like sharing her life on social media.","Therefore, other than reposting Nie Mi’s activities related to traditional music, Zhui Guang’s account was rarely used.","She had only used it a few times. One time, she tore Qiao Chen apart. The other time, she helped Jiang Li clear up the dirt.","Other than that, she had seldom used her account.","Jiang Li said seriously, “You’d better repost it. Your account has a lot of traffic and many people follow it. It can also promote the new song and make everyone pay attention to this charity event.”"]},{"number":3528,"title":"Chapter 3528: Brother Li, Your Sister Is More Popular Than You","paragraphs":["\"Sure.\"","Qiao Nian agreed readily.","Looking down, she grabbed her cell phone from the table and logged into Weibo. Following Jiang Li's instructions, she found Wen Ruxia's post and reposted it.","Besides reposting it, she did not leave any words behind.","It was very Qiao Nian-style.","She had just reposted it.","Her cell phone started vibrating.","99+ notifications flashed on the screen, with new notifications popping up every second.","Qiao Nian did not look at it, nor did she want her cell phone stuck on the screen. She logged out of Weibo and looked at the person on the screen. \"Done.\"","At that moment, she saw someone coming through the door.","She knew who it was.","Without waiting for Jiang Li to say anything, she said naturally, \"I have something on. Let's talk another day.\"","Jiang Li was speechless.","Didn't she say she was free?","However, he wasn't insensible. Although a little reluctant, he nodded and said, \"Alright, go ahead.\"","\"Mm, I'm hanging up.\"","Qiao Nian ended the video call.","Smelling a faint floral fragrance, a bouquet of fiery red roses was inserted into the empty vase on her desk.","She looked sideways at the man in casual home clothes. The sunlight enveloped his broad brows as he lowered his eyes and focused on arranging the roses, making them look gorgeous.","Ye Wangchuan turned around and saw Qiao Nian looking at him. He lowered his head and moved closer so she could see him better.","His thin lips curled up, and his eyes seemed to hook her. \"Jiang Li? I think I heard his voice.\" Qiao Nian hummed and did not deny it. Instead, she looked straight at him. \"Why the roses?\" \"Weren't you looking at them in the courtyard just now?\" He was noble and calm in his bones. He met her gaze openly. \"Damascus roses are magnanimous and passionate. They're the most resilient species of roses. I've been planting them since I was 20 years old. At first, I thought they were beautiful, but later on, I realized that... people like them are prettier.\"","\"Oh.\"","Qiao Nian listened seriously, then looked at the roses bathed in sunlight on the table with slightly narrowed eyes.","She looked back at him with an arrogant gaze.","\"Boyfriend, do you want to kiss?\"","***","On the other side.","Jiang Li didn't know that Qiao Nian had hung up on him because she saw Ye Wangchuan coming in with a bouquet of roses.","He thought that Qiao Nian really had something to do. After hanging up, he said to his manager, \"It's probably about the research institute again.\"","\"Miss Qiao has been doing research recently?\"","The manager didn't know that Qiao Nian was in the independent continent. Or rather, he didn't know of its existence. He thought Jiang Li was talking about Rao City or some research institute in Beijing.","Jiang Li did not explain. He only nodded and asked, \"Have you seen her repost on Weibo? How's the numbers?\"","He was still pondering. \"If it doesn't work, buy her some popularity. After all, she hasn't posted on Weibo for a long time. I wonder if she has die-hard fans.\"","Jiang Li never bought numbers himself.","Firstly, he was just fooling around. Secondly, he was a top celebrity in the entertainment industry and had many fans. He did not need to buy popularity.","However, Jiang Li knew there was a tradition of buying popularity in the industry. He did not care if his own numbers were good, but he did not want anyone to say anything about Qiao","Nian.","Unexpectedly, as soon as he finished speaking, his manager looked at him strangely and rolled his eyes. \"10,000 reposts in five minutes. The number is still climbing.\"","Jiang Li was speechless.","10,000 in five minutes?","The manager added fuel to the fire. \"Brother Li, your sister is more popular than you!\""]},{"number":3529,"title":"Chapter 3529: Isn’t This What My Sister Should Do?","paragraphs":["\"Give it to me.\" Jiang Li did not believe it. He asked his assistant for his cell phone, logged into Weibo, and searched for Qiao Nian's ID.","Qiao Nian's Weibo account popped up.","Her Weibo profile was blank apart from the official account's description of Zhui Guang.","Her latest Weibo post was from five minutes ago.","Jiang Li scrolled down and looked at the number of reposts and likes.","20,000 reposts.","90,000 likes.","The numbers were still rising.","\"Eh, it's already at 20,000 reposts?\" His manager was surprised to see that Qiao Nian's Weibo post had already exceeded 20,000 reposts.","The assistant leaned over to take a look without taking out his phone. \"Is this real data?\"","\"What else? I haven't had the time to help buy popularity yet. This is the most authentic data.\" The manager glanced at Jiang Li with a faint smile.","Jiang Li felt a little embarrassed at the way he was looking at him. \"Damn, I've been in the industry for half my life, but I'm still an ordinary person. Tsk! I'm lonely.\"","Although he said that, he sincerely forwarded and liked all her posts, not forgetting to leave a comment below.","[Did they see whose sister this is~]","His smug tone was obvious.","Qiao Nian's name was just short of being stamped on Jiang Li's forehead. His eyes were filled with love and pride for his sister.","He had many loyal fans on Weibo, and their combat strength was maxed out.","As soon as Jiang Li reposted it, the number of reposts and likes on Qiao Nian's post increased","even more.","It exceeded 50,000 in the blink of an eye.","The comments section was even more lively.","His fans joined Zhui Guang's fans to flood the comments section below.","[Pear Blossom Tree: Ah ah ah ah ah! I can~]","[Floral Raccoon: Can I want both? Only students need to choose, I'm an adult. I want both guy and girl!]","[Catch the Light in the Deep Sea: Hehehe, repost it first, then comment and like. Then, do it again. In addition, please support our public service and contribute to it.]","Jiang Li rested his arm on the window while holding his phone. He was happier seeing his fans supporting Qiao Nian in the comments section than supporting him.","\"It's almost 100,000 reposts.\"","The fans were still surrounding them and they couldn't leave. The manager paid attention to the data and said in a low voice, \"With this data, it will top the trending topics.\"","\"Isn't this how it should be?\" Jiang Li took a screenshot of Weibo and sent it to his friends in the circle on WeChat.","The meaning was self-evident.","He was asking them to help forward it.","He was in the industry for a few years and was a top celebrity. Besides Zhang Yang and his group of friends, his status in the entertainment industry wasn't low.","Some seniors had long retired.","Everyone in the circle was smart. To become a big shot, they had more or less heard about Jiang Li's background. No one would reject him for such a small matter.","It continued like this.","On Weibo, a phenomenon not seen for many years happened.","More than a dozen A-list celebrities collectively cheered for Zhui Guang. Among them were diva singers who had retired for many years, as well as the Queen of Cinema who had long left the industry... These celebrities who couldn't even be hired with money appeared to carry someone's sedan chair, instantly maximizing their prestige."]},{"number":3530,"title":"Chapter 3530: Sister Nian: Listen, Thank You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3530: Sister Nian: Listen, Thank You","Editor: Atlas Studios","#ZhuiGuang","#ZhuiGuangJiangLi","#NewSongQueenReposted","#PopularityExceedsAMillion","Originally, some dark trending topics appeared.","However, Wen Ruxia had long noticed such a high popularity. She had long informed the backend on Weibo. Curse words deliberately looking for trouble were immediately bombarded the moment they appeared.","With such strong public relations skills, even if some small companies did not know what was good for them and caused trouble, they would know that Zhui Guang was not someone they could afford to offend when they saw the posts they had spent money to trend disappear.","* * *","Qiao Nian didn’t know that Jiang Li had made her so popular.","She took a cold shower and came out in a cold white mist that suppressed her body heat. Her hair draped over her shoulders was half dry.","Qiao Nian couldn’t be bothered to dry it. Her arms were sore.","As soon as she came out of the bathroom, she collapsed on the chair and couldn’t be bothered to move. She crossed her long legs and looked like she had stayed up all night without sleeping. She was lazy and unrestrained.","Ye Wangchuan had long left, probably returned to his own room.","Qiao Nian had no energy to look for him.","Her cell phone vibrated non-stop on the table.","She reluctantly took it and looked down.","It was actually Nie Mi looking for her again.","He sent her several screenshots on WeChat.","Qiao Nian saw it was all about her Weibo trending topic.","That popularity was almost comparable to the last time she tagged Qiao Chen.","[Nie Mi: Nian Nian, did you ask someone to promote it?]","Qiao Nian did not reply. She leaned against the back of the chair weakly and slowly logged into her Weibo account. In an instant, countless new notifications flooded in.","She did not even look at them. She clicked on her post and scrolled down to the comments section.","Jiang Li’s ID was arrogantly at the top of the popular comments with over 100,000 likes.","She looked at a certain someone’s eager and flaunting comments and her temple swelled. Without looking at anything else, she could basically guess what was going on.","Needless to say, Jiang Li made her a trending topic.","It was clear that the many comments and reposts were also his contribution.","Qiao Nian’s mouth twitched, not knowing what to say. She logged out of Weibo and replied to Nie Mi on WeChat.","At this moment, she heard someone entering her room.","Right on the heels of that, a familiar scent enveloped her, and someone lifted her wet hair. “Why is your hair still wet?”","Qiao Nian relaxed upon hearing his voice. She did not look up as she was still typing a message. “I’m tired. I don’t want to move.”","Ye Wangchuan remembered that she had helped him two hours ago. His narrow eyes were dark. He went to the bathroom, grabbed the hairdryer, moved a chair behind her, and said, “I’ll help you.”","“Mm.”","Qiao Nian replied nonchalantly as if he could do whatever he wanted. From her shoulders to her neck and back, she was extremely relaxed. That was a 100% relaxed posture which she showed only in front of people she trusted.","Ye Wangchuan ran his fingers through the girl’s black hair and adjusted the power to the minimum. Not deterred by the effort, he slowly dried her hair.","Qiao Nian had already replied to Nie Mi. He was probably busy and did not see it.","She pinched the bridge of her nose tiredly. The light outside shone on her face, covering her exquisite and eye-catching oval face with a layer of light fog, weakening the arrogance and tyranny between her eyebrows. It was rare for her to look gentle.","“Elder Zhong just called me and said he vomited blood again.”","“Mm?”","Ye Wangchuan gently stroked her hair while using the hairdryer. Hearing this, his hand paused and he looked at the back of the girl’s head.","“Ji Lingfeng?”"]},{"number":3531,"title":"Chapter 3531: Vomiting Blood Twice in a Short Time","paragraphs":["Qiao Nian nodded in frustration. \"His condition is worse than I expected. Elder Zhong is implying that he won't be able to do anything if we don't get the antidote within a month.\"","The special medicine taken by Ji Lingfeng was extremely harmful to the body. Although it could temporarily suppress the poison in the body, it was not a targeted antidote.","This method of fighting fire with fire was often overrated by television dramas. In fact, it was undoubtedly like drinking poison to quench one's thirst. It couldn't solve the root problem.","Just like now.","Even with Zhong Yiliu around, Ji Lingfeng still vomited blood for the second time.","It wasn't good for him.","\"I originally wanted to solve the last equation on the USB drive before confronting the reclusive families, but now, if I want to get the antidote, the plan will be disrupted... I wonder if it's worth it for me to do this.\" Qiao Nian couldn't be said to be emotional. Rather, she did not seem to have much feelings for those people from the Ji family.","A relative who had never appeared in her 20-year life. It was a little ridiculous to expect a deep relationship with him.","However, Ji Lingfeng had been seriously injured when he went out to sea for her and had almost lost his life. She did not like owing favors, let alone a favor that almost cost a life.","Qiao Nian frowned in frustration.","The hardest thing to repay in this world was a favor!","\"You plan to face Nie Qingru head-on.\" Ye Wangchuan continued to blow dry her hair calmly as if he knew what she was going to do.","\"I haven't decided yet.\"","Qiao Nian put her cell phone on the table. Touching the candy in her pocket, she took one out, tore the wrapper, and threw it into her mouth.","The sweet and sour taste of orange candy spread in her taste buds, suppressing the indescribable frustration in her heart. It was as if her breathing was much smoother.","\"But this time, she made such a big move to kill me. It would be rude if I didn't return the favor.\" Qiao Nian slowly said, \"Forget it, I have to do it sooner or later. It doesn't matter if it's earlier or later. I'll treat it as a good thing.\"","She meant Ji Lingfeng's antidote.","Ye Wangchuan wasn't surprised that she would dispute her plan for Ji Lingfeng. He didn't stop what he was doing and took a clean towel to carefully dry her last wet hair before saying casually, \"If you want to do it, do it. I'll support you unconditionally no matter what you do.\" Qiao Nian suddenly turned around and stared at him with her dark eyes. Her eyes flickered with emotions and she seemed to be in a better mood. \"I'll go to the hospital to take a look later.\"","Ye Wangchuan placed a hand on her shoulder and raised his eyebrows slightly. His eyes were charming and domineering. \"Sleep first.\"","She had been running around for the past few days for this treasure hunt.","She still had to talk to Xu Yi and the others about the experiment on the USB drive during the day, so she had no time to rest.","Ye Wangchuan knew she had never slept well. Back in Rao City, she had to use sleeping pills to fall asleep. She was better now, but her sleep quality was still worse than an ordinary person's.","He could see the blood vessels in her eyes now.","\"I'll go to the hospital in your place.\" Ye Wangchuan looked serious. \"I'll call if anything happens.\"","Qiao Nian did not argue with him this time. Her arm was still sore, so she turned her wrist and bit the fruit candy in her mouth. \"Alright.\"","***","Ye Wangchuan made a trip to the hospital for her.","In the hospital.","Ji Nan had already rushed over upon hearing the news.","Ji Lingfeng spat a mouthful of blood but was awake, which was a rarity recently. His face was pale as he leaned against the pillow. The intense pain caused by the poison had forced him to take a painkiller, but the effect was minimal."]},{"number":3532,"title":"Chapter 3532: If You Don’t Want Her to Sleep Well, Make Trouble","paragraphs":["Chapter 3532: If You Don’t Want Her to Sleep Well, Make Trouble","Editor: Atlas Studios","“How’s the family? The Southern halls...”","Ji Nan supported his back, gritted his teeth, and interrupted him. “Dad, don’t worry about anything else. You’ve to take care of your health right now.”","Ji Lingfeng narrowed his sharp eyes. Although pale and sickly, he couldn’t hide the power in his bones. “I’m asking you a question.”","Ji Nan poured him a glass of water and handed it over. Seeing that Ji Lingfeng did not take it, he looked at him helplessly and said, “Nian Nian helped resolve it. Those people don’t dare to act rashly for the time being.”","Qiao Nian.","“No, she can’t get involved!” Ji Lingfeng’s temples swelled as he propped himself up on the bed.","Ji Nan pressed him down. “Dad! Elder Zhong said you have to rest in bed. Also, don’t overthink...”","“Move aside!” Ji Lingfeng did not listen.","No one knew his physical condition better than him. He couldn’t last much longer.","Since time was limited, he had to arrange everything in a short period of time.","Veins bulged on Ji Nan’s forehead. He stubbornly stood his ground and refused to move away. “The doctor said you have to rest!”","Ji Lingfeng rarely saw him so disobedient. He frowned. But before he could get angry, Xie Yun rushed in from outside. Seeing the tense atmosphere between them, she seemed to know what they were arguing about. She slowed down and walked towards the bed.","“If you want to argue, make it louder. Nian Nian has just returned and hasn’t rested for even three hours. It’s best if you vomit blood and faint again so that she won’t even have time to sleep.”","Ji Lingfeng calmed down when he detected the hidden meaning in her words.","Xie Yun placed the medicine she got from Zhong Yiliu on the bedside table and said without looking back, “I know what you’re thinking. You thought you had arranged everything, but in the end, not only did you not help her, but you also caused her to cut ties with the First Research Institute.","“Now, the Ji family is relying on her to suppress those restless people. She’s also taking on the family’s mess. You should know better than me how many people in the independent continent want her life. She has offended more than half of the independent continent for us this time! If you’re still doing this for her own good, you shouldn’t be stuck in a deadlock with Ji Nan here. Instead, you should cooperate with Elder Zhong’s treatment.","“By the way, you don’t know, do you?”","Xie Yun guessed he didn’t notice this.","“Nian Nian was the one who called Elder Zhong.”","With the Ji family’s reputation, it was not guaranteed they could get Zhong Yiliu to fly over.","But Qiao Nian did it.","If Qiao Nian had not invited Zhong Yiliu in advance, Xie Yun imagined she wouldn’t even have the chance to argue with him right now.","Therefore, even though they were quarreling, she was relatively calm.","“If you don’t want to drag her down, don’t be stubborn anymore.”","Xie Yun looked into his eyes. “You want to give the Ji family to her. Have you asked her if she wants it? With Nian Nian’s current ability, she really doesn’t lack a Ji family.”","Initially, Ji Lingfeng was so agitated that he wanted to get up immediately. Now, it was as if all his strength had left him. He leaned back on the pillow again, his eyes unfocused and his expression tired.","“I didn’t protect her mother back then, and now I’m dragging her down. How can I face her after I die?”","Only Xie Yun understood who ‘her’ was.","She knew about Ji Lingfeng and Ji Qing’s past, as well as Ji Lingfeng’s lifetime of regret.","She understood this man’s love and pain. That’s why she couldn’t hate him.","“You’ll be letting her down if you continue being stubborn.”","If he continued like this, he would be letting Qiao Nian down for doing so much for the Ji family."]},{"number":3533,"title":"Chapter 3533: Master Wang Wants to Avenge Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Chapter 3533: Master Wang Wants to Avenge Sister Nian","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan came to see Ji Lingfeng.","By then, Ji Lingfeng had already calmed down under Xie Yun’s persuasion.","Seeing Ye Wangchuan enter, his eyes were dark and sickly, but shrewd and sharp as ever.","“Dad, drink the medicine.” Ji Nan handed him the cup and medicine.","“Mm.”","Ji Lingfeng swallowed it in one gulp with the water’s help. Then, he turned his gaze to the man coming in from outside.","With his picky gaze, the young man in front of the bed was still outstanding.","He knew he had no right to interfere with Qiao Nian’s life.","Although his gaze was sharp, he did not mention the nonsense elders would say. Instead, he said hoarsely, “I heard that you accompanied Nian Nian to Mingshui Mansion.”","“Mm.”","Ye Wangchuan handed fruits and a gift box to Ji Nan. Then, he looked at the middle-aged man on the bed and said politely, “I brought some fruits. Young Master Ji can wash some for you later.”","Ji Lingfeng’s furrowed brows relaxed a little. He looked away and moved his lips. “You don’t have to do this.”","He knew Qiao Nian’s personality and knew that his choice back then had destined that they would not be close relatives.","There was no need for Ye Wangchuan to look good in front of him.","He wasn’t that important.","Ye Wangchuan seemed to know what he was thinking. His eyes were dark. “She’s not good at expressing herself. If you want to understand her heart, you don’t have to hear what she says. You have to see what she does.”","Ji Lingfeng stared at him in shock.","Ye Wangchuan met his gaze, his clear eyes clear and magnanimous. “She’s under my protection. She won’t be in danger. Take good care of yourself. Only the living will have a chance to witness what happens in the future.”","**","Mo Dong leaned against the big black car, waiting for him to come out.","Seeing Ye Wangchuan walk out at a moderate pace, Mo Dong threw down the cigarette between his fingers and quickly extinguished it with his foot. Then, he went over. “Master Wang, you’re out.”","Ye Wangchuan had already opened the car door. Thinking of something, he pinched his brow bone and turned to look at him. “Have you found out what I asked?”","“I’ve found it.” Mo Dong walked around to the opposite side and entered the car. As he started the car, he smiled and said, “It’s inevitable that there are some shameful things beneath a big force like the reclusive families. No matter how careful that Empress is, she can’t handle the useless people around her!","“What you asked me to check was true. Ji Lin’s people have already come into contact with the victim’s parents.”","A week ago, there was a traffic accident in the center of Continent M. At 8:30 PM, two luxury cars collided at the intersection. The accident was tragic.","One of the Mercedes-Benz drivers passed out on the spot and was sent to the hospital for emergency treatment.","Three days later, doctors announced that the 28-year-old man had died.","The owner of this Mercedes-Benz, who had died from serious injuries, had a powerful background. He was the only son of the president of a multinational trading company.","The president had his precious son at an advanced age, and his son was a hardworking man. He obtained a master’s degree in finance from a famous university at 28 and had just entered the company’s management. His future was bright, but he was suddenly gone. No one would be able to accept it.","“Previously, the couple still had a trace of fantasy. They thought that if their son could be saved, they might be more willing to give in. In the end, two days ago, their son died and they are filled with hatred. Now they only want an explanation and no longer care about anything else...”"]},{"number":3534,"title":"Chapter 3534: The Nie Family Can’t Get Over This!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3534: The Nie Family Can’t Get Over This!","Editor: Atlas Studios","Mo Dong said, “As long as the murderer pays the price he deserves, they are not afraid of the reclusive families’ revenge.”","“Oh?” Ye Wangchuan had already gotten into the car and was leaning against the seat lazily, with one arm resting on the window. But his sitting posture was indescribably arrogant and noble.","Mo Dong looked at the sunlight casting a halo on his handsome face. He was so good-looking that it was unforgettable. He paused before continuing, “The Nie Family really messed up this time. That car accident was caused by a prodigal son driving while drunk. He only suffered a light scratch and fell asleep upon returning home. He didn’t even go to the hospital to see how the victim was doing. Really arrogant!”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows and smiled.","It was no wonder that people like Mo Dong would think that the Nie Family was arrogant.","They didn’t even care about the victim after the drunk-driving accident and hit-and-run. The seriously injured victim died, but they did not give an explanation and even used their connections to suppress the news.","They even privately threatened the victim’s parents not to hold them accountable.","This also happened in Continent M. If it was in Beijing, the police would have already apprehended him.","“Does Nie Qingru know about this?”","Mo Dong froze for half a second. How would he know?!","Still...","Mo Dong thought before saying, “The Nie family is her family, after all. She should know, right? It doesn’t make sense that she doesn’t know.”","“Is that so?”","Ye Wangchuan did not comment on that.","He felt that Nie Qingru did not know about this yet.","Mo Dong figured out what he meant. “It doesn’t matter if she doesn’t know. I heard the old couple has already contacted the media to expose this matter online. In addition, they even called the police. It will reach the Empress’ ears sooner or later.”","“Master Wang, what do you want to do?” Mo Dong stared at the man’s face with a burning gaze. He was very excited, wanting to rub his fists and stretch his limbs.","Looking outside, Ye Wangchuan gestured with his chin and reminded him, “Watch the road.”","Mo Dong saw that he was calm, but he did not dare to be negligent. He obediently looked ahead and drove steadily.","At this moment, he heard the man’s clear voice in his ear. “She gave Qiao Nian such a big gift. Won’t it be rude if I don’t return it?”","Mo Dong trembled and looked at him through the rearview mirror.","Ye Wangchuan was still as lazy as ever, as if he had no interest in raising his eyes.","Mo Dong slowly retracted his gaze. He knew very well that his boss wouldn’t be able to get over the Nie family!","**","Continent M.","Nie Family.","Nie Tao rushed home with a cold face. As soon as he entered, he heard the cries of the prodigal son coming from the living room.","“Hey, be gentle! Be gentle! Do you want me to die from the pain? I told you to be gentle.”","“Young Master, I’m already being very gentle.”","“Then be gentler! If you hurt me again, believe it or not, I’ll slap you.”","Nie Tao strode in with a gloomy face. Sure enough, he saw his good son lying on the sofa like a ball of mud. A servant kneeled by his side, carefully applying medicine to his cheek.","His face had inherited the good genes of the Nie Family. His facial features were handsome, but it was a pity that his body had been hollowed out by years of alcohol and women. His eyelids were swollen, and his gaze was unfocused. He did not look like a good person.","However, Nie Junwei did not feel it. Seeing his father from the corner of his eye, he smiled fearlessly and greeted him, “Dad, you’re back. Why are you back so early today?”","Nie Tao’s expression was dark and terrifying as he tugged at his tie and looked at him coldly. “You still have the cheek to call me Dad.”"]},{"number":3535,"title":"Chapter 3535: Really Arrogant","paragraphs":["Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Junwei’s expression was nonchalant. “It’s fine if you don’t want me to call you that. Anyway, it’s enough as long as you have Big Brother as a son. I’m an embarrassment to you.”","Nie Tao had two sons.","According to the family’s nurturing, his elder son grew step by step into a talent who could hold his own. He was outstanding in every aspect and brought him glory.","However, his younger son seemed like he had been picked up from the trash can. It was fine when he was young. Although he was not smart and his learning ability was not as good as his brother’s, he was at least obedient.","Who knew which part of the process went wrong and he ended up like this?","If it weren’t because the Nie Family had the reclusive families’ backing and he had plenty of money to play with, Nie Tao couldn’t imagine how much of a bastard his son could be.","He did not have much hope for this son to begin with, but now that he had mentioned his outstanding brother without any scruples, with an expression that said the situation was already so bad that to make it worse made no real difference.","Nie Tao was so angry that he pointed at his nose and scolded him, “You still have the cheek to argue with me. Do you know that the person you crashed against is dead?!”","Nie Junwei was only slightly stunned, but he immediately threw it to the back of his mind and said indifferently, “If he’s dead, so be it. Tell me, can I still bring him back to life? We should just compensate them. They will shut up if we pay them enough.”","It wasn’t as if this was the first time.","The first time, he had been afraid.","After all, he had been a disappointment since young and he had never really come into contact with the family’s business. He was just a rich second-generation heir who only knew how to eat, drink, and have fun.","At that time, he was young and afraid of drinking and causing trouble. That day, he was so scared that he ran home and did not dare to go out to play for a few days.","When he went out to play again, he realized his family had already settled it for him.","From then on, he had never taken these things to heart.","In his opinion, anything big could be solved with money. If it did not work out, he could rely on his family’s background to solve it.","They were backed by the reclusive families.","His Auntie was the Empress.","Based on this relationship, as long as he did not pierce through the sky, who could do anything to him?","“Do you think it’s that easy?” Nie Tao had been working hard for the past two days. He wanted to hit him. “He doesn’t want money and wants to make a fuss online. He even wants to call the police... It won’t be so easy this time!”","This time, Nie Junwei crashed into the only son of the president of a listed company. His family background wasn’t bad but couldn’t compare to the reclusive families.","However, now that he had lost his son, and was already past the age of 60, he was going all out to die with them.","No matter how capable Nie Tao was, he could not withstand such reckless revenge. Therefore, this matter gave him a headache.","He had already met the other party.","Seeing that Nie Junwei did not even appear, his expression grew extremely ugly. Later on, he indirectly proposed to settle it privately and even mentioned the reclusive families.","The other party’s attitude was firm. Either Nie Junwei paid with his life, or everyone would fight to the death. They might even directly tell him that as long as their family was not completely dead, this matter would not be over!","No matter how powerful the Nie family was, they couldn’t commit murder and arson in public, right?","Of course, it wasn’t that they had not done these things before, but after all, there was an Empress in the family. Nie Qingru was very concerned about her reputation and would not allow them to make things too ugly.","Nie Junwei still did not care. “Then get someone to beat them up until they’re afraid.”","The veins on Nie Tao’s forehead bulged, and he almost slapped him."]},{"number":3536,"title":"Chapter 3536: Tell Him to Behave","paragraphs":["Chapter 3536: Tell Him to Behave","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, when he thought about how he was his biological son, he endured it and slowly lowered his hand. With a cold and stern expression, he said, “I’ve already contacted my connections to suppress the news and won’t let the media interview them. It’s just that during this period, you have to behave and not go out to cause trouble again. Otherwise, I won’t let you off even if your grandfather pleads for you!”","“Got it.” Nie Junwei had almost been beaten up just now, and so restrained his attitude and nodded, immediately becoming sensible and obedient again.","The more he acted like this, the more helpless Nie Tao felt. Looking at the scrape on his cheek, his tone softened. “Apply medicine properly. Don’t leave a scar on your face.”","“I was just applying the ointment properly. Isn’t this you talking to me, Dad?” Nie Junwei picked up a cotton swab and indifferently applied the ointment on himself.","Nie Tao couldn’t be bothered with him. He turned around and prepared to go upstairs.","At this moment, his cell phone rang.","He stopped, took out his cell phone, and looked down at the caller ID. His relaxed expression immediately disappeared. Now with a solemn expression, he walked to the floor-to-ceiling window to answer the call.","“Hello, Qingru. Why are you calling me?”","He thought that Nie Qingru still did not know about the drunk driving incident.","That was because he had dealt with it quickly this time. He immediately suppressed it upon finding out that the other party wanted to blow things up through the media and use the power of public opinion to make Nie Junwei take responsibility.","Of course, it was still because of the reclusive families and Nie Qingru.","His sister had a lot of face. The media in Continent M would not report news related to her.","Nie Tao was confident that he could solve this problem. The other party’s family background was unordinary and had some background compared to ordinary people.","However, this bit of strength was not enough in his eyes.","The reclusive families’ hundreds of years of accumulation weren’t for show. As long as the Nie family was still part of the reclusive families and was protected by this power, it would undoubtedly be akin to throwing an egg at a rock if that family wanted to fight with him.","Moreover, even if they had the mentality of perishing together, it was actually just a thought. They couldn’t shake the Nie family, nor could they make Nie Junwei take responsibility for the harm caused by drunk driving.","“What do you think?” Nie Qingru’s voice was as deep as ever.","However, Nie Tao was her biological brother, after all. He had lived with her for decades, so how could he not hear the suppressed anger under her calm tone?","His heart sank. As he thought about it, he had no choice but to continue asking. “What’s wrong? Did something happen? Is it related to the independent continent? It’s that Qiao Nian...”","He knew Nie Qingru hated this name the most. As long as this name was mentioned, Nie Qingru would always be disgusted and immediately hung up.","However, this time was different.","Not only did Nie Qingru not hang up, but she suppressed her anger and asked, “Shouldn’t you give me a reasonable explanation for Junwei’s drunk driving incident?!”","Nie Tao paused for a full three seconds before asking, “You know about it?”","Nie Qingru coldly snorted. “I only found out what you did behind my back when the Murdoch family came to look for me just now. Why? You think you can hide it from me despite using my name to clear your mess?”","The Murdochs were a media tycoon family in Continent M. They existed for hundreds of years and were also a member of the reclusive families. Like the Nies, they were a top-notch family among the reclusive families.","However, the Murdoch family was a little different from the Nie family.","The Nie family’s current status was all because of the Empress, while the Murdoch Family controlled countless media outlets and social media. They were a large family in themselves.","This time, Nie Tao had used Nie Qingru’s name to seek Murdoch’s help. Without a doubt, Nie Qingru now owed them a favor."]},{"number":3537,"title":"Chapter 3537: Arrogant to the Extreme","paragraphs":["Chapter 3537: Arrogant to the Extreme","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru had never liked wasting her breath on others. Without waiting for Nie Tao’s answer, she said coldly, “I’ll help you suppress this matter. However, this is the only time. There won’t be a next time! I don’t care how you educate your son. Make him behave!”","Nie Tao felt guilty. “Thank you, Qingru.”","A cold mechanical voice answered him.","Nie Qingru had already hung up.","Nie Tao put down his phone with a gloomy expression. He turned around and saw the troublemaker still squatting on the sofa and applying medicine to his face. The anger in his stomach surged.","His eyes were almost spitting fire as he walked over and kicked his unfilial son hard, causing him to stagger and hold his waist in pain.","Nie Tao looked down at his son and warned, “Stay home obediently for the next few days.”","Nie Junwei had just been kicked hard and was in so much pain that he could not speak. All he could see was his father leaving those harsh words and going upstairs.","He gritted his teeth and blamed all his grievances and anger on someone unrelated. “It’s that short-lived ghost’s fault!”","So what if he died?","It was not as if he would not compensate them.","Those people were still unsatisfied and even tried to find trouble with him.","Nie Junwei had been hiding at home since the day he caused trouble, but that did not mean he could not contact the outside world.","As a member of the Nie family, many people tried to get on his good side.","Nie Junwei had been arrogant since young and now suffered at home. How could he take this lying down? When his waist did not hurt so much anymore, he got up, grabbed his cell phone, and found a number he often called.","The call went through after a while.","Nie Junwei’s expression was cold and solemn as he ordered arrogantly, “Find a few people to teach those two old farts a lesson. It’s best if you beat them up so that they won’t dare to find trouble with me again.”","* * *","Nie Junwei was surrounded by hooligans.","These people had done a lot of bullying with him, and they all knew that Nie Junwei’s family had a deep background and could settle anything.","All of them were bold and dared to do anything.","After Nie Junwei called, a group of hooligans from all walks of life gathered and blocked the path that the victim’s parents had to pass to leave the hospital. They beat the old couple until they could not get up.","As they kicked and punched, they did not forget to shout—","“You two old farts, who gave you the guts to cause trouble for my bro? Ah, you don’t want to live anymore, right? Then go down and die with your short-lived son!”","“Beat them up! Beat them to death!”","There were a lot of people and cars outside the hospital.","It was impossible to ignore so many hooligans ganging up on the old couple. Even if passersby did not want to cause trouble, seeing the two old people being beaten up, a few people couldn’t stand it anymore and stood up to stop their evil deeds.","For such matters, as long as one person bravely stood up, a second and third person would immediately follow.","Some people stood out to dissuade them, some called the police, and some went to get the hospital security officers... The situation was gradually getting out of control as more and more people surrounded them.","The troublemakers exchanged glances and cursed, then pushed away the indignant crowd and left arrogantly.","* * *","Half a day later.","Nie Tao had just received the news that Nie Junwei had done something behind his back.","He almost vomited blood. He wanted to rush home to beat up that unfilial son. However, in the Murdoch family’s presence, he could only grit his teeth and smile apologetically. “I’m sorry, I didn’t teach my son well. Don’t worry, I’ll give you an explanation.”"]},{"number":3538,"title":"Chapter 3538: No Reporters Are Allowed to Enter the Hospital","paragraphs":["Chapter 3538: No Reporters Are Allowed to Enter the Hospital","Editor: Atlas Studios","The Murdoch family’s people did not hide the contempt on their faces. They did not beat around the bush and said concisely, “Mr. Nie, we don’t care how you educate your son. However, since we promised the Empress we would help, we also hope you can manage the child and not cause trouble for us.”","Nie Tao’s face turned red as if he had been slapped. He could only nod repeatedly. “You’re right.”","“This time, the incident outside the hospital caused a huge commotion. Many people took videos and uploaded them online. We control a portion of the media and can block reports on this matter, but we can’t completely control public opinion.”","“You mean...?”","The other party did not stand on ceremony. “I hope your son can go to the hospital and personally communicate with the victims. It’s best if we can settle. As long as the other party doesn’t pursue this matter, all the problems will be resolved. Don’t you think so, Mr. Nie?”","Nie Tao’s heart was bitter. “Yes, what you said makes sense.”","However, he knew his youngest son’s temper very well.","It was already difficult to resolve this matter. Moreover, the other party was in no shortage of money and their only son had died. To reconcile was harder than ascending to the heavens.","This matter might have been resolved peacefully if Nie Junwei had not hired hooligans to beat up the old couple.","He had already planned to meet them and play the emotional card so they would be soft-hearted and accept the reconciliation.","Now it seemed... everything was ruined.","Things had come to this.","Nie Tao could only prepare for the worst. He looked up, his eyes shrewd and capable. “What if I want to suppress this news?”","The Murdoch family’s representative shrugged their shoulders as if they did not understand what he meant.","Nie Tao rolled up his cufflinks, and his words revealed the sense of superiority in the bones of the reclusive families. “What I’m saying is that we also have to make plans if we can’t reconcile. If things really reach that point and the other party’s company happens to go bankrupt, they will insist on an explanation and even do something drastic. Under such circumstances, can we block the news?”","The Murdoch family had hundreds of years of history and the representative had received a good education. Even though they had seen many dark sides of human nature, they couldn’t help but look at him at his hint of suppressing and persecuting the victim’s family. Their expressions showed their disdain.","However, everyone was in the same boat. They were all members of the reclusive families.","Even if the representative scoffed at Nie Tao’s suggestion and felt disgusted, they had no choice but to answer him coldly on Nie Qingru’s account. “If the other party becomes an ordinary person, of course, it’s not easy for him to appear on the news.”","“Okay, thank you.” How could Nie Tao not see the unconcealed disgust in the other party’s eyes? He held his breath and called in his assistant with a smile. “Send Mr. Murdoch back.”","The young man flicked the creases on his suit and coldly rejected his good intentions. “No need. I can go back by myself.”","“Then I’ll get my assistant to send you out.” Nie Tao did not insist. He motioned to his assistant and watched as they left the office.","He waited for them to walk away before smashing the cup with an ugly expression. He returned to his desk, picked up the office line, and made a call in a low voice. “From now on, get someone to camp at the hospital. The media and reporters are not allowed to interview them. Stop anyone who might be a reporter. Don’t let them in.”","“Yes,” a solemn voice replied."]},{"number":3539,"title":"Chapter 3539: Sun, You Did Well This Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 3539: Sun, You Did Well This Time","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Also...” Nie Tao paused, not wanting to do that.","The reason he did not want to do this was not because he had a strong sense of right and wrong, but purely because he did not want to clean up Nie Junwei’s mess.","But these subtle emotions couldn’t compare to the Nie Family’s face and reputation.","Nie Tao quickly lowered his voice. “Think of a way to destroy their company. Hurry up. We must settle this matter while they’re hospitalized and can’t do anything to stop us.”","“Okay.”","Nie Tao hung up.","He sat back in the leather swivel chair and casually picked up an unread document. He flipped it open and quickly put the matter behind him.","* * *","The independent continent.","Qiao Nian slept for 10 hours.","When she woke up, the sun had already set outside. The setting sun dyed the blue sky like a colorful brush that had been knocked over.","Qiao Nian rubbed her forehead, still sleepy. She casually curled up in the armchair, not wanting to move.","She propped up her long legs casually, grabbed her cell phone, and turned it on. The first thing she saw was a missed call from a private number.","Qiao Nian’s mind was in a mess for a moment. She narrowed her eyes as she looked at the screen.","As it was a private number, the IP and number were not displayed.","She had no intention of investigating.","Just as she was about to put the matter behind her, her cell phone dinged with a new text message.","Coincidentally, it was also a private number.","Supporting her chin with her hand, she casually clicked on the message.","——[Are you taking revenge on me by not accepting the call?]","This insufferably arrogant tone, and this attitude of questioning without saying a word.","Other than Nie Qingru, she couldn’t think of anyone else.","Qiao Nian blocked the number and deleted the message. She had no interest in asking why Nie Qingru was calling her.","After blocking Nie Qingru’s number, she quickly received a call from Guan Yan.","Having just woken up, Qiao Nian leaned against the soft cushion in frustration and accepted the call. “What’s the matter?”","“Sun, you’re going to anger the old witch this time. That’s too ruthless! However, they reap what they sow. They don’t leave any leeway in their actions. They’re too arrogant.”","Guan Yan’s voice came out from the cell phone, sounding very happy.","“The Continent M is in an uproar, and the reclusive families’ reputation has been affected. As the Empress, if her family doesn’t explain such a scandal, I’m afraid it will be difficult to convince the public. Sun, you did well this time!”","Qiao Nian listened quietly before casually interrupting, “What happened?”","Guan Yan was stunned.","“You don’t know?”","“Mm.”","Qiao Nian’s eyes were a little dry as she pressed her temples, looking very relaxed. “I just woke up.”","This undoubtedly meant that this matter had nothing to do with her. She had not interfered or done anything.","Guan Yan cursed and briefly told her what the second-generation heir of the Nie family had done in Continent M. He also told her about the subsequent situation.","“Originally, this matter had already been suppressed by Nie Tao. The Jin Corporation was also maliciously acquired under his instructions, and the company’s shares plummeted... Who knew that at this moment, news of his son’s drunk-driving accident would be exposed? Before the Nie family could suppress the news, someone posted a video of Nie Junwei hiring hooligans to beat the victim’s old parents. The matter suddenly blew up.","“Now, public opinion has caused a chain reaction. Nie Junwei has been hiding at home after the car accident and hasn’t been summoned by the police.”"]},{"number":3540,"title":"Chapter 3540: Sister Nian Wants to See What Nie Qingru Plans to Do","paragraphs":["Chapter 3540: Sister Nian Wants to See What Nie Qingru Plans to Do","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Other than that, some people also began to question why the Jin family’s old couple’s interview hadn’t come out yet...","“The other members of the Nie family will be implicated sooner or later if this continues.”","Qiao Nian did not expect so many things to happen in the short half a day she had been sleeping. She now knew the reason for the messages Nie Qingru had sent her in exasperation.","“It wasn’t me.”","Her voice was still slightly hoarse and quite cold.","But she already knew who did it.","“I thought it was you.” Guan Yan leaned against the ferry deck.","The wind blew her curly hair, and a pair of charming and amorous peach blossom eyes were smiling at this moment, flamboyant and bright.","“Nie Qingru definitely didn’t expect things to turn out like this. The Nie Family’s younger generation is also outstanding and used to being arrogant. Not only did they not stop after provoking a life-threatening lawsuit, they even dared to send people to beat up the victim’s family members. Tsk, I don’t know if I should say that he’s brainless or that the Nie Family taught him well.”","Guan Yan still didn’t know about Qiao Nian’s relationship with Nie Qingru, so she had no ill intentions. “Let’s see how the Nie family deals with this mess now.”","Qiao Nian did not understand the ins and outs of this matter, so she did not express her opinion. She only said calmly, “I’ll hang up first.”","Guan Yan guessed that Qiao Nian was going to investigate this matter, so she did not delay her. “Alright, hang up. I’ll reach the independent continent the day after tomorrow. I’ll text you when I arrive.”","“You’re coming to the independent continent?” Qiao Nian was surprised.","Guan Yan did not explain herself. She only said, “I have something to do.”","“Okay.” Qiao Nian did not ask further and hung up.","Then, she looked up the search bar for the car accident that Guan Yan had told her about. She also scrolled through the news but found nothing about the car accident.","The cause and effect of the incident was simple. Nie Junwei hit someone while drunk and drove away, leaving the victim behind without calling for an ambulance. The victim was only sent to the hospital half an hour later.","The unlucky victim died two days ago.","During this period, the Nie Family was extremely arrogant. No one tried to solve the problem with the victim’s family. Only when the victim died did Nie Tao call a lawyer to talk to the victim’s family about compensation.","However, the victim’s family background was not bad. The family did not accept the financial compensation proposed by the Nie family and asked Nie Junwei to apologize and accept the proper investigation.","Speaking of this, there was still room for negotiation at that moment.","But after that, the beating incident at the entrance of the hospital pushed this matter to an irreversible point.","Now that this series of events had been exposed, the Nie Family suddenly went from being in control of the entire situation to being passive.","Qiao Nian immediately noticed the media outlet that interviewed the victim’s family.","She paused on the name before copying it and searching for the capital behind it.","As expected, the Murdochs were one of the investors.","The Murdoch family was also a member of the reclusive families.","Qiao Nian could guess who got the Murdoch family involved in this matter. Without Nie Qingru’s approval, the Murdoch family would definitely not have interfered in the Nie family’s matter.","To her, an innocent life and the pain of parents who had lost their children were not as important as her reputation.","This was Nie Qingru.","Someone who could turn against her family.","In her eyes, only herself was the most important.","Qiao Nian looked at the overwhelming news reports online and was suddenly curious about how Nie Qingru planned to quell the public anger this time."]},{"number":3541,"title":"Chapter 3541: Master Wang, Are You Protecting Her?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3541: Master Wang, Are You Protecting Her?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Downstairs.","Bo Jingxing was also asking Ye Wangchuan about this.","“Are you interfering in Continent M’s matters?”","“Mm.”","Ye Wangchuan was wearing a khaki sweater today. The hem hung lazily on his waist, giving him a relaxed feeling of home.","Bo Jingxing looked as he opened the fridge door and took out a water bottle. He unscrewed it and took a sip. His Adam’s apple under the cold white skin moved up and down, sexy and seductive.","“The news has already spread online. What do you plan to do next?” He stared at the man’s good-looking eyebrows and asked as he leaned against the sofa.","Ye Wangchuan walked over with the bottle. “Let’s see what they plan to do.”","Bo Jingxing looked as he unhurriedly sat down, placed the water bottle on the table, and crossed his long legs, looking lazy and arrogant. He couldn’t help but ask, “Are you taking revenge for your girlfriend? Are you so protective of her?”","He had also heard about the event at Mingshui Mansion.","He knew the reclusive families often interfered behind Qiao Nian’s back.","However, he did not expect Ye Wangchuan to counterattack so quickly. He almost immediately taught the other party a lesson.","He had grown up with Ye Wangchuan. They were all from the same courtyard.","Bo Jingxing knew Ye Wangchuan’s temper better than anyone.","Ye Wangchuan liked to take things slowly, one step at a time. Even when dealing with people who had offended him, he took his time and played with them until the other party had no way out and realized their mistake. In other words, such a person would never bother to end the battle quickly and take revenge immediately.","Because it was degrading.","At least in Ye Wangchuan’s worldview, this was too degrading.","However, this time, he gave up his principles for Qiao Nian and broke his usual style of handling things.","Only now did Bo Jingxing realize how far they had come.","“The Ye family is protective of their own.” Ye Wangchuan did not answer him directly. His eyes curled up. “Besides, shouldn’t I be protective of my own?”","Bo Jingxing was stunned. He thought for a moment and nodded sincerely. “You should.”","If it were him, he might not be as aggressive as Ye Wangchuan, but he would probably protect his girlfriend.","Unfortunately, he did not have a girlfriend and what passionate love was like.","According to his life plan, he would probably not meet anyone like that in this life. If nothing went wrong, upon reaching the right age, he would find someone of equal status according to his family’s wishes. They would enter a friendly state of marriage, then respect each other and keep a distance for the rest of their lives...","Bo Jingxing was only distracted for a moment. He looked up and asked the biggest question in his heart, “Do you think the Nie family will give up on Nie Junwei?”","Ye Wangchuan picked up his cell phone and rubbed his fingers against the screen, hesitating whether to send the girl a WeChat message.","Hearing this, his eyelids drooped and he said casually, “It’s best if they give up on him. It doesn’t matter if they don’t. What I want isn’t the life of a junior of the Nie Family, but the person behind them paying the price.”","Bo Jingxing fell silent upon hearing this. He knew that Ye Wangchuan had a plan in mind and should have a backup plan. If the Nie family did not give up on Nie Junwei, they would probably pay a heavier price.","Just as he was thinking this, Ye Wangchuan’s cell phone suddenly rang.","Bo Jingxing looked as he lowered his head and glanced at the caller ID, then picked it up and asked in a low voice, “What’s the matter?”","The other end did not know what to say.","He looked as Ye Wangchuan’s eyes narrowed and he leaned back slightly, with a hint of decisiveness in his nonchalance. “Pfft, then let’s give them another surprise.”"]},{"number":3542,"title":"Chapter 3542: They Thought They Could Protect Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 3542: They Thought They Could Protect Him","Editor: Atlas Studios","Continent M.","Nie Junwei was taken away by the police a few hours ago.","Everyone in the Nie Family knew that he was hiding this matter.","Old Master Nie was so angry that his blood pressure soared and he was almost sent to the hospital.","The other families took this opportunity to add insult to injury and to crack wise.","Nie Tao endured his sister’s sarcasm as he went out to make a few calls. Finally, he called his connection among the council members and the other party agreed to help.","About half an hour later, Nie Tao received a call from the police station informing him that he could pay the bail money.","The Nie Family had a huge business.","Nie Junwei had got into a life-and-death case. The bail was not a small sum.","Nie Tao brought his lawyer and secretary to the bank to withdraw the money. Then, he rushed to the police station where Nie Junwei was temporarily detained.","Arriving outside the police station and seeing the media swarming over it, they realized that the news of Nie Junwei being locked up here had already spread.","“Mr. Nie, I’ll get out of the car first. You can get out later.”","The lawyer turned his head and whispered, “I’ll block the reporters for you. Please don’t answer their questions. Is that okay?”","Even inside the car, Nie Tao could hear the reporters asking questions about the car accident. He immediately rubbed his eyebrows and nodded slightly, looking unconcerned. “Sure.”","After a short exchange between the lawyer and the secretary, they left the car and stood in front of the reporters who swarmed forward, blocking the media who wanted to interview them.","“I’m sorry, we don’t do interviews.”","“Excuse me. Excuse me.”","At this moment, Nie Tao opened the door and entered the police station with his bag under the chauffeur’s escort.","Some reporters asked questions.","“Mr. Nie, is it true that your son killed someone while drunk driving?”","“Mr. Nie, I heard that your son drove away after the incident. Is that true? Were the hooligans who beat up the victim’s family outside the hospital hired by your son?”","The questions were sharp.","Nie Tao’s status was high, and it was rare for him to be questioned like this. His face was as black as the bottom of a pot, and he was silent as he left all the reporters behind.","Because he had pulled some strings, the bailing process was very smooth.","Nie Tao paid the bail and signed the relevant guarantee. Not long after, Nie Junwei was released. Upon seeing him, he ran over in surprise.","“Dad.”","Compared to Nie Junwei’s happiness, Nie Tao did not even want to speak to him. Not looking him in the eye, he said coldly, “Let’s go home!”","* * *","When they came out, more reporters and media were waiting for them. The small area outside the police station was filled with people.","Even though Nie Tao’s secretary and lawyer tried their best to block them, there were so many reporters that it was impossible.","The lawyer reacted quickly and whispered into Nie Tao’s ear, “Mr. Nie, I’m going inside to ask the police for help. Wait for me here.”","“Okay.”","Nie Tao nodded.","The lawyer quickly went in to get help.","However, the reporters refused to let them off and continued to ask questions.","Nie Tao expressionlessly ignored them.","The reporters still refused to let go and kept asking questions.","However, Nie Junwei was used to being arrogant. Even though he had just been bailed out, he could tell that his father’s expression was dark, and he did not dare to be rash."]},{"number":3543,"title":"Chapter 3543: The Tables Have Turned","paragraphs":["Chapter 3543: The Tables Have Turned","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, seeing that the reporters were all questioning him, he couldn’t hold it in anymore. Before Nie Tao could react, he suddenly glared at one of the reporters.","“Does it have anything to do with me that they were beaten up outside the hospital? What right do you have to say that I ordered it? Who knows whether they came up with it themselves?”","Nie Tao shouted angrily, “Nie Junwei, shut up!”","Nie Junwei turned his head away in humiliation as if he were the one who had been wronged. He did not say a word.","However, he had already spoken, which undoubtedly broke the silence that Nie Tao and the lawyer had agreed on.","This forced Nie Tao to respond to the car accident that had caused such a commotion.","He quickly weighed the pros and cons before facing the reporters’ raised lenses and gently saying, “We don’t deny that we should take most of the responsibility for the car accident. It’s just that the rumors about drunk driving online are not accurate. My son did drink, but his alcohol content did not meet the drunk driving standard.","“At that time, he drove away because he was too young. He panicked and didn’t know what to do, so he didn’t stay behind to deal with the aftermath. Later on, he also told me that he was wrong. After we found out about this, we immediately arranged a hospital for the victim and looked for the victim’s family to discuss the matter. It’s just a pity that we didn’t reach a settlement...”","A reporter took the opportunity to ask a sharp question. “Then, Mr. Nie, there are rumors circulating that the beating of the victim’s family outside the hospital is related to your son. Do you know about this?”","Nie Tao’s temples throbbed, but his expression did not change. “Firstly, I was also angry when I heard about this. Secondly, I want to say that this matter has nothing to do with my son.","“I’m very angry that someone would do such an arrogant and despotic thing, but my son has been at home for the past few days. I can assure everyone that this matter has nothing to do with him!”","“But online—” The reporter still wanted to bite on this.","Nie Tao interrupted him. “It’s all speculation on the Internet. Now that everyone has ill intentions towards Junwei, they think any ridiculous speculation is real.”","This meant that Nie Junwei was a good person. At the very least, he was an innocent young man who was not good with words.","He looked sincere as if everyone had really misunderstood Nie Junwei, causing the reporters not to know what to say.","This was the effect Nie Tao wanted. He looked at the time on his wristwatch and turned around to see the lawyer bringing someone over.","His heart was finally at ease, and he was about to bring Nie Junwei home.","Right at this moment!","A voice cut in from beyond the reporters.","“I-I’m here to turn myself in.”","In this situation where everyone was silent, these words were like throwing a stone into the calm lake.","With a swoosh, everyone’s eyes were focused on the few hooligans with swollen faces beyond the crowd.","Nie Junwei’s expression changed when he saw them. “You guys—”","Nie Tao looked at his reaction and then at the few hooligans past the crowd, who were avoiding his eyes and not daring to look at him. His heart, which had finally calmed down, suddenly rose as an ominous feeling enveloped him.","Sure enough, he felt someone looking in his direction."]},{"number":3544,"title":"Chapter 3544: Warning from Master Wang","paragraphs":["Chapter 3544: Warning from Master Wang","Editor: Atlas Studios","The few hooligans pointed at by Nie Junwei shook as they admitted in front of all the media and spotlights, “We are the ones who beat up Old Mr. Jin and Old Mrs. Jin in front of the hospital previously.”","The reporters’ reaction was explosive.","“It’s them!”","“Quick, focus the camera on them.”","“Take it.”","The man seemed prepared to say something. Without needing the reporters to ask, he confessed everything.","“It was Master Jun who instigated us. He said that those two old things kept clinging to him and asking him to take responsibility for killing their son. They refused to take the money, so he asked us to teach them a lesson. We were just following orders.","“If you don’t believe me, I still have the record of the call.” He fumbled for his cell phone. “Wait, I’ll show you.”","The next second, he flipped the phone to show it to the reporters at the scene. There was a call recording of Nie Junwei and him, about five minutes.","The time was one hour before the beating at the hospital.","This caused an uproar outside the police station.","No one expected things to turn around at this moment. The hooligans Nie Junwei had hired turned themselves in.","He even took out his call history with Nie Junwei.","This went against everything Nie Tao had just told them. Nie Junwei was no innocent and good child as he portrayed.","The reporters quickly pointed countless cameras and microphones at Nie Tao, who had a cold and ugly expression, asking for an explanation.","“Mr. Nie, Mr. Nie, do you have anything to say to him?”","“Mr. Nie, didn’t you say this matter had nothing to do with your son? How do you explain it now? Did your son really get someone to beat up the victim’s family outside the hospital?”","One question after another stabbed Nie Tao like a sharp knife. His expression was ugly, but he pursed his lips tightly and did not say anything.","He was unable to answer these questions.","Once they realized that Nie Junwei had drunk-driven, causing someone’s death, and even hired hooligans to beat up the victim’s family, they realized how evil that was!","Once this kind of news spread, it would be enough to destroy the reputation that the Nie Family had accumulated for a hundred years.","However, the ‘evidence’ just so happened to come knocking on their door. It was also when he denied Nie Junwei’s involvement in this matter that it gave him a resounding slap in the face.","Now, he could even hear the crisp sound of the slap on his face, making his ears ring. He thought of something and subconsciously looked out of the crowd as if searching for the one behind it.","Because he did not believe that such a coincidence could happen.","He also did not believe these hooligans would dare to turn themselves in if no one instructed them.","Nie Tao quickly noticed a jeep parked at the intersection on the right. The window rolled down, and he saw a young man’s face.","The man in the car was also looking at him. Their eyes met across the distance.","Nie Tao saw the other party smile. He dropped his cigarette and made a mouth shape for him. It was—the independent continent.","Arrogant.","Completely arrogant!","This kind of provocative behavior was comparable to Nie Junwei’s usual style.","However, they had always been the ones who treated others like this. When had it ever been their turn to have their faces stepped on and provoked?","Nie Tao’s face suddenly darkened, and his heart trembled. A figure had already appeared in his mind.","Independent continent...","He didn’t know what had happened in the independent continent recently, but he vaguely felt that their family’s misfortune this time was related to one person.","Qiao Nian!"]},{"number":3545,"title":"Chapter 3545: They Didn’t Call Me at All","paragraphs":["Chapter 3545: They Didn’t Call Me at All","Editor: Atlas Studios","An hour later.","Nie Qingru’s car rolled over the fallen leaves as it drove into the Nie residence.","She called Nie Tao before coming. The living room was filled with both old and young, but the atmosphere was too heavy.","Everyone sat in their seats. They either had their heads lowered while drinking coffee or looked out the window. No one spoke.","Even the weak Old Master Nie made an appearance. He looked at everyone as he was wheeled into the living room by a Filipino maid.","“Dad.” Nie Tao went over to help the Filipino maid push the wheelchair to the center.","The other members also put down their miscellaneous tasks and looked at Old Master Nie, greeting him respectfully.","Old Master Nie did not look at anyone. His voice sounded tired as he asked, “Where’s Qingru? She hasn’t arrived yet?”","Nie Tao answered truthfully, “She called me and said she’s on the way. She should be here soon.”","Old Master Nie stopped talking.","...","In fact, Nie Qingru had arrived outside the residence while they were talking.","Before entering, she received a call from the council member on good terms with the Nie family. Just as she placed the phone to her ear, an anxious voice came from the other end.","“Empress, I only agreed to help them because of you. In the end, things have turned out like this. The media is clinging to me and won’t let me go. The higher-ups have already begun to investigate me...”","There was no explicit blame in the other party’s words, but every word was accusatory.","Nie Qingru took a deep breath, and her pitch-black eyes revealed a hint of coldness. “Councilman Allen, you’re blaming me.”","Afraid of her, Councilman Allen tried to smooth things over. “Your Majesty, you know that’s not what I meant. It’s just that this matter has blown up too much and the impact is too bad.","“The election is next month, and I still hope to participate. But if I can’t resolve this matter, I don’t even know how far my career as a senator can go...","“Do you understand my difficulties?”","“Don’t worry, I’ll give you an explanation.” Nie Qingru was smart and naturally understood the meaning between the lines.","Councilman Allen was not at ease, but there was no better way. He could only believe she could handle this mess.","“Then I’ll have to trouble you, Empress.”","“It’s only right of me.”","Nie Qingru hung up and put the phone down. She sat in silence for a long time.","Shadow opened the door, and seeing her furious expression, asked softly, “Was it the councilman?”","Nie Qingru pressed a hand between her eyebrows as if she wanted to suppress her anger. “Heh. Up until now, the council members, the police, and the Privy Council have contacted me. Only, they haven’t called me to explain why they didn’t listen to me! They’re sure that I’ll clean up their mess for them. This is my good family!”","The Nies were such a hypocritical, scheming, and cold-blooded family.","As one of them, no matter how much she hated these people, she couldn’t get rid of her background and change the blood flowing in her veins.","Shadow was silent for a moment. “Did Qiao Nian do that at the police station?”","Nie Qingru’s frown deepened, and her tone was displeased. “Who else besides her?”","“I don’t think it’s her style.”","Qiao Nian was more direct.","She did not usually scheme this much.","Nie Qingru dropped her hand and looked at him sharply as if examining his inner heart. After a moment, she looked away. “Even if it’s not her, it’s related to her.”"]},{"number":3546,"title":"Chapter 3546: Miss Qiao, I’m Looking For You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3546: Miss Qiao, I’m Looking For You","Editor: Atlas Studios","Silence.","Shadow detected the disgust in her words. It was as if she did not care to find out if Qiao Nian was the one behind it. She just wanted to blame it on Qiao Nian.","He did not want to provoke Nie Qingru anymore. He lowered his eyes and said to the woman in the car, “The Old Master and the others have been waiting for you for a long time.”","Nie Qingru endured it, picked up her bag, and strode into the villa without saying a word.","* * *","Qiao Nian did not know that Nie Qingru blamed her for this.","In her room upstairs, she sent the sorted data to Xu Yi, then chatted with him about the next experiment before turning off her laptop and going downstairs.","She had just left the room when her cell phone vibrated.","As Qiao Nian walked towards the stairs, she glanced down at the screen and was not surprised to see a certain someone’s WeChat message.","[Y: Are you awake?]","With one hand in her pocket and the other holding her cell phone, she bit on a fruit candy with a nonchalant expression.","Seeing the message, Qiao Nian bit the fruit candy harder. The sour and sweet fruit taste spread in her mouth, and the girl stopped in her tracks. She licked her dry lips, narrowed her eyes, and typed a reply with a focused expression.","***","Downstairs.","Mo Dong had already finished cleaning up the Mingshui Mansion matter and came over with the dishes he had ordered to be delivered from the private restaurant.","He placed the bags on the dining table before scanning the villa without finding a familiar figure.","He turned around and asked the arrogant and lazy man, “Master Wang, Miss Qiao isn’t at home?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Bo Jingxing leaned against the wall and smiled leisurely. “Why do I feel that Mo Dong and the rest care more about Qiao Nian than you?”","Embarrassed, Mo Dong touched his scar uncomfortably and explained awkwardly, “No, no. I was just asking. It’s mainly because Miss Qiao—”","At this point, he was too embarrassed to continue.","What could he say?","Could he say he admired Miss Qiao more and treated her as his idol?","However, Miss Qiao had just turned 20 and was still young. As a man in his thirties, he felt it wouldn’t be good for Miss Qiao’s reputation if he said this in public.","Although he stayed in the independent continent where the strong were respected and gender and age did not matter, he roughly knew that it was not like this outside.","The people in Beijing were more reserved.","The more he thought about it, the more stifled he became. His rough face flushed red as he stammered, “Anyway, it’s not what you think. I just didn’t see Miss Qiao and was just asking.”","If Mo Xi was here, he would most likely ask the same question.","How natural was that?","It was as if Young Master Bo did not treat Master Wang as their master.","Seeing how serious he was, Bo Jingxing quickly waved his hand and coughed before apologizing. “I was just joking. Don’t take it seriously.”","Then, he took the initiative to say, “Qiao Nian is still sleeping upstairs.”","Before Mo Dong could say anything, Qin Si, playing games on the sofa diagonally across them, saw the person coming down the stairs and called out, “Sister Qiao.”","The awkward atmosphere was instantly broken.","Bo Jingxing and Mo Dong looked at the stairs on the second floor at the same time. Indeed, they saw a girl in a hoodie coming down the stairs.","Mo Dong ignored Bo Jingxing and quickly went up to her. “Miss Qiao, I was looking for you.”","Not only did he ignore Bo Jingxing, but he also ignored Ye Wangchuan, who was walking over. He strode towards Qiao Nian."]},{"number":3547,"title":"Chapter 3547: If She Wants Them, I Can Give Them to Her","paragraphs":["Chapter 3547: If She Wants Them, I Can Give Them to Her","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian looked at him in confusion. The mist in her eyes had not dissipated. It was obvious that she had just woken up and was not in a good state.","“Is something the matter?”","“It’s about Mingshui Mansion.”","“Oh.” Qiao Nian nodded and said, “Let’s talk over there.”","Mo Dong followed her to the corner cooperatively, looking like he was Qiao Nian’s subordinate.","Bo Jingxing couldn’t help but click his tongue when he saw this. He pushed his glasses up his nose bridge and looked at a certain someone with a faint smile.","“Your subordinate has been poached.”","Mo Dong, Gu San, Ji Lin... His people were all surrounding Qiao Nian. As the real master, he did not seem to have any face.","He was more or less joking. He also wanted to see Ye Wangchuan’s attitude.","Unexpectedly, Ye Wangchuan only looked in Mo Dong and Qiao Nian’s direction and walked towards the dining hall without minding it.","“She doesn’t have to poach them.","“If she wants them, I can give them to her.”","If this were in ancient times, he would definitely be a foolish ruler blinded by lust.","Bo Jingxing touched the bridge of his nose and knew what to do.","He followed him.","* * *","On the other side.","Qiao Nian did not know they were talking about her.","She found a relatively quiet corner and let Mo Dong speak directly.","Mo Dong briefly explained what had happened in Mingshui Mansion after she left, focusing on one person.","“President Simon of the Chamber of Commerce Alliance is close to Three Nine Gate. It seems they have an unspeakable deal in private.","“I remember that Number 15 is from Three Nine Gate.","“Were you attacked by this person at Mingshui Mansion?” Mo Dong’s face was serious. “If that’s the case, then this matter is definitely related to the Chamber of Commerce Alliance.”","Qiao Nian guessed that Nie Qingru was behind it, but she had yet to find out who it really was.","At this moment, she was rubbing the cold lighter. Her eyes were cold as the corners of her lips curled up. “Simon from the Chamber of Commerce Alliance?”","She did not expect Simon to be involved.","She had some impression of this person. He was a classic profiteer. During her conflict with Ji Ziyin, the Chamber of Commerce Alliance was like a creeper on the wall. One moment, it was leaning toward this side, and the next moment, it was leaning towards that side.","However, Simon was a very cautious person. Even though he was mercenary, he was not detestable.","On the surface, he was a first-rate martial artist. He was also smart and knew how to speak and do things.","She didn’t know how Nie Qingru persuaded Simon to get involved this time that he was even willing to take the risk to assassinate her. However, she could guess with her toes that among the benefits Nie Qingru promised, there must be a share of the Ji family’s assets.","She was really thinking about reaping the benefits before she even died.","Qiao Nian felt vexed for no reason. She played with the lighter for a while, then raised her thin eyelids and said to Mo Dong, who was waiting for her instructions, “Let’s ignore him for now. We’ll talk after I’m done with what I’m doing.”","The most important thing now was not to clean up these small fries but to obtain Ji Lingfeng’s antidote.","It was not too late to clean up the Chamber of Commerce Alliance after settling Ji Lingfeng’s matter. After this incident, with Simon’s personality, he should act more cautious and not dare to provoke her easily. That was enough.","“Okay.”","Although Mo Dong didn’t know what Qiao Nian had to deal with, he trusted her and agreed without hesitation."]},{"number":3548,"title":"Chapter 3548: If I Don’t Do Something, I’ll Be Letting Her Text Down","paragraphs":["Chapter 3548: If I Don’t Do Something, I’ll Be Letting Her Text Down","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian looked up at him and saw that he was looking at her with bright eyes. She put the lighter back into her pocket and pressed the brim of her baseball cap before looking away. “Let’s go over first.”","She walked in front as if nothing had happened.","Mo Dong followed her and stopped talking about the Chamber of Commerce Alliance and Simon. It was as if their conversation had never even taken place.","...","Dinner was brought by Mo Dong from a very popular private restaurant in the independent continent.","It was obvious that the food was not cheap. The takeout boxes were all red wooden with exquisite dishes inside.","The taste was light and sweet, similar to the southern flavors.","Because Mo Dong did not know Qiao Nian’s preferences, the few dishes were all sweet.","Qiao Nian did not eat much, but she was not picky either. She did not put down her chopsticks the entire time. It was just that her eating speed was neither fast nor slow. Those who knew her knew that she only acted this way when the food was not to her liking.","Ye Wangchuan scooped a bowl of seafood porridge and pushed it to her. He knew that the food Mo Dong brought back this time was not to her liking, so he handed her a spoon with his slender and smooth hand. “Eat some porridge tonight. It’s light and good for your stomach.”","Qiao Nian put down her chopsticks and took the spoon from him, replying casually, “Okay.”","She lowered her head and scooped porridge, seemingly not wanting to speak.","Mo Dong belatedly realized something. “Miss Qiao, are the dishes I ordered not to your liking?”","The girl gave him face and shook her head. “I’m not picky.”","Ye Wangchuan glanced at her with a faint smile but did not expose her.","She wasn’t picky and ate whatever she was given. She rarely complained, but she would also eat as much as she liked. For example, she would eat more if the food suited her taste.","Tonight’s food was not to her liking. She still had some, but not much. She just sat there politely without leaving.","Sometimes, Ye Wangchuan felt that she was actually softer than most people. At least, this time, she did not have to care about Mo Dong’s feelings.","But Qiao Nian considered his feelings. Although she had a bad temper, she still patiently ate the food.","Mo Dong was relieved that she had indeed eaten some and did not seem to dislike it.","During this period, she chatted with Bo Jingxing about the situation of a few energy companies in the independent continent. It was probably because Bo Jingxing wanted the Ninth Branch to cooperate with them.","Qiao Nian quickly finished the porridge. Almost full and bored to death, she put down the spoon and suddenly looked at the man beside her with her bright eyes under the light. “I heard from Guan Yan about what happened in Continent M. What do you plan to do next?”","Ye Wangchuan also put down his chopsticks and pushed the bowl away. His dark eyes met hers and he asked, “How far do you want to go?”","Qiao Nian rested her hand on the table. Her fingertips touched the edge of the porcelain bowl, and the coldness went from her fingertips to her heart.","There was a spark in her heart that could ignite at any moment.","However, Nie Qingru and the people from the reclusive families always tried to play with fire.","“She sent me a message asking if I was behind it.” Qiao Nian supported her chin with her fair hand and narrowed her eyes. “Since she said so, I’ll be letting her down if I don’t do anything.”"]},{"number":3549,"title":"Chapter 3549: Master Wang’s Thunderous Methods","paragraphs":["Chapter 3549: Master Wang’s Thunderous Methods","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan peeled an orange and handed it over casually. “Then let the fire burn brighter!”","Qiao Nian raised her eyebrows and slowly took the orange from him. She peeled a piece and threw it into her mouth. “... You still have something on her?”","“Eat slowly.” Ye Wangchuan carefully grabbed two tissues and handed them to her. His eyebrows moved slightly, and his thin lips curled up as if he were in control of the entire situation. “Not exactly, it’s just a small gift.”","Qiao Nian looked at him for a few seconds before looking away.","She had a vague idea of what he was going to do.","Every time Ye Wangchuan attacked, he was fast, accurate, and ruthless. The small gift he mentioned was probably enough to skin the Nie family and Nie Qingru alive.","However, what did it have to do with her if the Nie Family and Nie Qingru were unlucky?","**","Reality proved that Qiao Nian’s guess was right.","After Ye Wangchuan asked her what she thought and confirmed that she would not let Nie Qingru and the Nie family off, he told Ji Lin that he could release the evidence they still had.","Ji Lin was extremely efficient.","As soon as he received Ye Wangchuan’s order, he immediately found the political enemy of the council member on good terms with the Nie family and Nie Qingru and handed him a recording.","The election was imminent, and undercurrents were tense under the calm surface.","Nie Qingru’s good friend was young and good at poaching. He was one of the popular candidates in the election.","Only the son-in-law of the old governor could compete with him, and he had been trailing thus far.","The position of governor was about to be decided.","At this moment, this popular candidate was involved in Nie Junwei’s drunk-driving incident. As the opponent, how could they not seize this opportunity to drag him down...","Therefore, after Mr. Mas received the recording sent by Ji Lin in disguise, he quickly discussed it with his father-in-law and immediately decided to publicize it in the upcoming campaign speech to deal a painful blow to the other party.","So, in the ensuing college speech, the second most popular candidate for governor gave an impassioned account of his original speech, adding a scathing rebuke of abuse of privilege.","Right on the heels of that, he played a recording of his opponent’s conversation with the current head of the Nie family, Nie Tao, in front of hundreds of supporters.","In the recording, after exchanging pleasantries, Nie Tao asked Allen to help him pull strings to get his son out of the police station.","After Allen readily agreed, he asked Nie Tao to greet Her Majesty the Empress on his behalf.","Once the recording of this call was made public, it indeed caused a huge uproar.","Everyone was discussing whether Nie Junwei’s bail procedure was compliant with legal protocol.","On the other hand, some people noticed the ‘Empress’ Allen mentioned at the end of the call.","No wonder everyone turned their attention to Nie Qingru.","It was just that when Allen spoke to Nie Tao, his attitude was still relatively relaxed and equal. He even carried the politeness of being at ease.","At the mention of Her Majesty the Empress, his attitude changed 180 degrees, clearly different from when he spoke to Nie Tao carelessly, turning obsequious...","Empress Nie Qingru was pulled out of the ground and exposed to the public.","* * *","Nie Residence.","Nie Qingru received a call.","“Empress, didn’t you say you would give me an explanation? Is this what you mean by explanation? How could my conversation with your brother be made public? Did he do it, or...”"]},{"number":3550,"title":"Chapter 3550: Your Cell Phone Is Being Monitored?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3550: Your Cell Phone Is Being Monitored?","Editor: Atlas Studios","“I think it’s a hacker.”","“Alright. Even if this recording was hacked, how am I going to campaign for Governor after such a big incident? Do you know that the reporters are about to blow up my phone? Many reporters are also blocking my door. I contacted you through my assistant’s phone. The higher-ups have already begun to investigate me. If this continues, my career will be over!”","He regretted helping that idiot Nie Junwei to build a relationship with the reclusive families.","Who knew that things would turn out like this?","He was dragged into the mud as well.","...","He could have won this election, but because of these trivialities, his career was about to end.","And that was not the worst of it.","If Nie Qingru still could not come up with a solution, he might even be dragged into it.","Allen was extremely regretful!","“There’s clearly someone behind this. Empress, I don’t care who you’ve offended, even if it’s to settle this matter, I hope you can communicate with the other party properly. It’s best if you can make the other party stop here. Otherwise, I won’t care about anything anymore if I go to jail.”","His words were laced with threat.","However, he really couldn’t care less at this point.","If Nie Qingru couldn’t protect him, he wouldn’t hesitate to lash out at the Empress of Continent M once he was imprisoned.","He wasn’t at a dead end yet. He could still force the reclusive families to make a decision.","When it came to a dead end, even rabbits would bite.","Moreover, he had been dragged down so badly.","“Please consider my words carefully.” Allan’s voice was laced with anger as he hung up.","Nie Qingru’s well-maintained face was dark as she slowly pulled the phone away from her ear. Anyone could see the anger hidden in her eyes.","Her dark eyes narrowed dangerously as her gaze landed on her brother. She wanted to calm down, but the bulging veins on her forehead betrayed her emotions.","“Your cell phone is being monitored.”","“What?”","Nie Tao’s instincts prompted him to take out his cell phone and check it out, but he did not find anything wrong.","“My cell phone is fine. That’s impossible.”","“Hmph.” Nie Qingru sneered upon seeing he still did not know what he had done. “The recording of your conversation with Allen has been exposed. Do you still think it’s impossible?”","Nie Tao felt as if he had been struck by lightning. His vision darkened and he almost blacked out. He paled as he grabbed the collar of his shirt and looked at her in disbelief. “Then...”","“Allen called me just now to ask for an explanation. He said he will drag everyone down if we can’t resolve this matter.” Nie Qing stared at Nie Tao’s reaction like a poisonous snake.","As expected, her brother’s expression got worse and worse. His face gradually turned pale, and he seemed to have aged more than a year.","However, she could not sympathize with him and scolded him in a low voice, “I warned you long ago to control Nie Junwei. In the end, you allowed him to order someone to beat up the victim’s family. So what if he beat them up? He didn’t do it cleanly. He beat them up in public and then left. After that, he even let the hooligans make a scene turning themselves in at the police station!”","The more she spoke, the angrier she became. The more she spoke, the colder her tone became.","“...Are you satisfied now that the entire Nie Family and I are implicated? Do you have a solution?”","Nie Tao was scolded at his age in front of everyone, but he was in the wrong and could not say anything. He opened his mouth cautiously. “Qingru, you..."]},{"number":3551,"title":"Chapter 3551: Forced to Apologize","paragraphs":["Chapter 3551: Forced to Apologize","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Qingru seemed to know what he would say and immediately interrupted, “Heh, I don’t have a good idea either.”","Now that things had come to this, there was nothing else they could do.","The other party had already pushed them into a trap step by step. Now that their escape route had been cut off, they were just waiting to watch a good show.","The idiots in the room thought she had a solution and could easily resolve this dead-end situation.","In fact, everyone in the Nie Family really thought so.","...","After being scolded, Nie Tao was so anxious that his eyes were bloodshot. He wanted to beg her, but Old Master Nie, sitting in the wheelchair and not saying a word, stared at him, signaling him to shut up.","Although Nie Tao was extremely anxious, he still suppressed his anxiety upon seeing his father’s gaze. He pursed his lips and calmed down.","At this moment, Old Master Nie said slowly, “Qingru, I know that your elder brother was too rash this time and implicated you. But now is not the time to be angry. After this matter is resolved, you can take it out on him.”","Nie Qingru looked into the old man’s turbid eyes that did not forget to scheme and asked with a faint smile, “Do you think I’m throwing a tantrum?”","Old Master Nie did not say anything, but his face was filled with doubt as if asking her, “Isn’t that so?”","Nie Qingru’s face turned cold and she no longer looked at him. “I haven’t been in the mood for that since I was forced to marry someone I didn’t love at the age of 20.”","Everyone’s expressions changed.","Only Nie Qingru’s expression was cold and indifferent. Coupled with her outstanding bone structure and well-defined facial features, she was born with a special noble aura and easily gave off an “unreasonable” feeling.","Hearing this, Old Master Nie couldn’t put on airs anymore and hesitantly said, “Qingru, help the family again. I promise... that nothing like this will happen again.”","Nie Tao also hurriedly said, “I’ll definitely take good care of Junwei and won’t let him go out and cause trouble again.”","Shadow stood quietly beside Nie Qingru, wearing a black shirt and pants, as if he were a shadow blending into the darkness.","He looked at their hypocritical faces and then at his master’s expression, which he had long been used to. He felt extremely uncomfortable.","He wanted to interrupt and say that Nie Qingru had her own difficulties in the reclusive families. In her position, a slight move would affect the entire situation.","However, he was only a subordinate and had no right to interrupt.","Shadow swallowed his words, lowered his eyes, and returned to his usual expressionless face.","Time seemed to have stopped. The entire villa was silent.","Everyone was waiting for Nie Qingru’s answer.","In the past, when Old Master Nie pleaded for leniency, Nie Qingru would usually give him some face. She would make comments, but eventually, she would help.","This time, everyone felt like a knife was hanging above their hearts. They felt that Nie Qingru was really angry this time.","Fortunately, a few minutes later, Nie Qingru adjusted her velvet gloves and lowered her eyelashes before saying coldly and gracefully, “Since you’ve said so much, I’ll show you the way.”","Nie Tao said excitedly, “Tell me.”","Nie Qingru looked at him. “First, send Nie Junwei back to the police station immediately. Tell the public that you didn’t know anything and that you think the beating at the hospital’s entrance was a misunderstanding.”","Nie Tao’s expression changed.","He couldn’t accept this first rule.","Nie Qingru casually said he should send Nie Junwei back to the police station, but he was not stupid. He knew what it meant.","Nie Qingru did not care if he accepted it and continued, “Secondly, you’ll apologize to the public and say that you made a mistake because you love your son. However, Nie Junwei’s bail was as per the procedure. Of course, you’re willing to put righteousness before family and let him undergo judicial trial.”"]},{"number":3552,"title":"Chapter 3552: She Wants to Prove She Didn’t Do Anything Wrong","paragraphs":["Chapter 3552: She Wants to Prove She Didn’t Do Anything Wrong","Editor: Atlas Studios","Nie Tao’s expression changed, and his shoulders started to tremble as he looked at his sister in disbelief.","The first move was to give up on his son.","The second was to slap his own face in public.","The price of resolving this matter was too high!","Nie Qingru continued, “Thirdly, I’ll go to the hospital with you. It’s best if we can settle with the victim’s family. It’ll be best if they can forgive us. Even if they can’t, it would at least appease them and stop them from expressing any opinions on this matter.”","...","Nie Tao closed his eyes, his expression dismal, and said, “They won’t agree to a settlement. I tried before, and they were determined to make Junwei take responsibility.”","Nie Qingru looked at him as if he was a joke. “That’s right. We’re going to the hospital to tell them this news.”","Nie Tao stared at her.","Nie Qingru wasn’t afraid of his gaze. Her eyes were emotionless, emanating endless pressure.","“Why don’t you follow the path I laid out? Otherwise, I can protect myself and draw a line with the Nie family. I don’t have much time. Think about it carefully.”","Nie Tao couldn’t suppress his panic and anger any longer. “We’re your family!”","Unexpectedly, Nie Qingru replied indifferently, “Ji Qing was my only daughter. Didn’t I sacrifice her the way you guys wanted back then?”","The villa was deathly silent.","Even Old Master Nie did not dare to say anything.","Nie Qingru did not care what they thought. She stood up, grabbed her bag, and swept her arrogant gaze across everyone. She only felt tired. “There’s nothing I can’t give up. It wasn’t an exception in the past, and now that it’s your turn, it can’t be an exception either.","“Wasn’t this how Qixing was sacrificed too?”","At that time, she remembered that her good brother had advised her not to hesitate. It was just Nie Qixing. If he had to be sacrificed, so be it.","Now, she could also return this sentence to him.","“You have two sons. If one is gone, there’s still one left. There’s nothing to hesitate about. Sacrifices are sacrifices.”","In extreme pain, Nie Tao frowned and covered his face. His lips trembled as he begged her, “Qingru, there’s no other way?”","Nie Qingru looked at him as if he was an ant, with no emotion in her eyes. “Yes, there is. We’ll pay for this mistake with the entire Nie Family.”","She smiled, as if laughing at their worthless feelings, but also at their ignorance. “I’ll still be the Empress of the reclusive families after losing the Nie family. My position won’t be shaken. But if you don’t have the reclusive families’ protection, the Nie family will lose its current glory and fall.”","The Nie family was different from the Murdochs and the other industrial families. Otherwise, they would not have sold their daughter for marriage.","Who would be willing to give up the power within their reach?","Qiao Nian always looked at her as if she was wrong. She was arrogant and rebellious.","But she was not wrong.","She knew that she had only made the choice that most people would make.","Sure enough, before she crossed the door threshold, she heard her brother’s painful and powerful answer.","“I’ll go to the hospital with you.”","Silence.","Nie Qingru stopped. The corners of her mouth curled up silently as if she had once again confirmed that she was not wrong.","She slowly turned around and looked at the dispirited Nie Tao with the same arrogant eyes, then ordered Shadow, “Bring him along. We’ll go to the hospital now.”"]},{"number":3553,"title":"Chapter 3553: Undisguised Disgust Towards Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Chapter 3553: Undisguised Disgust Towards Sister Nian","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, things didn’t go as smoothly as Nie Qingru had planned.","Upon arriving at the hospital, they were stopped by someone who said he would ask the old couple of the Jin family if they were willing to see them before they were allowed to enter the ward.","“Do you know who I am? How dare you talk to me like that?” Nie Tao was so angry that he wanted to argue with him.","“That’s enough.” Nie Qingru recognized the person who stopped them at a glance. She raised her hand to block Nie Tao and said indifferently, “Let’s wait outside.”","“Qingru?!” Nie Tao looked at her in surprise. His brows were tightly knitted, and his eyes were dazed as if he didn’t understand why she was so aggrieved.","...","Nie Qingru did not even look at him as she walked to the corridor and waited for the reply.","Fortunately, the people inside did not make them wait for long.","Nie Tao suppressed his anger and saw the young man who had stopped them earlier coming out of the ward. He walked over and said gently, “I’m sorry, the patient doesn’t want to see you. Please go back.”","“You!” The veins on Nie Tao’s forehead bulged, and he immediately wanted to barge in.","The young man did not budge an inch. He opened his arms and blocked him, with a smile that did not reach his eyes. “Mr. Nie, are you here to cause trouble?”","“I’m here to apologize to Mr. Jin on my son’s behalf!” Nie Tao gritted his teeth.","The young man looked enlightened and immediately said mockingly, “Oh, I thought Mr. Nie was here to cause trouble.","“After all, this is the first time I’ve seen someone apologize so arrogantly.”","If Nie Tao did not catch the sarcasm in the first half of his sentence, but in the second half, he was clearly mocking him.","His expression immediately turned ugly. He clenched his fists and glared at the young man as if he would attack him at any moment.","At this moment, Nie Qingru called out, “Nie Tao, don’t forget what you promised me. If you can’t do it, get lost.”","Her tone was calm, but a thunderous rage brewed beneath the surface.","Nie Tao stiffened. He forced himself to slowly turn around and return to Nie Qingru’s side without saying a word, no longer arguing with the young man.","“I didn’t forget what I promised you.”","“That’s good.”","Nie Qingru was expressionless as she turned to the young man.","In his early twenties, the young man wore a suit vest over his shirt all buttoned up, outlining his broad shoulders and narrow waist. He looked elegant, and the faint smile on his lips never left. He was extremely amiable, like a businessman.","Nie Qingru recognized him. “Ji Lin.”","Ji Lin’s expression turned surprised as if he did not expect the haughty Empress to know his name.","However, he quickly nodded and said gentlemanly, “Your Majesty, do you have any instructions for me?”","This was equivalent to telling Nie Qingru that he also knew her identity.","Everyone returned to the same starting point.","Nie Qingru didn’t care about the details. Her sharp gaze landed on him and she concisely asked, “Who asked you to come? Is it that person in Beijing or... Qiao Nian?”","She couldn’t hide her disgust upon uttering that name. It was as if she had dirtied her mouth.","She rarely revealed her emotions, so the uncontrollable disgust at that moment was especially eye-catching.","Who was she trying to annoy?","Ji Lin’s faint smile faded upon seeing her reaction."]},{"number":3554,"title":"Chapter 3554: Send the Guest Away","paragraphs":["Chapter 3554: Send the Guest Away","Editor: Atlas Studios","His gaze turned slightly cold, and his tone became impolite. “This doesn’t seem to have anything to do with Her Majesty the Empress. I’m not from the reclusive families, so I don’t need to explain myself to you!”","Nie Qingru’s eyes darkened and she did not say anything. After a few seconds, she slowly asked, “You don’t know who I am?”","Ji Lin raised his eyebrows as if asking what she meant.","Nie Qingru lowered her head, adjusted her sapphire-blue velvet gloves, then raised her graceful and noble face and expressionlessly said, “I’m her biological grandmother. She didn’t tell you?”","A trace of hatred flashed across her eyes as she spoke. It was like she was not talking about Qiao Nian, but dirt.","Ji Lin was stunned for a moment before quickly returning to normal.","...","Looking at Nie Qingru’s face and then at her slightly raised chin, he could not help but ask curiously, “You don’t like Miss Qiao, right?”","Nie Qingru did not answer.","No immediate answer was the answer.","Ji Lin immediately understood and asked in confusion, “Since you’ve repeatedly shown your disgust towards Miss Qiao, even hate, why are you telling me this? You’re Miss Qiao’s grandmother, so what? Are you using this identity to get in through the back door?”","Nie Qingru’s expression suddenly darkened. Ji Lin’s question had undoubtedly hurt her reputation and disturbed her calm.","Her tone instantly turned cold. “No doubt you’re one of her people. You’re as uncultured as her! Someone who doesn’t even recognize family!”","At her undisguised malice, Ji Lin stopped laughing and retorted expressionlessly, “The Empress and the reclusive families are high up in the air, so don’t use blood relations to intercede. Otherwise, it will seem like... intimate blood relationship is just a bargaining chip you put on the table. Other than using it for personal benefits, it’s usually useless.”","Nie Tao looked at their back and forth. He didn’t understand where Ji Lin came from. How dare he talk to his high and mighty sister like this?","Before he could figure it out, he heard Nie Qingru’s cold voice. “Do you think I can’t resolve this matter without seeing the Jin family?”","Ji Lin did not argue with her. He made a “please” gesture as if he was sending her off.","The air seemed to freeze.","In the next second, Nie Qingru looked at Ji Lin deeply before turning around and saying to Nie Tao, “Let’s go!”","“I won’t see you off, Your Majesty,” Ji Lin said politely.","Nie Qingru walked away without looking back. It was as if she did not hear his voice. However, one could hear her agitated breathing as she quickened her pace.","Nie Tao chased after her to the elevator. After pressing the button, he helplessly asked, “What about the plan if we leave just like that?”","According to Nie Qingru’s plan, the victim’s parents must stand up and express their forgiveness to the public. Otherwise, they wouldn’t be able to get past public opinion.","Now, they did not even see them. The trip had been a waste. This was not part of the plan.","Ding!","The elevator doors opened.","Nie Qingru stepped inside, and Nie Tao hurriedly followed. He watched as the elevator doors closed again. There were several times when he wanted to say something but hesitated.","However, he did not dare to say anything after seeing Nie Qingru’s expression.","Fortunately, as they waited for the car to arrive, the silent Nie Qingru finally spoke."]},{"number":3555,"title":"Chapter 3555: The Old Demoness Still Has Some Capabilities","paragraphs":["Chapter 3555: The Old Demoness Still Has Some Capabilities","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Not everyone is that bastard.","“People have weaknesses.","“As long as I grasp their weakness, I will always have a way to make them relent.”","Nie Tao was confused. “What do you mean?”","Nie Qingru did not answer him.","...","At this moment, Shadow arrived with the car and got out to open the door for Nie Qingru. She brushed past him and got into the car.","Nie Tao was left behind looking at the car, still thinking about what she said.","Everyone had weaknesses.","So Qingru wanted to resolve this matter from another entry point?","However, how could things be resolved so easily at this point...","**","As it turned out, Nie Qingru still had some ability. She wasn’t like Nie Tao, who relied on his family to get to where he was today.","She first asked Nie Tao to send Nie Junwei back to the police station as planned, and even arranged for reporters to capture this scene.","Then, Nie Tao apologized to the public in front of the cameras with tears in his eyes, expressing his love for his son and sincerely apologizing to the victim’s family.","Right on the heels of that, the Jin couple appeared in front of the media at the height of the commotion, looking extremely haggard after falling ill and losing their only son.","However, facing the camera, they still expressed their forgiveness. As long as the judiciary gave their son justice, they would not implicate Nie Junwei’s family.","They also said that the Nie family had actively sought them out to negotiate compensation after the car accident and had maintained a good attitude.","Therefore, the fact that they were beaten up in public outside the hospital should have nothing to do with them. It was just Nie Junwei’s doing.","***","The victim’s parents stepped forward to help the Nie family clear their name. The effect was better than Nie Tao apologizing thousands of times in front of the cameras.","Once the media interview was released, public opinion showed signs of reversal.","Of course, everyone wasn’t praising the Nie Family for being nice. It was just that they were not scolding them so fiercely anymore. Moreover, a small group agreed that the Nie Family was innocent.","They believed that Nie Junwei was Nie Junwei, and the rest of the Nie Family was separate from him. They couldn’t condemn all of them just because of one person.","The Nie family had basically passed this hurdle after this statement came out.","However, as a price, Nie Junwei would definitely be sacrificed. Moreover, the public had to see it. Nie Junwei’s sentence would certainly be severe.","If he had not been released on bail and that recording call had not been shown for everyone to see, with the Nie family’s status, he would have been sentenced to at most 10 years in prison.","However, after so many incidents, the outside world predicted Nie Junwei would be locked up for 15 to 20 years.","**","The news quickly reached the independent continent.","Qiao Nian came down to make coffee and saw Ye Wangchuan making a video call with Ji Lin.","“... They sent me away that day and told me they wanted to go back and take a shower after staying in the hospital for a few days. I even kindly asked someone to send them back. Who knew they would run to the police station and speak up for the Nie family in front of the cameras?","“Who were the ones who said they would seek justice for their son back then? That they wouldn’t hesitate even if the company went bankrupt? We helped them because they said they weren’t afraid of offending the reclusive families, but they actually hid such a big matter from me!”","Qiao Nian saw Ji Lin flying into a rage from the corner of her eye. It was obvious how infuriated he was by the Jin couple’s actions.","Ye Wangchuan leaned against the sofa leisurely, as if he had already guessed that things would turn out like this. “That’s normal. The Jin couple also has relatives.”"]},{"number":3556,"title":"Chapter 3556: I Don’t Need to Explain Anything to Her","paragraphs":["Chapter 3556: I Don’t Need to Explain Anything to Her","Editor: Atlas Studios","Confused, Ji Lin asked, “Master Wang, aren’t you angry?”","Ye Wangchuan crossed his legs and looked at him cynically. “Why should I be angry? Matriarch Jin has a biological sister. The two of them grew up together. Later on, they got married and had children. Their relationship has always been good. She lost her only son, but if Nie Qingru threatens her with her sister’s family and tells her that she just has to speak up for the Nie family without forgiving Nie Junwei, and even promises Nie Junwei’s sentence will be heavy... Do you think she will agree?”","Ji Lin fell silent, seriously considering his words.","Ye Wangchuan did not rush him. “Everyone has a weakness. If she can’t even resolve such a small matter, she won’t be able to sit in her current position.”","Nie Qingru wasn’t an easy person to deal with.","...","She was decisive and ruthless. She prioritized benefits and could sacrifice anything.","Such a greedy, smart, and ruthless woman was definitely not simple.","This time, he was only returning the gift for the commotion Nie Qingru had caused in the independent continent. It was also a warning for her to stay out of things in the future.","Otherwise, he had to be mentally prepared for immediate revenge.","He was playing a psychological tactic. He wanted to give the other party a shackle so that they would not dare to interfere in the matters of the independent continent as easily as now.","After a short silence, Ji Lin seemed to understand and said hesitantly, “Then are we just going to let it go this time?”","“It’s already over. The Jin family has already forgiven them. It won’t be of much use no matter how much we pester them. There’s no need for that,” Ye Wangchuan said calmly.","It was like he was talking about the weather.","Qiao Nian used both hands to hold her coffee cup and leaned against the bar. She watched the video call and lowered her head to drink her coffee sloppily.","Ji Lin stopped dwelling on the Jin family’s matter as he thought of something else. “Master Wang, that day, Nie Qingru came to the hospital and told me she was Miss Qiao’s grandmother. I noticed she seemed to hate Miss Qiao when she mentioned this. She did not feel like a grandmother, but more like...”","He did not finish his sentence.","When Nie Qingru mentioned Miss Qiao, her expression and tone did sound like a grandmother, but more like an enemy.","Qiao Nian was surprised to hear her name. She stopped drinking her coffee and listened as Ji Lin continued, “She’s always targeting Miss Qiao. This time, she also asked me if Miss Qiao was behind it. I think she suspects Miss Qiao. Should we think of a way to stop her from investigating Miss Qiao?”","In Ji Lin’s opinion, this matter had nothing to do with Qiao Nian.","He and Master Wang were behind it all.","Whether Miss Qiao knew about this was another matter altogether.","However, Nie Qingru’s attitude at the hospital clearly pointed to her suspicion that Miss Qiao was the one behind him.","That was not the case at all.","He didn’t know about the feud between Miss Qiao and the reclusive families, but he did not want Qiao Nian to suffer injustice.","Unexpectedly, Master Wang did not answer him. Instead, a lazy female voice sounded from behind. “She can think whatever she wants. If she thinks it’s me, it’s me. I don’t need to explain anything to her.”","Ji Lin recognized the voice and asked in surprise, “Miss Qiao?”","Qiao Nian straightened her back and walked over, exposing herself to the camera, before saying casually, “Ji Lin, don’t worry about her.”"]},{"number":3557,"title":"Chapter 3557: Sister Nian Is Setting Off Immediately","paragraphs":["Chapter 3557: Sister Nian Is Setting Off Immediately","Editor: Atlas Studios","“But...” A trace of uncertainty flashed across Ji Lin’s young face.","Was there really no need to do anything about it?","The Empress of the reclusive families was Miss Qiao’s grandmother. She even thought that Miss Qiao was causing trouble behind her back. But Miss Qiao did not want to explain?","Qiao Nian’s eyelashes did not move, and her eyes were dark. “No buts.”","Undisciplined and irrefutable.","Ji Lin shut his mouth and stopped expressing his opinion.","...","This matter was settled just like that.","Ji Lin then reported to Ye Wangchuan about the recent affairs of Dark Fort in Continent M. He told him everything, big and small, and it did not take long.","Ye Wangchuan did not ask Qiao Nian to leave. Occasionally, when Ji Lin mentioned something important, he would ask a simple question. Most of the time, Ji Lin would be the one talking. From time to time, he would lazily grunt.","Qiao Nian suspected he was not listening seriously.","After Ye Wangchuan and Ji Lin finished talking business, she put down her coffee cup and interrupted, “I’m going to Continent M.”","“Master Wang, then I’ll...” Ji Lin was about to hang up when he heard Qiao Nian’s voice.","After a short daze, he immediately asked, “Miss Qiao, when are you coming?”","Ye Wangchuan turned around and looked at her.","Qiao Nian ignored his gaze and said to Ji Lin, “Now.”","“Now?!” Ji Lin couldn’t hide his surprise. “You mean right now?”","This was too sudden.","Qiao Nian added, “I’ll go up and pack my things. I’ll buy the earliest plane ticket using an alias.”","Although still a little confused, Ji Lin was not stupid. “Then text me when you arrive at the airport. I’ll pick you up.”","Qiao Nian shook her head and looked at him seriously. “The Nie family just got into trouble, and you’re involved. I’m afraid there are many spies around you right now. I’ll be exposed if you come pick me up. The reclusive families’ and the Nie family’s spies will follow you.”","“Then...”","Qiao Nian’s tone was calm. “I’m going to settle a private matter. I’m telling you in advance because I’m afraid I might need your help. You don’t have to look for me.”","Ji Lin understood what she meant.","“I understand.”","He glanced at Master Wang, and before he could ask if Qiao Nian was coming alone, he heard Master Wang’s cold voice.","“I’m hanging up.”","Silence.","Ji Lin clearly did not do anything, but he felt like he had been shot down. He rubbed the bridge of his nose and watched as the screen darkened.","The other end had already hung up on him.","...","On the other side.","Ye Wangchuan hung up the video call and threw the laptop beside him before looking up at the girl going upstairs.","“You’re leaving now?”","“Yes.” Qiao Nian was going up to get her laptop. Hearing this, she returned and sat down beside him. “Can I borrow your laptop?”","Ye Wangchuan was silent for a moment before handing her the laptop.","The girl took it and turned it on. Then, her slender fingers flew across the keyboard as her expression turned focused.","Ye Wangchuan saw her enter a URL. Then, she typed out a series of codes. The interface jumped, and she entered the backend of the airline and created a pass for herself.","Then, ‘Ye Yiyi’ bought a ticket for the 10 o’clock flight to Continent M.","Next, Qiao Nian wiped all traces of her intrusion and exited the page.","The next second, her cell phone lit up."]},{"number":3558,"title":"Chapter 3558: Do You Know Where Nie Qingru Placed The Antidote","paragraphs":["Chapter 3558: Do You Know Where Nie Qingru Placed The Antidote","Editor: Atlas Studios","From the corner of his eye, Ye Wangchuan saw a notification pop-up on her cell phone: “Miss Ye, your flight XXXXXX...”","Qiao Nian obviously saw it. She picked up her cell phone and looked at the message. The corner of her mouth curled up. Then, she pushed away the laptop and raised her eyebrows at him. “Done.”","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes trembled as if the light shone into his heart and shook the earth.","He did not move, still sitting with his head slightly tilted back. His eyes were like a deep lake, making it impossible to guess his thoughts.","“Ye Yiyi?”","...","His voice was cold and hoarse, deep and pleasant to the ears.","Qiao Nian looked at him with raised eyebrows. “Then what should I call you? Ye San? Ye Qi?”","Ye Wangchuan did not say anything and just looked at her.","Qiao Nian was the first to look away. She put her cell phone back in her pocket. “You’re the only one in your generation, the one and only Ye Wangchuan. Ye Yiyi.”","The beginning of all things, and also the only one.","He was the only one in the world.","If Gu San were here, he would definitely have shouted, “Wonderful, Miss Qiao. Very good at flirting.”","As expected, Ye Wangchuan’s gaze deepened, and the way he looked at her changed slightly.","Qiao Nian was going to the airport, so she briefly told him her plan. “I’m going to find the antidote. The Nies and the reclusive families are in chaos right now. I’ll have a chance if I go now. It won’t be easy for me to get the antidote after she settles this mess.”","“So you want to use a fake identity to enter Continent M before she has time to manage it.” Ye Wangchuan helped her finish her sentence.","Then he asked her, “Do you know where she hid the antidote?”","It wasn’t strange for Qiao Nian to want to go to Continent M to find the antidote for Ji Lingfeng while Nie Qingru was flustered. However, how did she know where Nie Qingru hid it?","After all, after so many years, Nie Qingru might not even have the antidote anymore, let alone the place where such an important thing was hidden.","Qiao Nian raised an eyebrow as she lazily stretched a leg and leaned against the sofa. She propped her chin on her elbow and looked at him. “I don’t know.”","Ye Wangchuan waited for her to continue.","As expected, the girl supported her chin with her hand and continued, “But I know that the Empress has a treasure vault. All her good things are stored in it. The vault’s structure should be similar to the Ji family’s. I wonder if she stored the antidote there. However, humans have a commonality. They like to store important things in the same place, where they think it is safe. This way, it’s more convenient to manage them. Therefore, if she still has the antidote, we should be able to find it in that vault.”","Ye Wangchuan understood.","So she had a gambling mentality.","She was gambling that Nie Qingru still had the antidote from all those years ago and had placed it in the vault where she usually kept her collection.","Qiao Nian continued, “Your target is too big. I’ll go alone this time. It’ll be best if I can find the antidote. If I can’t... I’ll think of another way.”","In fact, both Ye Wangchuan and she knew very well that Ji Lingfeng could not afford to wait anymore.","Otherwise, Qiao Nian wouldn’t risk going to Continent M alone.","Ye Wangchuan did not try to persuade her against it. Instead, after Qiao Nian finished speaking, he looked into her eyes and said, “I’ll join you immediately after I’m done here.”"]},{"number":3559,"title":"Chapter 3559: Guan Yan Is Here, Do You Really Want to Come With Me?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3559: Guan Yan Is Here, Do You Really Want to Come With Me?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian looked at him.","Seeming to know what she was going to say, he stopped her and calmly said, “Don’t worry. I’ll walk separately from you. No one will notice you.”","Qiao Nian was used to running into danger alone. Her body and brain instinctively refused, and her back subconsciously tensed up.","However, thinking about how she had entrusted her back to him at Mingshui Mansion, her resistance subconsciously disappeared.","She thought about it before nodding. “Okay, be careful.”","...","Ye Wangchuan’s eyes were dazzling as he tucked her hair behind her ear, his arrogant and reserved face turning gentle. “Wait for me obediently.”","**","Qiao Nian bought the 10 o’clock flight ticket to Continent M. After packing her into a shoulder bag, she slung it over her shoulder and set off for the airport.","To avoid alerting the enemy, Qin Si drove her to the airport.","Qin Si was an unfamiliar face and had never interfered in the affairs of the independent continent. In addition, he wasn’t like Bo Jingxing, who was involved with the Ninth Branch even if he was not from the independent continent.","Qin Si was more like a rich and idle person, so no one would pay attention to him.","On the way to the airport, Qin Si kept stealing glances at the girl in the passenger seat while waiting for the traffic light to change. He wanted to say something but hesitated.","All the way to the airport.","He parked the car and followed Qiao Nian into the terminal. Only then did he find an opportunity to ask, “Sister Qiao, why are you in such a hurry? Are you still going to Continent M? Why aren’t you letting Master Wang accompany you?”","“No need.” Qiao Nian was carrying a shoulder bag. There was nothing much in it. Besides her laptop, cell phone charger, and some small items, there was nothing else. She planned to buy two sets of clothes when she arrived.","Therefore, no matter who looked, with the shriveled bag over her shoulder, she did not look like someone going on a trip. Especially since she had her hands in her pockets and earphones were stuffed into her ears.","Seeing she couldn’t take care of herself, Qin Si hesitated before looking at the terminal to change plane tickets. “Why don’t I go with you? Anyway, I have nothing to do here.”","Qiao Nian glanced at him.","To show his determination, Qin Si’s expression turned serious. “I’m worried about you being alone.”","Qiao Nian touched the orange candies in her pocket and took one out. She peeled off the wrapper and stuffed it into her mouth. Then, she looked at him and asked, “Do you want one?”","Qin Si looked at the candy and paused for a second. He felt that Qiao Nian did not take his words to heart and was a little depressed. “Sister Qiao, it’s always good to have one more person to help you. If I can be of help...”","“Guan Yan is coming to the independent continent,” Qiao Nian suddenly said.","Qin Si was stunned before his eyes lit up. He almost grabbed Qiao Nian’s shoulder as he asked, “When? When will she arrive?”","Qiao Nian tried to recall before replying, “In a few days.”","Then, she looked at the happy Qin Si and asked, “So, do you still want to go to Continent M with me?”","Qin Si was indeed conflicted.","Logically speaking, he had already offered to go with her and could go back on his word. That would be too low of him.","However, he had not seen Guan Yan for a long time. That woman was either in the open sea or in Continent F. In short, she traveled all around the world. The number of times they could meet could be counted on one hand.","If not for the fact that she would occasionally show up on WeChat, Qin Si would have suspected he had found a virtual girlfriend..."]},{"number":3560,"title":"Chapter 3560: I Heard Qin Si Say Miss Qiao Left","paragraphs":["Chapter 3560: I Heard Qin Si Say Miss Qiao Left","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, Qin Si was tempted after spending some time with Guan Yan.","He was different from Ye Wangchuan. He had been adventurous since he was little. He had dated his first girlfriend in junior high school and had never stopped after that. There was almost no gap between every relationship.","In his words, life was boring and lasted just a few decades. Of course, he had to find something to do. Dating was the best way to pass the time.","He had been fooling around all these years, but he had never had any feelings for anyone.","Previously, he had thought that he definitely could not be in a relationship with someone like Master Wang who did not want to fall in love but would go all out the moment he fell in love.","...","He couldn’t love anyone.","Not to mention giving his feelings unilaterally.","Until he met Guan Yan.","Qin Si knew that he had failed.","She was more playful and frivolous than him. She knew how to love herself and was more rational and clear-headed than him. Instead, he was the one who couldn’t let it go.","As Qin Si thought about this, his heart felt like it had been shattered into countless pieces, but he stubbornly picked up the pieces and glued them together.","He figured it out shortly and sincerely apologized to Qiao Nian. “Sister Qiao, I’m sorry. I can’t accompany you to Continent M. How about this? What do you want for your next birthday? I’ll get it for you as long as it’s within my capabilities.”","This could be considered his apology.","Of course, Qiao Nian was not unhappy about this. After exchanging some words with him, a broadcast announced that her flight was about to take off and they were checking the flight tickets and luggage.","Qiao Nian had to leave even if she did not have any luggage.","Qin Si accompanied her to the security checkpoint and watched as she put one hand in her pocket, turned around, and waved to him before disappearing.","Only then did he turn around to leave.","On the way back, Qin Si remembered the name on the plane ticket he had just obtained from Qiao Nian. He grabbed his phone and sent a message to a certain someone on WeChat.","——[Qin: Ye Yiyi?]","——[Qin: Master Wang, is this your nickname?]","—— [Qin Si: Yiyi, who thought of this name? Your Old Master? Tsk! This name is too freaking feminine. No wonder you never mentioned it. I didn’t expect Elder Ye to have such a style!]","He got into his car, put in the car key, fastened his seatbelt, and was about to start the car when his cell phone’s screen lit up.","Qin Si thought of the message he had sent previously and unlocked it.","Sure enough, it was a new WeChat message.","He opened it with interest and looked over curiously.","He focused his gaze on Ye Wangchuan’s reply.","——[Y: My wife.]","“Damn!”","Qin Si’s smile froze. He rubbed his face and got goosebumps. Logically speaking, he should have mocked him back immediately, but he had to admit that compared to his uncertain virtual girlfriend, Master Wang’s relationship was full of affection that got to him.","Not only did he show off how loving they were, but he also tortured his single soul.","Qin Si sighed at how difficult it was to live a dog’s life. He decided not to ask for trouble and refused to reply. He threw the cell phone on the passenger seat and started the car.","He would only look for a beating the next time he was sick!","**","After Ye Wangchuan replied to Qin Si’s message, he saw no movement from the other party’s avatar. Only then did he leave and click on the avatar at the top. He thought for a moment before slowly typing a message.","Qiao Nian did not reply. She probably did not have time to look at her cell phone after the security check.","Ye Wangchuan placed his cell phone by his side and bent down to pick up the Longjing tea that had just been brewed on the coffee table. The dense tea smell fluttered in the air, leaving behind only a wisp of the fragrance.","Bo Jingxing happened to return at this moment. Seeing him drinking tea, he put down the car keys and walked over. “I heard from Qin Si that Miss Qiao has left.”"]},{"number":3561,"title":"Chapter 3561: This Is Qiao Nian, Always Facing Ahead","paragraphs":["Chapter 3561: This Is Qiao Nian, Always Facing Ahead","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan blew at the foam on the tea leaves. His eyelids drooped, and he leaned back lazily without looking up. “Yes.”","“Tsk.” Bo Jingxing sat opposite him and looked at the lazy man with interest. “Master Wang, do you know what you’re thinking now?”","Ye Wangchuan took a sip of tea and raised his long eyelashes, finally looking at him. “If you have something to say, say it.” The second half was not a good thing.","Sure enough.","Bo Jingxing touched the bridge of his nose and pushed up his gold-framed glasses with his slender fingers, staring straight at him. “You look like a stone abandoned by your wife right now.”","...","Ye Wangchuan paused and pushed the teacup away. Then, he looked at him indifferently and calmly asked, “Are you tired of living? Do you want to go work at the mine in Continent F?”","The veins on Bo Jingxing’s forehead twitched. “I was just joking~”","Ye Wangchuan wasn’t interested in his jokes. He leaned against the back of the chair and rubbed his fingers against the edge of the teacup, the light yellow liquid reflecting his overly provocative face.","“She went to Continent M alone this time. It made me think about something.”","“What?”","Bo Jingxing poured himself a glass of water and leisurely took a sip. When he looked up again, his peach blossom eyes hidden under the lenses were sly like a fox.","“Don’t tell me you want to go to Continent M.”","Ye Wangchuan looked at him without saying anything.","Bo Jingxing slowed down as if he had seen a ghost. “You haven’t finished the work accumulated at Bright Gate all this time, right? Also, the collaboration with Dean Feng to enter the illegal district as the First Research Institute hasn’t been implemented yet. You want to leave at this juncture and chase after Qiao Nian?”","He found it unbelievable!","In his impression, Ye Wangchuan had all the qualities a top Beijing figure should have.","Calm, rational, controlled, and clear-headed.","People like them had been taught to make trade-offs since they were born. After being influenced for 20 years, their behavior had long been determined.","Bo Jingxing thought that he was pretty good in this aspect.","However, he only admired Ye Wangchuan.","Ye Wangchuan was already an outstanding figure in the circle when he was in his teens.","This person was neither cold nor hot, but not too distant either. You would never be able to see through his inner thoughts... His methods were cold and he kept his principles.","Most importantly, Ye Wangchuan’s rationality was always greater than his emotions.","Until now...","Bo Jingxing’s heart wavered. He was unable to show any expression at this development for a moment. He only looked at the man facing him.","Leaning against the seat, Ye Wangchuan raised the porcelain-glazed teacup slightly for a sip. His long eyelashes suppressed the light in his eyes.","He just sat there quietly. The smoke from the tea enveloped his broad eyebrows. “I’m thinking... what can I do for her.”","Bo Jingxing did not understand what he meant.","Ye Wangchuan clicked his tongue at him. “If she decides to settle the score with Nie Qingru in the end, what can I do for her as her boyfriend?”","Bo Jingxing felt as if he was being choked by an invisible hand. “What do you want to do for her?”","“When the time comes, she won’t let me help her,” Ye Wangchuan said slowly. “I know her too well. She’s used to facing things alone. The reason why we’re here now is because it’s not that dangerous yet. She faces it alone every time there’s real danger.”","This was Qiao Nian.","She would always walk in front and never look back."]},{"number":3562,"title":"Chapter 3562: What Master Wang Wants to Do","paragraphs":["Chapter 3562: What Master Wang Wants to Do","Editor: Atlas Studios","After a short pause, Bo Jingxing seemed to have found a voice and looked at him seriously. “So what do you want to do?”","Ye Wangchuan habitually touched his prayer beads, but he felt a chill.","He looked down at the black jade bracelet on his wrist, a gift from Qiao Nian. It was personally designed and polished.","At that time, he had taken off his string of Buddhist prayer beads and replaced it with this. As time passed, there was no longer any trace of the Buddhist prayer beads on his wrist.","Ye Wangchuan leaned back with his head slightly tilted back, making his collarbone exquisitely protrude like a raised swan.","...","“I’m prepared to cut ties with the Ye family.”","Bo Jingxing’s hand trembled and he almost spilled the water. His eyes were filled with unconcealed shock. “Aren’t you afraid that your Old Master will beat you to death?”","Ye Wangchuan was the Ye family’s heir.","Everyone in Beijing tacitly agreed that after Old Master Ye passed away, he would be in charge of the Ye family.","Old Master Ye would undoubtedly be furious if Ye Wangchuan cut ties with the Ye family.","Elder Ye was different from the others. He was in the military when he was young and had nurtured a bad temper. He did not care about heart-to-heart talk and always taught with sticks.","It was only because Ye Qichen had lost his mother when he was born, his biological father was trash, and he had congenital leg problems that the Old Master doted on him despite him being a little devil.","Bo Jingxing tried to calm his breathing as he looked at Ye Wangchuan seriously. “I know you’re worried that Qiao Nian won’t be able to handle it alone. Don’t we have plenty of people? You, me, Qin Si, the First Research Institute, and Yuan Yongqin from Cheng Feng Corporation. She also has the Red Alliance and David. With so many of us behind her back, things aren’t as serious as you think.”","“These people you mentioned have their own considerations.” Ye Wangchuan was unmoved, speaking in a lazy and arrogant tone. “I want to be someone who can accompany her to the end.”","Bo Jingxing looked at him in confusion, his gaze saying how crazy he was being.","Ye Wangchuan could tell that he did not understand.","He did not need anyone to understand.","Actually, he had been thinking about this question ever since he dealt with the car accident. For example, the old Jin couple hated the Nie family to death because they lost their only son to Nie Junwei’s drunk driving. But in the end, they had no choice but to stand up for the Nie family after their weakness was exploited.","If Qiao Nian went against Nie Qingru and one of them had to die, what could he do when Nie Qingru counterattacked?","Could he stand with Qiao Nian and face any outcome with her?","“I want to be someone without weaknesses.” Ye Wangchuan’s clear eyes landed on Bo Jingxing. He had already made up his mind.","Bo Jingxing took a deep breath. After a long time, with an expression caught between laughter and tears, he said, “You’re crazy.”","It was just a relationship, but he was acting as if he did not want his life anymore.","His hands felt cold as he pushed up his gold-rimmed glasses, trying to calm down. Then, he said with a straight face, “Do whatever you want. I won’t try to persuade you. I’ll pretend that I didn’t hear this, in case your Old Master beats you up and implicates me.”","Ye Wangchuan smiled. “I’ll go see Elder Feng. Come with me. I’ll try my best to settle everything in the next two days. I’ll leave the rest to you.”","He was talking about cooperating with the First Research Institute to enter the illegal district.","Bo Jingxing pinched the space between his eyebrows, not wanting to continue on this topic. However, when their eyes met and he saw the seriousness in his friend’s eyes, he changed his words. “You drag me along even when courting death.”"]},{"number":3563,"title":"Chapter 3563: Sister Nian Is Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 3563: Sister Nian Is Here","Editor: Atlas Studios","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows.","Bo Jingxing continued, “Got it. I’ll go with you this afternoon.”","Ye Wangchuan smiled. “Thank you.”","Bo Jingxing took off his glasses and rubbed his tired eyes before angrily saying, “Don’t thank me. If I knew that it would be so crazy to come to the independent continent with you, I wouldn’t have come.”","Ye Wangchuan actually wanted to cut ties with the Ye family for Qiao Nian, just so he could be free to accompany her.","...","Putting aside Old Master Ye’s reaction, his relatives and the Ye family’s collateral branches would probably not accept it.","Imagining the scene, Bo Jingxing looked at Ye Wangchuan with a complicated expression.","Anyway, this matter was troublesome. For Ye Wangchuan to make this decision, his determination to put Qiao Nian first was obvious.","Bo Jingxing frowned. Although he did not quite understand their feelings, he still walked over and patted Ye Wangchuan’s shoulder with a smile. “Since you’ve decided, I’ll support you no matter what.”","Ye Wangchuan leaned lazily against the back of the chair. His slender hand was still holding the porcelain teacup. He was focused and cold. “Don’t tell her.”","It was self-evident who ‘her’ referred to.","Bo Jingxing immediately understood what he meant.","He did not want Qiao Nian to feel burdened.","Still...","“You’re causing such a big commotion. Even if I didn’t say anything, Qiao Nian will still hear about it, right?”","Ye Wangchuan raised his eyebrows. “We’ll talk about it when that time comes. I’ll find a reasonable reason for her.”","Bo Jingxing did not retract his hand from his shoulder as he stared blankly at the man sitting there lazily.","He was going to make a big fuss for Qiao Nian, but he still did not want her to worry.","**","Eleven hours later.","Qiao Nian’s plane landed at Continent M’s airport.","She grabbed her bag and followed the crowd out of the plane. Leaving the airport, she stood by the roadside and flagged down a taxi.","Located in the city center, the hotel she chose was a five-star hotel with a global chain. It had businesses all over the world and ostensibly belonged to the Roth family.","In fact, the real one behind this global hotel chain was Nie Qingru.","Qiao Nian checked in at the front desk and took the elevator to her room.","At the door, she swiped the room card to open the door, entered the room, and threw her shoulder bag on the bed. Then, she pulled the curtains aside to let the sunlight in.","After doing all this, she returned to the bed, unzipped her shoulder bag, and took out her laptop. Next, she walked to the round wooden table, placed the laptop on it, flipped the lid, and turned it on.","It was all done in one go.","The black and old laptop’s internet speed was much faster than it appeared to be. Qiao Nian got up and went to the small fridge to grab a can of coffee. She took a sip to wake up before focusing on the matter at hand.","Sitting down, she casually put down the coffee can. First, she erased her immigration information and checked Nie Qingru’s recent schedule.","Due to Nie Junwei’s drunk driving incident, Nie Qingru, who rarely appeared in public, was attending a high-profile charity gala tomorrow.","This charity gala was different from the entertainment gala that many media reporters would usually interview in the entertainment industry.","The people attending the gala were almost all famous people.","Apart from showing off the demeanor of a prestigious family, it was also the best social occasion for everyone to gather for this gala.","Nie Qingru was definitely going to bid for something this time.","It wasn’t that she was interested, she just wanted to do charity to save her image after Nie Junwei’s matter.","Otherwise, with Nie Qingru’s arrogant personality, she would never participate in such an event."]},{"number":3564,"title":"Chapter 3564: Don’t Want to Bring the Pharmacy Association Down","paragraphs":["Chapter 3564: Don’t Want to Bring the Pharmacy Association Down","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian crossed her arms and tapped her index finger thoughtfully as she looked at the invitation card, thinking about what to do to get a look at Nie Qingru’s vault.","Not long after, she grabbed her phone and called Zhong Yiliu.","The call was picked up on the first ring.","“Strange, why does it show that you’re an unknown number?”","“I’m outside. I didn’t want to be traced, so I set up a small program for the number so that no one could find my IP.”","...","After Qiao Nian finished speaking, Zhong Yiliu acutely sensed something. “Why did you call me?”","Qiao Nian smiled as she looked at the scenery outside the window. “I have something on.”","From her angle, she could only see a boundless sky. The wind blew through the clouds and pushed faint dark clouds past her eyes.","It could rain tomorrow.","Qiao Nian roughly told Zhong Yiliu what she wanted.","When Zhong Yiliu heard she wanted that thing, he felt something was wrong and asked, “Where are you? You’re not in the independent continent?”","If Qiao Nian had not asked him for ‘that thing’, he definitely would not have guessed it.","After all, Qiao Nian had just caused such a huge commotion in Mingshui Mansion and had yet to deal with the aftermath. Logically speaking, she shouldn’t be at Continent M.","However, Zhong Yiliu was more or less an insider.","He knew about Ji Lingfeng’s situation and that Qiao Nian wanted to go to Continent M because of him.","“Yes, I just arrived.” Qiao Nian admitted readily.","Zhong Yiliu was silent for a moment before saying, “Send me the address. I’ll get Robert to send it to you.”","Qiao Nian touched the edge of the coffee can before saying, “It’s inconvenient for me to appear. Help me pass this on to the organizer of this charity banquet in the name of ‘K’. Tell them that I’m in dire need of money, so I’m entrusting you to help me deal with the things stored at your place.”","Actually, she could have just asked Zhong Yiliu to sell this thing in the Pharmacy Association’s name.","However, if she did that, what she was about to do would inevitably implicate the Pharmacy Association.","She didn’t like owing favors.","K also had another meaning—the Black Mandala.","She had not used this alias for a long time, and the Black Mandala had also disappeared for a long time. It was most suitable to sell that thing in the Black Mandala’s name.","Zhong Yiliu roughly understood what she meant. He knew it wasn’t good for the Pharmacy Association to be involved in what Qiao Nian wanted to do. “I understand. I’ll tell Robert.”","“Thank you.” Qiao Nian thanked him calmly.","Zhong Yiliu did not know what to say for a moment. “You didn’t even ask me to appear. You don’t have to thank me. It’s just a small favor. If I only represented myself, you wouldn’t have to mention K today. It’s just that I also have to consider others. Nian Nian, can you understand me?”","Qiao Nian smiled. Her dark eyes exuded a maturity beyond her age. There was a hint of seriousness in her nonchalance. “You’ve already helped me a lot. This is my personal matter. I’m not so pretentious as to drag the Pharmacy Association down.”","Zhong Yiliu had known her for many years. He advised her unhappily, “Be careful.”","“Okay.”","Qiao Nian agreed before saying goodbye and hanging up.","The cell phone’s screen light dimmed.","She pressed down on the brim of her baseball cap, but she did not feel anything.","Then, she forged an identity for herself and took her things out."]},{"number":3565,"title":"Chapter 3565: The Higher Ups Told Me to Take Special Care of Oriental Faces","paragraphs":["Chapter 3565: The Higher Ups Told Me to Take Special Care of Oriental Faces","Editor: Atlas Studios","The hotel lobby saw people entering and exiting non-stop.","Qiao Nian was wearing a baseball cap and a simple sweater. She wasn’t eye-catching in the crowd. If not for her outstanding temperament, no one would have noticed her.","Someone waited for her back view to disappear through the revolving door.","The hotel manager, who had bumped into Qiao Nian at the door, ran straight to the front desk. He pointed at the girl who had almost completely disappeared from view and asked, “When did an Asian check in?”","The front desk person looked in the direction his finger was pointing, retracted her gaze, and cautiously replied, “She just checked in today.”","...","“What’s her name?” The hotel manager reached out to her. “Show me her check-in information.”","The front desk person quickly pulled out the check-in information from the computer and printed it out before handing it to the Manager.","The manager was a man in his forties. He wore a suit and had a buzz cut. His distinct edges and corners made his strict personality obvious.","He took the guest’s check-in information and scanned through it, pausing for two seconds at the identity column beside the girl’s photo. Seeing that the information detailed an exchange student from Hong Kong, his expression softened slightly.","“Manager, is there something wrong with this person?” The front desk person carefully observed his expression.","The manager restrained the sharpness in his eyes and returned the paper. “It’s nothing. Didn’t the higher-ups say to pay special attention to Asian faces? I’m just taking a look.”","Realization dawned on the front desk person. “Ah, this— Don’t worry, she’s not the person we’re looking for.”","The manager’s face turned cold and solemn. “How do you know?”","Then, he reminded her, “Shred this later.”","The front desk person quickly nodded in agreement. Then, she answered his casual question seriously. “The guest is of mixed blood. Her eyes are dark brown, and she’s not purely Asian.”","There was a world-renowned university near their hotel. Students often stayed there.","The front desk person often saw individuals of mixed heritage.","They were usually beautiful, and their eyes were even more charming.","When checking in the guest, she saw the mixed-blood exchange student’s information and curiously looked into her eyes.","They were really beautiful.","The shape was impeccable.","At their end, the eyes were slightly upturned, outlining a fan-shaped arc. They were like small hooks that were eye-catching.","Most importantly, the eyes were amber in color. They were calm and self-possessed, but with a sense of carelessness and recklessness.","In short, she was beautiful.","The manager did not say anything on the surface. The suspicion that had arisen in his heart had already dissipated. “Since she’s not the person, forget it.”","“Remember to shred the paper.”","“Okay,” the front desk person replied respectfully.","The manager threw this chance encounter to the back of his mind and went on about his work.","* * *","Qiao Nian didn’t know she had almost been found out by the manager.","She had flagged down a taxi to where she had agreed to meet Ji Lin.","She looked at the high-end club. It was obvious at a glance that it was a money-squandering place for the rich.","Qiao Nian did not stop walking until she was stopped at the door.","“Hey, you can’t enter.” The waiter looked her up and down impatiently as he stopped her from going in."]},{"number":3566,"title":"Chapter 3566: Sister Nian Found Ji Lin","paragraphs":["Chapter 3566: Sister Nian Found Ji Lin","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian raised her baseball cap, revealing her exquisite and eye-catching face, then paused and said awkwardly, “I’m sorry, Young Master Ji asked me to come.”","The waiter was stunned and examined her again.","Qiao Nian pretended to look uneasy as she stood there and let him size her up. Her black eyelashes drooped as if she did not want him to look at her eyes.","The waiter saw that she was young and exceptionally beautiful. Her temperament was also something not found in the club. He roughly understood what was going on. Sometimes, the customers would bring their own female companions to play. It wasn’t strange to occasionally bring one or two obedient female students.","He slowly dropped his hand and moved aside to make way. “Young Master Ji’s private room did mention that someone would come later...","...","“Come with me.”","Silence.","Qiao Nian did not say anything and followed behind him.","She was quiet along the way, as if she was not used to this environment.","The waiter led her to a private room and stopped. He looked back at the girl behind him and saw that she had her head lowered. Her expression could not be seen.","“We’re here.”","“Ah.” The girl looked up, paused for a second, and said, “Thank you.”","The waiter looked at her with sympathy and contempt. “Young Master Ji is inside. You can go in yourself. I’m going back.”","“Okay,” Qiao Nian responded quickly.","The waiter left her alone at the door.","Qiao Nian waited for him to disappear before dropping the façade and pushing the door open...","The private room was big. There was a bar, a singing bar, and even entertainment facilities such as Card Nine and billiards.","Qiao Nian only brought her cell phone with her. Upon entering, the deafening music made her head hurt. The lights were dim, and their colorfulness made the atmosphere lively.","The party was real.","There were really a lot of people inside.","She gently pushed the door open and entered. In this noisy atmosphere, almost no one noticed her silent figure.","However, Ji Lin, leaning against the sofa and waiting for someone, saw her.","He immediately put down his wine glass, got up, and walked towards Qiao Nian, instructing his subordinates, “Alright, stop singing. All your wild shrieks and howls! Be quiet.”","The bald man singing quickly pressed the Pause button and turned off the sound.","There was no more roaring singing in the private room, and it suddenly became quiet. Those playing cards stopped playing, and those playing billiards also stopped... Everyone noticed Ji Lin’s movements and watched him walk towards the door.","Under the dim light, the atmosphere was still flickering. They could only see a blurry figure, thin and tense.","A girl?","Another round of atmospheric lights flashed over there. They saw the person at the door raise her hand to press down her baseball cap. Then, she put her hands in her pockets and waited for their boss to walk over.","“Miss Qiao, you’re here.”","The music in the private room had stopped.","There was no other sound.","Ji Lin’s voice was clear to everyone.","Everyone heard him greet the girl respectfully and seriously, with no contempt or perfunctoriness. His respect for her was obvious.","For a moment, everyone felt their brains short-circuiting. Then, they vaguely remembered hearing this surname somewhere before.","Qiao?","Without waiting for them to react, Ji Lin took the initiative to lead Qiao Nian in and explained, “You said on the phone that many people have been watching me recently. I thought for a long time before thinking of this method. This way, it won’t be easy for others to notice you meeting me. It’s just that you’ve suffered a little, Miss Qiao.”"]},{"number":3567,"title":"Chapter 3567: I Have Something For You","paragraphs":["Chapter 3567: I Have Something For You","Editor: Atlas Studios","He was a VIP customer of the club, and he would often bring big spenders.","Of course, he also knew this club might be inextricably linked to the reclusive families.","However, there were very few places in Continent M that were not related to the reclusive families.","He didn’t care about the club’s boss’s relationship with the reclusive families. What was important was meeting Qiao Nian without anyone noticing.","This was what Ji Lin had thought of. He asked Qiao Nian to pretend to be his female companion and come to the club to look for him.","...","Qiao Nian’s age and appearance were convincing.","However, if Master Wang knew what a “good idea” he had come up with... Ji Lin felt a chill run down his spine. Thinking of this, he quickly added, “I have no choice... Then... Miss Qiao, don’t tell Master Wang.”","He touched his earlobe as he led Qiao Nian to a circular sofa inside, gentlemanly letting Qiao Nian sit first.","Qiao Nian did not stand on ceremony and sat down.","Today was indeed a real gathering.","Otherwise, it would be difficult to hide it from others.","The room smelled of cigarettes, perfume, and alcohol. The smell was pretty bad.","Qiao Nian sat down and rubbed her temples, then looked up and said to him, “I’m here to give you something.”","Ji Lin sat opposite her; he didn’t dare to sit with her. “Uh... what is it? You want me to pass it to someone?”","Ji Lin thought that Qiao Nian wanted him to help on a “private matter” that she had come to Continent M to handle. After all, he was considered a local tyrant.","“No.”","The girl took out something that looked like a ring from her pocket and threw it to him.","Ji Lin hurriedly caught it, feeling it cold in his hand. He looked down and saw a snake-shaped ring, with the small silver snake coiled up to form the ring itself.","The little snake’s dark green eyes seemed to come alive under the light.","With one look, one could tell that the snake’s eye was different from the jewelry materials circulating on the market. It should be a rare ore.","“This is...”","Ji Lin held the ring and looked up at the girl. He didn’t understand why she gave him this ring.","Qiao Nian bent her long and straight legs.","Under the dim light, her face looked tired, with a trace of sleepiness in her eyes.","“I heard you want a batch of water-aircraft and a couple of supersonic drones.”","Not only was Ji Lin stunned, but even the people from Continent M who were silent after listening to Ji Lin’s instructions subconsciously looked at her.","Even in the dark, the girl’s eyes were still bright, seemingly containing a vast universe.","Who exactly was this person?","Ji Lin paused for a second before asking, “Master Wang told you?”","That was his guess.","Without waiting for Qiao Nian to answer, he said awkwardly, “Water aircraft aren’t sold to the public. It’s still a concept machine. I want a batch to be used for shipping.","“As for the drones... You also know that ever since Emperor Ji’s accident, the high seas haven’t been very safe. Pirates are rampant, and they even dare to go after our goods recently. If we have drones flying with us, we can intimidate a portion of the pirates in the high seas.”","Nie Qingru had broken the 20-plus years balance that had been maintained in the open sea when she attacked Ji Lingfeng.","In the past, pirates never dared to go after the ferries from the independent continent, illegal district, and Continent F.","But Nie Qingru pushed all the blame for Ji Lingfeng’s accident on the high seas on the pirates. Then, the unwritten rule on the high seas had almost become useless."]},{"number":3568,"title":"Chapter 3568: Mistake, Sister Nian Is the One Who Helped","paragraphs":["Chapter 3568: Mistake, Sister Nian Is the One Who Helped","Editor: Atlas Studios","Since the ‘pirates’ had made the first move, there was no reason for the remaining people to continue to abide by the agreement. After all, since they were pirates, they weren’t afraid of death and trouble.","During this period, more than a hundred people perished in the open sea, all at the hands of pirates, and they also died at the hands of Nie Qingru.","Ji Lin was in charge of the routes between Continent F and Continent M for Dark Fort.","He was worried that some pirates would target his brothers, so he wanted to order a batch of equipment just in case.","The two types of equipment were too advanced and did not circulate on the market. Only the reclusive families had a small number.","...","No one else could buy it even if they had the money.","“Yes.” Qiao Nian nodded as if she understood. Then, she said, “I told Cage that you can buy what you want with this ring as a keepsake.”","“You mean...?!” Ji Lin stood in shock and helplessly looked at the girl sitting on the sofa with his mind still in a daze.","“Don’t you want this batch of cargo crafts?” Qiao Nian leaned back, her eyes calm. “I provided some help during their research and development. Cage owes me a favor. Previously, he said that after they are ready, I can get the goods from him if I want.”","David only dealt in diamonds in Continent F.","They did not travel by sea much, so they took more air transport.","Besides, Continent F was the stronghold of many weapons dealers. The things Ji Lin wanted were also shipped from Continent F. Even if David needed them, he did not need to buy them by sea.","She really did not need this favor.","Therefore, when Qiao Nian heard Bo Jingxing and Ye Wangchuan talk about Ji Lin’s difficulties before she left, although she was playing with her cell phone, she was actually listening.","Since she was coming to Continent M, she might as well meet him and hand him the ring in person.","Before leaving, she had searched the room for a long time before finding this ring. If Ji Lin had not asked for it, she would not have known where she had misplaced it.","“I told him about you.”","Qiao Nian thought before saying, “But you know the rules of this industry. They’re careful when doing things. Just in case he asks for a token... David and I made this ring in the past. They recognize it. Just show it to him.”","At that time, the Red Alliance did not have any so-called collective markers.","Slim Waist Control insisted on designing a symbol that belonged to them.","Qiao Nian knew how to design. Coupled with the rare ore from Daji, the four of them each had one ring.","The outside world also recognized this ring.","However, Qiao Nian rarely wore it.","“You didn’t come to me for help?” Ji Lin brainstormed for a long time before squeezing out a sentence.","Qiao Nian blinked and looked at him in surprise. “Huh? What can you do for me?”","“It’s...” Ji Lin didn’t know what to say. He had mixed feelings.","He thought Miss Qiao came looking for help, but in the end, she helped him instead.","This feeling... was a little exciting.","Qiao Nian finally understood. “Oh, you mean that. I’ve found a way in.”","Until now, Ji Lin had no idea why she had come to Continent M. He was about to ask what she meant when her cell phone’s screen lit up.","Ji Lin’s sharp eyes caught the familiar profile picture that popped up and swallowed his words. He watched as Qiao Nian stood up, looked at her cell phone, and said to him, “I won’t hold you up since I’ve delivered the item.","“You guys have fun. I’ll go back to the hotel.”","She waved her cell phone and left the private room without looking back."]},{"number":3569,"title":"Chapter 3569: Sister Nian’s Identity Is Blown","paragraphs":["Chapter 3569: Sister Nian’s Identity Is Blown","Editor: Atlas Studios","A round of questions started as soon as Qiao Nian left the room.","“Boss, who is Miss Qiao?”","“Boss, she knows Cage? Gosh, few people in Continent F know that person. She’s even more mysterious than David. She’s not even 20, right? How does she know Cage? And that ring she gave you. If I’m not wrong, this is the token of the founders of the Red Alliance.”","Snake ring...","The private room fell silent.","...","After a few seconds, someone belatedly muttered, “It’s said that the eyes of the Red Alliance’s tokens are made of a special material related to meteorites. Under infrared light, the snake eyes will show the symbol ‘S’. I wonder if this one’s a fake.”","The Snake Ring was very famous on the dark web.","As long as one had the heart to search, one would surely find a photo.","The founders of the Red Alliance were all computer experts, but they didn’t delete the photos circulating online.","The main reason was that they weren’t afraid of anyone counterfeiting the ring.","The shape could be replicated, but they could not replicate the ores on the snake-shaped ring that were stronger than the world’s most advanced anti-counterfeit technology—the iris technology.","There was also the S icon that the designer had cleverly designed to appear in the gem when it encountered infrared light.","Most people in the room remembered the ring’s strongest anti-counterfeiting symbol. Their gazes fell on the ring in Ji Lin’s hand.","The snake-shaped silver ring shone brightly under the light, its green snake eyes looked down at everyone as if they were alive.","Everyone had the same thought.","This workmanship...","Even if it was a fake, it was a high-quality imitation.","If not because the meteorite ore was too difficult to replicate, just the ring’s appearance was enough to scare people.","“Boss...”","Ji Lin returned to his senses and looked into the eyes of everyone in the room. Then, he solemnly put the ring away. “This ring is real.”","“Boss, why do you think this ring is real?”","“That’s impossible.”","That statement echoed everyone’s thoughts.","Everyone was distracted.","If this ring was real, what was the girl’s identity?","Only four snake rings existed.","One belonged to Guan Yan.","Guan Yan roamed the world all year round and had no fixed residence. She was like a drifting wind.","One belonged to Slim Waist Control.","Different from Guan Yan, Slim Waist Control was a geek. He seldom went out and stayed at the Red Alliance headquarters in the illegal district all year round.","Another was said to belong to David, the arms dealer.","Needless to say, David was Continent F’s big boss.","It’d be abnormal if he were not heavily protected.","As for the owner of the last snake ring, it was self-evident—the boss of the Red Alliance, Sun.","It was said that these snake rings were made by Sun. After Sun designed it and handed it to the other three, she kept one for herself.","However, this was only a legend.","The Red Alliance had always been mysterious. Other than Sun’s superb hacking skills, there was no evidence that she knew how to design.","The ring’s appearance was outstanding. Putting aside the meaning it represented, even if it were sold as a luxury item, it would probably be a classic hit.","That girl was... Sun?","Someone sneered. “Could she be Sun?”","Ji Lin glanced at the speaker.","The man had slicked-back blond hair and blue eyes, with tattoos all over his body. He had the characteristics of a typical foreigner. He liked to leave a mark on his body to commemorate anything."]},{"number":3570,"title":"Chapter 3570: I Didn’t Expect Sister Nian to Help Him","paragraphs":["Chapter 3570: I Didn’t Expect Sister Nian to Help Him","Editor: Atlas Studios","After all these years, everything below his neck was covered in tattoos. He wished he could fill every gap in his skin.","Wayne had been with him for several years.","Ever since he was assigned to Continent M by Master Wang to take over the matters here, Wayne had been loyally by his side.","Ji Lin glanced at him before retracting his gaze. He quickly picked up the glass on the table and sipped the strong wine before saying, “Of course not.”","He knew Qiao Nian had come to Continent M for something important.","...","However, he didn’t know what she wanted to do.","With Miss Qiao’s personality, she probably would not stay here long. It would probably take only a few days.","Since she used an alias, did not let him pick her up, and was even willing to disguise herself as his female companion to meet him, she definitely did not want to be noticed.","Ji Lin thought about what she said when dealing with these situations. He met Wayne’s stunned eyes and said, “A friend in the wholesale business.”","What?","Wholesale?","Wholesale Snake Ring? And she even knew Cage? She even said she could help them buy a concept transport plane that had yet to be released on the market?","What kind of wholesale business was this?","Everyone’s expressions became complicated. No one exposed their boss’s lame lie.","What the f*ck was this wholesale business!","The boss might as well tell them that the girl was Sun.","Ji Lin also realized how ridiculous his words were. He put the wine glass down and supported his forehead with his hand, then thought about how to salvage the situation. “Don’t tell anyone about what happened today. If I find out anyone spouted nonsense outside...”","He did not expect Qiao Nian to help him solve his problem... He thought Qiao Nian was here to ask him for a small favor.","If he had known that Qiao Nian would talk to him about this, he would have thought of another way for a meeting.","However, Miss Qiao trusted him and his people. She told them about Cage and gave him a token.","A sense of responsibility ignited in Ji Lin’s chest. He felt obligated to remind them and not allow them to speak nonsense.","“You know how I deal with traitors.”","Ji Lin scanned the crowd.","“If anyone leaks today’s matter, no matter the reason, even if you tell me that you drank too much and spoke in your sleep, you will be labeled a traitor!”","Everyone in the private room, laughing just now, went quiet at his strong warning. All of them restrained their sloppy expressions and became much more serious.","“Okay.”","“Don’t worry, boss.”","“Understood.”","“We won’t tell.”","At the same time, someone whispered, “So that girl just now is indeed the legendary... Sun?”","These people differed from Mo Dong and Mo Xi’s subordinates who stayed in Continent F and the independent continent all year round.","Mo Dong and Mo Xi’s subordinates had met Qiao Nian a few times and knew her identity.","These people had never seen Qiao Nian before.","Most importantly, Qiao Nian would be in a hurry every time she came to Continent M. She would leave after settling her matters and rarely stayed here.","Ji Lin had helped her before.","Moreover, Ji Lin contacted her alone and then gave his subordinates instructions. These people had never interacted with Qiao Nian before.","Today was their first time meeting her.","They were already so shocked.","“Sun is actually so young and beautiful... I wonder if she has a boyfriend?” Someone boasted shamelessly. He was purely concerned about this question."]},{"number":3571,"title":"Chapter 3571: Master Wang Video Called, Of course","paragraphs":["Chapter 3571: Master Wang Video Called, Of course","Editor: Atlas Studios","It was no wonder the person blurted out and paid attention to such a tricky point.","Qiao Nian was good-looking.","However, there were too many beautiful people in this world. Just beautiful girls were not enough to attract the opposite sex.","But a beautiful, mysterious, young, unique, and arrogant girl surely attracted the attention of the opposite sex. She was a top-notch beauty.","Especially since this person was Sun.","...","Cold sweat broke out on Ji Lin’s back. He stared at the man in the crowd and warned, “If you don’t want to die, you’d better not even ask this question in private in the future.”","Master Wang’s possessiveness was not obvious, but it was definitely strong.","He still remembered that not long ago, Miss Qiao praised Gu San for cooking well. When she went to the independent continent this time, Gu San coincidentally had something on and was left behind in Beijing.","Gu San was in such a state.","If Master Wang heard that one of his subordinates asked if Miss Qiao had a boyfriend, he would probably be sent to some godforsaken for the rest of his life!","Ji Lin shivered. He looked at the man solemnly and emphasized again, “No, don’t mention this name again in the future. Don’t even mention it.”","The man was frightened by his gaze and nodded in a daze, still wondering why the boss’s reaction was so big. He wondered if he was jealous.","**","Outside.","Qiao Nian left the club and rounded the corner before making a video call.","The video call was picked up on the first ring.","It was like he had been waiting.","It only took a second before the man’s handsome and arrogant face appeared on the screen. The background was the living room at home, and Bo Jingxing even appeared behind him.","“Coffee.","“Put it on the table.”","Ye Wangchuan’s calm voice was slightly hoarse and seductive.","“Tsk!”","Bo Jingxing clicked his tongue and fell silent.","Qiao Nian couldn’t see if he had left from this angle. She only heard the soft sound of the cup hitting the table. Then, she looked left and right for a place to sit down.","Ye Wangchuan watched as Bo Jingxing left. Looking back at the screen, he saw that the background was moving. He pressed a hand between his eyebrows. “Nian Nian, are you outside?”","Qiao Nian was still looking around for a place to stop by for a drink. However, the stores on this street were surprisingly expensive. The location was probably too good and the rent was high. There were not many down-to-earth coffee shops here.","Clubs and other high-class places she had just walked out of were everywhere.","Otherwise, it would be a Western cafeteria.","Qiao Nian replied casually, “Yes.”","Then, her sharp eyes caught a 7-Eleven not far away. She quickly walked over, entered the supermarket, took a milk bottle from the storage cabinet, and went to the counter to pay.","Then, she sat on the simple bench by the window, stepping on the bar stool with one leg and bending the other over the railing. She placed her phone beside her and opened the bottle. Her eyes under her long eyelashes landed on the lights of the road outside, shining on her beautiful face. Perhaps it was because her skin was fair, but she looked obedient.","At least in Ye Wangchuan’s eyes, she had her elbows on the wooden table and was unscrewing the bottle cap with one hand.","Just like the first time he saw her, she was extremely obedient.","“Why didn’t you get coffee?” His voice was low as if he was speaking into someone’s ear.","Qiao Nian stopped and stared at the screen, then slowly lowered her arm.","She paused for a full second in thought. In the end, she asked herself this question: Yes, why did I subconsciously take milk instead of coffee?"]},{"number":3572,"title":"Chapter 3572: What’s Sister Nian Selling Tomorrow?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3572: What’s Sister Nian Selling Tomorrow?","Editor: Atlas Studios","Qiao Nian had always liked to drink coffee outside. It wasn’t that she liked the taste, but she was habitually tense in unfamiliar environments. The caffeine stimulated her brain, allowing her to maintain a high state of concentration for a long time.","But she picked milk over coffee just now.","Qiao Nian was in a daze for a moment before looking away and saying indifferently, “I took it casually.”","Although she said that, she already had an answer in her heart.","7-Eleven’s coffee was placed in the refrigerator. Every time she drank a cold drink, Ye Wangchuan would say that she was not paying attention to her stomach...","...","Because they were on a video call, she subconsciously avoided the iced drink and took milk.","However, Qiao Nian would never admit it.","She just... did not want to admit it.","“Have you eaten?” she suddenly asked, changing the topic. Then, she remembered. “It should be one in the morning over there. You’re still awake?”","It looked bright on his end, causing her to almost forget about the time difference.","Ye Wangchuan leaned lazily against the back of the chair with his hands hanging down. He did not pester her about the coffee. He just smiled. “You didn’t reply to my message. I was waiting for you to finish your work.”","Qiao Nian paused for another second. “I remember telling you when I got off the plane.”","She sent him a message telling him she landed safely when she got off the plane. After that, she was busy checking in and looking for Ji Lin, so she did not see his reply.","She remembered now and exited the video call to look at it.","[Y: Which hotel are you staying in? Do you have an address?]","He sent another message half an hour later.","[Y: Have you arrived at the hotel?]","Qiao Nian’s eyes darkened. She understood why he had called her now. It seemed like he was worried about her.","“I went to look for Ji Lin after checking in at the hotel. I didn’t pick up your video call because I was meeting with him. I just came out and was about to return to the hotel.”","She wasn’t good at explanations, nor did she bother with it. However, this was Ye Wangchuan. Qiao Nian felt it wasn’t a big deal to explain herself to him.","“I’ll see Nie Qingru tomorrow. If everything goes well, I’ll be able to find the location of her vault...”","Qiao Nian’s voice was low, and one could not tell her emotions.","However, Ye Wangchuan understood her. He also understood her complicated feelings for Nie Qingru under her calm narration.","Her own grandmother was more vicious than her enemy, and the unresolved hatred and grievances of the previous generation had always troubled her.","It could be said that if it weren’t for the complicated entanglements of the previous generation, she would not have reached where she was today, would not have become Sun, and would not have experienced so much.","However, there were no ifs in this world.","Nie Qingru had never loved Ji Qing and could sacrifice her daughter without hesitation for benefits.","Ji Qing loved her daughter, so she risked her life to save Qiao Nian.","Qiao Nian, on the other hand, searched for the path that Ji Qing took back then. She wanted to find out the truth about what Ji Qing had experienced that caused her to die without a corpse.","He did not try to comfort her and only said hoarsely, “I’ll come as soon as I can.”","“Mm.”","Qiao Nian was only momentarily depressed. She quickly threw her negative emotions to the back of her mind and said, “I’m afraid she’s not the only one who wants what I’m selling tomorrow. Pfft, if she wants it, she’ll probably have to spend a lot of money... If she finds out that her money will land in my hands, I wonder what her reaction will be.”"]},{"number":3573,"title":"Chapter 3573: She’ll Be Angry to Death When She Knows","paragraphs":["Chapter 3573: She’ll Be Angry to Death When She Knows","Editor: Atlas Studios","With Nie Qingru’s hatred for her, she probably did not want to spend a single cent, but she still would have to spend more than nine figures to get that thing tomorrow.","It was ridiculous just thinking about it.","Qiao Nian was amused but did not show it. She still looked emotionless. “I’ve already released the news.","“As expected, several important guests attending the charity gala have received this news. Let’s see if Nie Qingru is determined to win.”","Ye Wangchuan’s handsome eyes momentarily went cold. Then, they softened when he looked at the girl. “It will go smoothly.”","...","“I hope so.”","Qiao Nian felt a little frustrated. She touched the silver lighter in her pocket and subconsciously took it out to play with it.","Soon, she thought of something and consciously controlled her violent and surging emotions. She stuffed the lighter into her pocket and grabbed a fruit candy instead.","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and slowly unwrapped the candy with her fair fingers. Then, she tilted her head back and threw the candy into her mouth.","Crack!","The candy cracked, and the sour and sweet taste washed away the bad taste in her mouth and eased the frustration in her heart.","She seemed to be in a better mood.","Her clear eyes focused on the man on the screen and paused before saying hoarsely, “If Ji Lingfeng’s luck is bad, then there’s nothing more I can’t do about it.”","Who knew if Nie Qingru still had the antidote? Qiao Nian was just trying her luck.","If Nie Qingru had not left behind the antidote or the poison from back then, she could only try to concoct the antidote herself with Zhong Yiliu.","However, the success rate was infinitely close to 0.","“I never thought of helping anyone. I just don’t want to see Ji Nan cry.”","**","On the other side.","Nie Qingru’s residence in Continent M.","The sun was setting, and evening approached. The horizon was dyed red by the sunset. A black Rolls-Royce crushed the autumn leaves as it drove into the huge ancient castle-style manor.","When the car arrived at the door, a waiting servant ran over to open the door. “Your Majesty, be careful.”","A woman was sitting in the back seat of the car. Time had left a deep mark on her, but it could not suppress her aura.","Wearing a wide hat and a velvet black dress under her cloak, she was exquisite from head to toe, and not even her fingers were exposed.","She placed her hand on the servant’s arm. The dark green gloves made her look elegant, noble, and unreasonable.","Nie Qingru slowly got out and saw that Shadow was waiting respectfully in the right corner.","“What’s the matter?”","She retracted her hand and asked coldly as she walked in.","“I have something to report to you.” Shadow followed her a little behind her.","Nie Qingru walked into the castle, took off her hat, handed it to the servant, then ordered in a deep voice, “Make me a cup of fruit tea.”","“Yes.”","The servant quickly went to the kitchen, placing the hat where it should be on the way.","Nie Qingru elegantly walked to the sofa in the living room without looking back. “Speak. What’s the matter?”","She had been running around for the past few days because of the mess Nie Junwei had created. She had not rested well.","Today, she had already appeased the implicated councilman and negotiated the subsequent compensation with him."]},{"number":3574,"title":"Chapter 3574: Sister Nian Is Extravagant","paragraphs":["Chapter 3574: Sister Nian Is Extravagant","Editor: Atlas Studios","Because Nie Tao’s voice recording was leaked, the other party lost the chance to compete for Governor and ruined half of his career.","Although Nie Junwei’s matter had ended, if they could not provide enough compensation, this politician would bite them like a mad dog...","Nie Qingru had bled a lot to settle this matter. In addition to agreeing to a sum of financial compensation, she also promised to help the youngsters of the other party’s family.","Nie Qingru pinched her forehead. It was rare for her to have such a headache. Her exhaustion, previously covered by the brim of her wide hat, was visible to the naked eye.","The servant arrived with the fruit tea at this moment.","...","Shadow stopped the servant. “Let me do it.”","The servant handed him the fruit tea.","Shadow approached Nie Qingru with the fruit tea, his silent figure moving like a mountain. He bent his knees and gently placed the tea set on the table. Then, he poured a cup and handed it over.","“Empress, drink some tea to moisten your throat.”","Nie Qingru opened her eyes and saw the cup. Her knife-like gaze swept across him before she retracted it. She took the teacup before saying impatiently, “Go ahead.”","Watching as she took a sip, Shadow stood up silently and returned to his seat. “I received news that someone from the Pharmacy Association went to the organizer of this charity gala, wanting to sell something. They said that this person had left it with them before. Now that their finances are tight, they plan to exchange it for money.”","Nie Qingru was a little sluggish. She had been busy with the Nie Family’s matter these past few days and was just trying to relax.","“What is it?”","She more or less knew that Shadow would not report just for an ordinary auction item.","Shadow looked up at her. “It’s a gene medicine that can extend one’s lifespan.”","Nie Qingru put the cup down and looked at him. “...You’re saying that the Pharmacy Association is auctioning life-extending gene medicine?”","“Yes.”","“Are you sure this gene medicine has the effect of prolonging one’s life?” Nie Qingru twirled her fingers. This was her subconscious thinking action.","Shadow, of course, saw it. He paused before saying seriously, “Yes.”","Nie Qingru became excited. “How many people know about this?”","Shadow answered truthfully, “The Pharmacy Association intends to auction it at a high price. The main guests going to the charity gala tomorrow know about this.”","“Pfft!” Nie Qingru had been in power for too long and did not care about the other competitors at all. “It seems many people want this medicine.”","People of their status no longer cared about the joy brought about by money. What everyone pursued was time.","It would take more and longer for them to enjoy everything they had.","Nie Qingru was no exception.","She had heard that the Pharmacy Association had once studied a medicine that could change one’s genetic sequence, allowing one’s lifespan to increase.","However, the experiment was not very successful. The big bosses supporting this experiment later also withdrew their investment and the Pharmacy Association stopped the research.","Everyone thought that the experiment had failed.","Who knew that the Pharmacy Association really had such a medicine?","She did not doubt the medicine’s authenticity.","The Pharmacy Association was an authority in this area. Since they were auctioning it, they would be responsible for the medicine’s efficacy.","Gene medicine...","Nie Qingru was determined to get it. However, she still asked cautiously, “Have you found out who made the Pharmacy Association sell it?”"]},{"number":3575,"title":"Chapter 3575: Investigate Qiao Nian’s Whereabouts","paragraphs":["Chapter 3575: Investigate Qiao Nian’s Whereabouts","Editor: Atlas Studios","“I’ve asked around.” Shadow lowered his head. “It’s a person called K. He should be the big boss who entrusted the Pharmacy Association to research gene medicine. From what the Pharmacy Association said, it seems the experiment only succeeded in producing this one pill. That person stored it in the Pharmacy Association. He originally said that he would take the medicine when he was of a certain age. Unexpectedly, he encountered some setbacks and needed money. Apparently, he thought for a long time before entrusting the Pharmacy Association to auction this medicine.","“Recently, only the gala tomorrow is grand enough to match the medicine’s specifications. Probably because of this, the Pharmacy Association’s people came looking for us.”","Such a heaven-defying medicine couldn’t be cheap.","Ordinary auctions couldn’t auction such things. Only underground auctions barely qualified.","However, there was a fixed time for underground auctions. The other party was anxious to cash out, so they needed to think of other ways. Coincidentally, the charity party that Her Majesty the Empress was attending tomorrow was suitable.","...","With Nie Qingru attending the banquet, many reclusive families’ forces would give her face and attend. Many business giants and famous politicians were also attending.","The gene medicine was enough to cause a sensation.","Nie Qingru stood up and thought quickly. The corners of her mouth twitched as she adjusted her shoulder and snorted. “Such a coincidence.”","She felt that there was more to this.","At the very least, it wasn’t as simple and reasonable as it seemed.","The Pharmacy Association had always had the pill. This medicine was extremely precious, but it was being auctioned at such a time.","Shadow looked at her worriedly. “Since there’s something fishy about it, let’s...”","Nie Qingru interrupted him before he could finish, “Of course, we’re going.”","“Didn’t you say...?” Shadow did not understand.","Since the Empress thought there was a trap, why would she attend the banquet tomorrow?","Nie Qingru calmly tucked the hair behind her ear and said indifferently, “You said it yourself. The medicine is real. No matter what’s fishy about this matter, I still want that medicine!”","She was old, she needed this medicine to prolong her life.","Nie Qingru knew that the so-called gene medicine was not omnipotent. Extending one’s lifespan was only a saying. There was a high chance that it would only activate the cells in the body to maintain their youth and vitality. Then, they could live for two more years while strengthening their bodies.","That was enough.","She had to get this medicine even if it only extended her life by just half a year.","Nie Qingru paced back and forth before ordering Shadow with a deep gaze, “Investigate K again.”","Before Shadow could leave, she added, “Also, find out Qiao Nian’s whereabouts.”","**","Qiao Nian had already expected Nie Qingru’s response when she found out that the gene medicine would be auctioned tomorrow.","That’s why she used an alias to check into the hotel and even erased her record at the customs at the airport in advance.","So, Shadow searched for a long time but could not find anything.","Moreover, Ye Wangchuan agreed to help her set up a smokescreen in the independent continent to create the illusion that she was still there.","After a round of investigation, Shadow reported this information to Nie Qingru.","“The Ji family is in a mess.","“Qiao Nian is still in the independent continent.”","Her biggest worry was this granddaughter related to her by blood and whom she hated the most. Thus, she was relieved upon hearing that Qiao Nian was in the independent continent.","“Have someone keep an eye on her.”","“Okay.”","Shadow knew what to do without her telling him."]},{"number":3576,"title":"Chapter 3576: Of Course Sister Nian Is in Continent M","paragraphs":["Chapter 3576: Of Course Sister Nian Is in Continent M","Editor: Atlas Studios","Continent M.","At the hotel.","Qiao Nian received another call from Ye Wangchuan. She knew Shadow had just investigated her whereabouts and lazily threw the lighter on the table.","“Let them investigate. As long as they don’t find me before tomorrow.”","After a moment of silence on the other end of the call, she heard a chuckle. “... Tsk, why didn’t I know that Goddess Qiao had a gene medicine?”","...","Qiao Nian pulled out a chair and sat down, then rubbed her face and smiled. “What gene medicine? It’s just a strengthened version of the small pill.”","Without waiting for Ye Wangchuan to ask, she arrogantly continued, “Gene medicine is just a concept. Humans will never be able to break through the constraint of death, but death can’t change the greed in human bones. She knows this medicine can’t really let her live to 200 years old, but as long as there’s a one in a million chance, even if she lives one day longer, she will fight for this medicine.”","Whatever that gene medicine was, she had played with it since she was 18.","“So it’s a fake.” Ye Wangchuan was not surprised. His voice was clean and warm.","Qiao Nian placed her hand on her knee and lowered her head to think. “You can’t say that.”","“Mm?”","She blinked slowly before explaining. “I said the medicine is a strengthened version of the small pill. The small pill can nourish and strengthen the body. It’s from our ancestors. The painstaking efforts accumulated over 5,000 years of culture are not fake. That’s the prescription I found in an antique interlayer overseas. What so many people have spent so much effort to develop can indeed prolong life.”","Her small pill was born from these prescriptions that had been accumulated for over 5,000 years. Countless medical geniuses had spent their lives researching them.","The medicine was real.","Gene medicine was just a concept.","In reality, no medicine could extend one’s lifespan, but if one’s body was strong and nourished, one could live for a few more years.","“If I didn’t say that, she wouldn’t have taken the bait.” Qiao Nian leaned back in her chair and swung her legs, exuding casualness.","Ye Wangchuan finally asked her, “How do you plan to get in tomorrow?”","This question had been on her mind for the past two days. She had been thinking about it on the plane.","But she had already made up her mind.","Qiao Nian: “Just... pass as a waiter?”","She had previously thought of other identities, such as creating a fake identity and sneaking in as a guest, or getting Ji Lin’s help.","Later on, she thought about it and realized that neither of them was good.","Under such circumstances, it was better to pass as an inconspicuous attendant.","Nie Qingru had a proud and aloof personality and she was used to being self-centered. She wouldn’t pay attention to the waiters around her.","She only needed to lay low for a while to find an opportunity to follow Nie Qingru’s men.","“Waiter?” Ye Wangchuan could not imagine Qiao Nian being a waiter, but he felt that this was a good idea.","Qiao Nian said in a low voice, “Don’t worry, I’ve already made a fake identity. I’m mainly in charge of carrying the plates. I’ll report tomorrow morning.”","The standard of this banquet was very high, and the security measures were strict. Outsiders were strictly prohibited from sneaking in.","Coupled with the Pharmacy Association auctioning the gene medicine today, the security would only be stricter tomorrow.","However, there were always gaps and easily overlooked places in strict security, such as inconspicuous... waiters.","The banquet was grand and required a lot of manpower.","Qiao Nian’s fake identity was that of an Asian international student. The age was not much different from hers, and the key was that it was easy to disguise her face.","Seeming to know what Ye Wangchuan planned to say, she paused and added, “I’ll be careful.”"]},{"number":3577,"title":"Chapter 3577: Sister Nian Really Sneaked In","paragraphs":["Chapter 3577: Sister Nian Really Sneaked In","Editor: Atlas Studios","The next day.","At the charity banquet.","The banquet was being held at a 7-star hotel under the Sapor Family.","For the banquet, the kitchen started making the food in the morning. In addition, the foreman manager called the waiters who were going to help at the banquet today for training early in the morning.","This banquet was very high-end. There were more than a hundred waiters.","...","In addition to the hotel’s own waiters, they also needed some people to do odd jobs outside the venue. The hotel usually called people who did odd jobs here to replace them.","Although these off-site waiters were not important, the banquet was still classy. The guests were all celebrities from all walks of life.","The hotel wouldn’t hire ordinary people either.","He was afraid that if a guest bumped into the waiters and spoke to them in a foreign language, these people wouldn’t be able to understand. That would be too lowly.","Therefore, the dozens of handymen they hired were foreign students from nearby universities. They also had good looks and temperament.","Of course, the remuneration was generous.","“When the banquet begins, don’t wander around. Stay at your respective spots. Refill the table if you see it’s running out of food and drinks.","“In addition, the guests this time are all important figures. As long as they don’t talk to you, no one is allowed to initiate conversation in any way. Do you understand?”","The foreman manager had been explaining the rules since eight in the morning. Almost two hours had passed, but he was still admonishing the hundred and eighty people present sternly.","In the crowd, an inconspicuous oriental mixed-blood face stood in the corner of the third row. Under the supervisor’s stern gaze sweeíng around, she replied inconspicuously, “Understood.”","Just by looking at her appearance, she seemed very obedient.","However, if one listened carefully to her ‘understood’, they would detect a hint of arrogance and laziness. She was unable to suppress the unyieldingness in her bones.","However, no one would pay attention to an inconspicuous part-time worker, let alone notice that she had a pair of wolf cub-like eyes.","The foreman manager mentioned seven or eight more complicated rules before noticing it was noon. He finally clapped his hands and let everyone go.","“Alright, spread out and get to work.”","“Phew~”","Everyone heaved a sigh of relief and prepared to disperse.","At this moment.","The foreman manager, who was about to leave, casually pointed at two people. “You and you. Come with me. The kitchen needs someone to wash the vegetables.”","Qiao Nian’s eyes narrowed. Unsurprisingly, the finger was pointing at her. She touched the bridge of her nose, speechless.","The other person couldn’t help but complain, “Tsk, how unlucky!”","He looked at the unlucky fellow who was chosen with Qiao Nian. The other party was wearing black-framed glasses that covered her eyes. He could roughly tell her facial features were not bad and her temperament was alright. However, she looked like a bookworm. In short, she was not eye-catching. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have only just noticed the girl who had been standing beside him for so long.","He vaguely glimpsed a pair of dark brown eyes under the girl’s thick lenses, but before he could see clearly, they were blocked by her eyelashes.","Mixed-blood?","He looked at the other party’s skin and hair color critically. It was a pity that she was a mixed-blood with an Asian face.","In Continent M, Asians had never been thought highly of.","The locals did not ostracize these yellow-skinned and black-haired people. But they did not like them very much. They always felt that these people were naturally inferior and not as tall and smart as their fair-skinned selves."]},{"number":3578,"title":"Chapter 3578: The Guests Outside Are Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 3578: The Guests Outside Are Here","Editor: Atlas Studios","Therefore, seeing that the other party was a mixed-blood Easterner, he stopped looking at her and said perfunctorily, “Let’s go. The foreman picked us.”","Qiao Nian followed silently.","Along the way, the tall foreign man complained about how unlucky he was to be reduced to a dishwasher.","Qiao Nian heard him curse a few times, but he also lowered his voice and chattered.","They were taken to the back kitchen. Soon, someone guided them to the right corner to a mound of fruits and vegetables.","...","Seven or eight people were sitting there, busily chopping fruits and vegetables.","No one had the time to greet the two newcomers. They only explained how to wash these expensive fruits and vegetables before assigning them a bunch of tasks and then walking away to return to work.","Qiao Nian looked at the pile assigned to her. She did not look as embarrassed as the tall foreign man. Instead, she rolled up her sleeves leisurely and started working.","The tall foreign man held his breath upon seeing the Asian mixed blood start to work obediently. His face reddened, and his lips were pursed. In the end, he suppressed his anger and also started to work.","***","This work lasted for three to four hours.","Besides having lunch and resting for two hours.","Qiao Nian was instructed by the kitchen staff to do this and that almost the entire time. She cooperated well and did things cleanly. Besides not being talkative, there was nothing wrong with her.","The kitchen staff gradually became familiar with her and felt that Qiao Nian’s personality wasn’t bad.","At six o’clock in the afternoon, the sun began to set outside. The kitchen was almost done with the chores, and many people carried them outside when they were free.","“The guests will be here soon, right?”","“Looks like a small number have already arrived.”","“I heard that tonight’s banquet is special. It’s not the kind that you often see on television. This time, no media reporters were invited.”","“Look at the ingredients. All expensive imported goods. That truffle fish is imported as if it were free. Tsk, even the chef is a master hired just for today.”","Done with her work, Qiao Nian was wiping her hands unhurriedly.","She was surprisingly low-key while helping out in the kitchen. No one noticed her existence.","“Hey.”","However, after she finished wiping her hands, the unlucky man who had been chosen with her called her out with an ugly expression.","“The people outside are all here. We’re going to guard our spots. Do you want to go over?”","He sounded very displeased.","The main reason was that Qiao Nian had been very cooperative all day, so he had no choice but to work hard.","Qiao Nian was a woman, and he couldn’t be too harsh on her. He could only suppress his anger. “Anyway, I’m going now.”","He did not want to continue staying in this damned kitchen.","After he spoke, he saw the woman throw the tissue into the trash can, raise her hand, and push the black-framed glasses up the bridge of her nose. Then, she raised her head slightly, revealing her fair and translucent oval face, and looked at him calmly.","“Yes, let’s go together.”","He was stunned for a moment.","This voice—","It was faint and carried a hint of indulgence and laziness. It also sounded dry.","His heart skipped a beat, and he looked at the other party’s face.","However, before he could say anything, the woman lowered her eyebrows again and covered her eyes with her fringe as she unhurriedly towards the banquet hall.","He looked at the other party’s back, stunned for a full second before giving himself a tight slap. He cursed at his thoughts and quickly chased after her."]},{"number":3579,"title":"Chapter 3579: The Old Witch Is Still Worried About Sister Nian","paragraphs":["Chapter 3579: The Old Witch Is Still Worried About Sister Nian","Editor: Atlas Studios","The lights outside the hotel were shining brightly.","All kinds of luxury cars were parked outside, and the guests entered the hotel.","The security measures were especially strict today. Even though the guests’ identities were extraordinary, they did not relax at all. Almost everyone had their fingerprints verified.","This was also the best security check method the organizers had come up with after consulting Nie Qingru.","A person could disguise everything, but it was impossible for them to fake even their fingerprints, right?","...","As long as they verified every guest’s fingerprint, they could effectively prevent irrelevant people from sneaking in.","As guests entered the hotel, a black Rolls-Royce stopped gently at the entrance, but the doors did not open immediately.","“Empress, we’re here.”","Shadow had personally driven today.","“Okay.” Nie Qingru looked like a ghost blending into the setting sun sitting in the backseat. If someone had not called out to her, she would have been hiding in the dark and waiting for an opportunity to move.","When she was about to get out, she seemed to think of something and suddenly stopped. She looked at Shadow with her snake-like eyes. “Is Qiao Nian doing anything?”","Shadow opened the door and was about to get out of the car when he heard that. He looked over and hid the surprise in his eyes as he respectfully said, “No, she’s still in the independent continent.”","Many people were waiting outside for her to get out of the car. Nie Qingru narrowed her eyes and suppressed the uncomfortable feeling in her heart. Her face was expressionless.","“That’s good.”","Outside, the Sapor family representative personally opened the door for her. Under everyone’s gaze, Nie Qingru stepped out of the car.","People did not dare to look closely at her blade-like figure.","“That’s... that person?”","“Besides that person, who else can make the eldest daughter of the Sapor family personally open the door and even hold it carefully for fear of her hitting it?”","“I heard that not long ago, that person’s family made a fool of themselves.”","“Why should we care about that? No matter how much trouble her family makes, that person’s status is unshakable. Even if her family falls, she won’t be affected.”","“You’re right.”","The people invited to the charity banquet organized by the Sapor family were not ordinary people. They also knew in advance that a very distinguished guest would attend.","No one was a fool. They would still check in on such things.","Nie Qingru rarely interacted with commoners, but people of this level more or less knew of the reclusive families’ existence.","Nie Qingru was like the bright moon in the sky, the pearl at the top of the reclusive families. How could one not yearn for her?","It was a pity that this bright moon was not easy to get along with. Her steps were arrogant, attracting everyone’s attention.","Her identity was special. No one dared to check her identity, nor did anyone dare to ask for her fingerprint.","Nie Qingru entered the hotel as if she owned it. Surrounded by the crowd, she looked at the dazzling banquet hall and subconsciously looked around as if searching for someone.","The eldest daughter of the Sapor family was stunned at her reaction and also looked around. “Empress, are you looking for someone?”","Seemingly stabbed by her words, Nie Qingru coldly retracted her gaze. “No.”","* * *","Not far away, a blond young man with blue eyes looked down.","“That must be the Empress of the reclusive families.” The person beside him noticed the group of people majestically entering the hotel. He pursed his lips slightly and revealed a yearning expression.","The young man with blond hair and blue eyes did not mind. “Yes.”"]},{"number":3580,"title":"Chapter 3580: Recognizing Sister Nian at a Glance","paragraphs":["Chapter 3580: Recognizing Sister Nian at a Glance","Editor: Atlas Studios","“By the way, why don’t I see Elder Zhong?” That person was clearly familiar with the Pharmacy Association. After being temporarily attracted by Nie Qingru’s entrance, he turned around and asked Robert.","Robert politely replied, “Teacher is in seclusion doing experiments and doesn’t have time to come. I came on Teacher’s behalf to help keep an eye on the auction items.”","“Oh.”","Everyone knew that Zhong Yiliu was an experiment maniac. The other person was not surprised.","“By the way, what collection is the Pharmacy Association auctioning this time? I didn’t know you were coming to this charity banquet.”","...","The Pharmacy Association rarely participated in such ostentatious banquets. They lived like ascetics, focused on their experiments every day.","They were either at the laboratory or the library.","They rarely went out, let alone participate in such social occasions.","He had not seen Robert for a long time. In surprise, he called out to him and couldn’t help but say a few more words.","Robert vaguely explained that it did not belong to their Pharmacy Association. It was just that someone had deposited it with them. They were only helping that person auction it this time.","As he spoke, he inadvertently glanced sideways.","This was his subconscious when he was impatient at social events.","Suddenly, his attention was attracted by a figure, an inconspicuous waiter wearing black-framed glasses, looking dim and unremarkable.","Robert’s eyes widened. For a moment, he thought his eyes were playing tricks on him.","Goddess Q?","He had seen Qiao Nian a few times and remembered her face.","The waiter in the corner did not look like the Goddess Q he remembered. In fact, her temperament was different. However, his strong sixth sense told him otherwise.","That person was Goddess Q!","Shocked, Robert instinctively wanted to chase after the girl so he could take another look.","At this moment, seemingly sensing something, the waiter tidied up the egg tarts on the table and looked over, meeting his gaze.","Those eyes...","If Robert had only thought that the person was Goddess Q based on his sixth sense before, upon meeting eyes, he was 100% sure of the inconspicuous waiter’s identity now.","Before he could say anything, the other party’s lips moved as if she were talking to him.","He carefully deciphered it.","Qiao Nian seemed to be saying: Stand still.","His mind instantly cleared up and he stopped himself from chasing after her.","The gene medicine his teacher had asked him to auction this time should be Goddess Q’s idea. Goddess Q was obviously pretending to be a waiter. If he tried to talk to her like this, it would definitely arouse suspicion.","Robert’s feet took root. In just a few seconds, he had already figured out most of what was going on. His expression also gradually returned to normal from his initial excitement.","“You...” His momentary reaction did not escape the eyes of the man talking to him.","He was about to follow his gaze when a middle-aged man in black suddenly appeared in front of them. He confirmed Robert’s identity before saying, “Hello, Mr. Robert. Her Majesty the Empress wants to see you. Please come with me.”","Robert quickly composed himself, grunted, and followed him.","After this incident, the other person had also forgotten about the small episode just now. He no longer thought of looking in Qiao Nian’s direction.","The waiter in the corner was like a drop of water into the sea.","No one noticed her."]},{"number":3581,"title":"Chapter 3581: She Felt A Dangerous Look Behind Her","paragraphs":["Chapter 3581: She Felt A Dangerous Look Behind Her","Editor: Atlas Studios","Robert followed Shadow all the way to the first seat on the left of the main table and looked at the woman at the center of tonight’s conversation.","He greeted her with familiarity. “Long time no see, Your Majesty.”","“Mm.”","Nie Qingru nodded slightly and more gently before asking, “Why isn’t your teacher here?”","Robert did not dare to underestimate her casual question, and he replied very carefully, “Teacher asked me to come as he is in seclusion doing experiments.”","...","He had used this excuse on others before, and no one doubted it.","“Oh?” Nie Qingru stared at him after he finished speaking. Her eyes were calm and emotionless, but they were filled with oppression.","Robert’s heart skipped a beat. His intuition told him the other party had seen through his lame lie and might even know that Zhong Yiliu was in the independent continent.","However, he quickly composed himself and did not give himself away. He politely changed the topic. “Why did you call me over?”","Nie Qingru fiddled with the auction card in her hand. “I called you over to ask about Elder Zhong’s situation. Since your teacher is in seclusion, please convey my concern.”","“Will do.”","Robert looked down.","“I will convey the Empress’ concern to my teacher.”","Seeing that Nie Qingru seemed to have nothing else to say, he looked up at the front where the lights were focused and politely said, “The banquet is about to begin. Empress, I’ll stop disturbing you and return to my seat.”","“Go.” Nie Qingru’s thin lips curled up, and she became much calmer.","The lights in the banquet hall began to dim, a sign that the banquet was about to begin.","Robert was about to leave quietly when a cold, sinister voice suddenly came from behind.","“Why didn’t I know the Pharmacy Association had a laboratory in the independent continent?”","Robert’s heart pounded as he turned around and looked at Nie Qingru in shock.","She looked at him with a judgmental and disdainful gaze, as well as a hint of mockery. “He trusts Qiao Nian so much that he didn’t hesitate to offend me for a little girl who hasn’t even grown up.”","Robert’s heart beat even faster. Because of Nie Qingru’s explicit words, his heart was so agitated that it was about to jump out of his throat. If he hadn’t pinched his palm, he might not have been able to control his facial expression.","“Teacher is in the laboratory. As for what experiment he’s doing, it’s not my responsibility.” Robert knew without looking in the mirror that his expression must be pretty strange. It was definitely not calm.","Nie Qingru paused for a second when she heard this. Her sharp gaze swept across his face before she lost interest. “Okay, return to your seat.”","Robert walked away quickly. In the blink of an eye, he went to the back row to find his seat.","After he left, Shadow floated out like a ghost and leaned over to whisper in Nie Qingru’s ear. “Empress, should we find an opportunity to ‘warn’ the Pharmacy Association?”","It was almost seven in the evening, and the banquet was about to begin.","Not many people paid attention to their interlude. They only thought that Nie Qingru had called someone from the Pharmacy Association for a greeting.","Robert returned to his seat, and Shadow was talking to her... In the eyes of others, this was normal. There was nothing worth paying attention to.","However, as Shadow spoke, Nie Qingru acutely felt a gaze on her back. It was like a sharp arrow was about to pierce through her heart. The whistling wind carried a sense of danger."]},{"number":3582,"title":"Chapter 3582: Should We Warn the Pharmacy Association","paragraphs":["Chapter 3582: Should We Warn the Pharmacy Association","Editor: Atlas Studios","Her expression was a little ugly. Instinctively, she seized that moment and turned around to look in the direction of the gaze.","Nie Qingru’s expression was not good. She was cold and angry, scaring the Sapor Family members sitting not far away from her. Their faces paled, and they were at a loss. “E-Empress?”","They didn’t do anything, did they... Why was the Empress suddenly looking in their direction?","Shadow frowned at Nie Qingru’s sudden reaction and also looked over.","In that direction, other than the guests, only waiters were passing by. There was nothing worth paying attention to, and no one knew what Nie Qingru was looking at...","...","After all, he was not a member of the Sapor family. Having been by Nie Qingru’s side for more than 20 years, he knew his master’s personality better than anyone else.","Nie Qingru’s actions were never meaningless.","Especially in the past few years, it was rare to encounter something that caused his master’s expression to change. Most of the time, his master disdained to overreact and show many emotions to her surroundings. Her facial expression was cold most of the time. At most, she looked down at the people who came looking for her.","It was rare for Nie Qingru to lose her composure.","“What did you see?”","Nie Qing’s hawk-like gaze searched through the crowd, trying to find the gaze’s owner.","But no matter how hard she tried... besides strange gazes looking back at her, she did not catch the owner of that gaze just now...","“I’m fine.” She took a deep breath and slowly sat back down. She wondered if her nerves had been too tense recently, which was why she felt that gaze.","Shadow saw that she looked tired and frustrated. He pursed his lips and lowered his voice. “If you are worried, I will go to the security office to take a look.”","This event required the guests to confirm their fingerprints at the entrance. The possibility of someone sneaking in was almost zero.","Nie Qingru also knew this. She held her forehead and shook her head. “Alright, I just didn’t rest well. My nerves are too strung up. When I get that pill... I’ll get someone to check it. If there’s no problem, I’ll take it. I might get better.”","Nie Qingru had been suffering from migraines for a long time. This chronic illness not only affected her daily headaches but also affected her sleep.","When she did not rest well, it was indeed easy for her to become irritable.","Shadow knew she had been busy dealing with the Nie family’s mess recently, and she was so angry that she could not sleep well for a few days.","Therefore, he did not probe further. “...As for the Pharmacy Association...”","He had just started.","Nie Qingru said, “Don’t worry about him for now!”","Shadow fell silent.","Nie Qingru glanced at him. “The Pharmacy Association has always been on the neutral side. It looks like they’re hiding the key facts, and they have many connections. Zhong Yiliu is a smart person. He might have some friendship with Qiao Nian. It’s fine if he helps out a little, but if it involves the Pharmacy Association, he might consider it carefully. Since he’s only helping out of personal friendship and hasn’t crossed the line, if I’m so domineering that I don’t even allow this, the others will laugh at me! Also... since he hasn’t interfered in big matters, if I make things difficult for the Pharmacy Association, wouldn’t I be forcing him to side with that evil creature? I’m not that stupid.”","She was disgusted by everyone in the Ji family, especially those who had that person’s blood flowing in their veins.","As long as it was someone who helped the Ji family or that person’s descendants, she wished she could turn them into ashes."]},{"number":3583,"title":"Chapter 3583: Don’t You Know That The Big Boss Was Looking At Us Just Now?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3583: Don’t You Know That The Big Boss Was Looking At Us Just Now?","Editor: Atlas Studios","However, they couldn’t touch Zhong Yiliu for now. The Pharmacy Association was not big, but the big shots in the illegal district and Continent F owed them a lot of favors.","For example, Lu Zhi owed Zhong Yiliu a favor.","Therefore, this ‘Great Herbalist’ was not someone she could casually vent her anger on.","Nie Qingru quickly said, “Qiao Nian called him over to treat Ji Lingfeng. Ignore Zhong Yiliu before the others from the Pharmacy Association take action.”","“Okay.” Shadow obeyed her order.","...","Nie Qingru saw that Miss Sapor was about to go on the stage under a beam of light. She waved at the silent man and ordered, “Go about your work.”","“Yes.”","Shadow hid in the darkness, as usual.","* * *","When Nie Qingru turned around to look in the three o’clock direction, an inconspicuous waiter came out of the kitchen with champagne.","She placed the missing champagne on the table and returned to her original position.","At this moment, the tall foreign man glanced at her and said with a low voice, “You don’t know that not long after you left, the big shot in the first row looked back at us for a long time. She seemed to be looking for someone. I wonder who she was looking for. At that time, many people followed her gaze and looked at us. It was scary.”","“Oh.”","The girl responded indifferently as if it had nothing to do with her.","The tall foreign man sized her up. Noticing Qiao Nian’s cold attitude, he did not say anything. He only muttered, “Anyway, it has nothing to do with us. If she wants to find someone, it must be a guest. She definitely won’t look for a waiter like us...”","This time, Qiao Nian couldn’t even be bothered to brush him off. Her bright eyes behind the thick black-framed glasses glanced at the back of the person in the first row.","This time, she restrained herself. Her calm gaze did not attract Nie Qingru’s attention, who was watching the commotion on the stage.","The banquet had already begun.","Most of the lights in the hall were extinguished. Besides barely maintaining the light around them, all the lights were focused on the stage.","Dressed in the high-end clothes of the G brand, the eldest daughter of the Sapor family stood on the stage and spoke into the microphone. She talked about world peace, paying attention to the lives of poor civilians, war, and other topics.","Qiao Nian’s temples throbbed uncontrollably as she listened to the hypocritical speech. She felt as if someone had knocked her head with a clapper, making her scalp tingle. She felt vexed.","At this moment, Miss Sapor paused for a few seconds, and a round of enthusiastic applause sounded from below the stage.","If not for the fact that she knew very well how many of the guests at tonight’s banquet had relied on sucking blood from others to get rich and obtain their current status, she would believe that these people were philanthropists who cared about the lives of the poor.","However, the truth was the opposite.","Even people like Nie Qingru were used to being arrogant and lording over others. Besides the people in their circle, everyone else was just ants in their eyes.","Who would really care about the life and death of an ant that they could casually crush, let alone gather together to donate money to an ant?","Donating money was just a headliner!","The so-called high society charity banquet was essentially just a social gathering for the same class and the transfer of benefits through auctions.","Qiao Nian’s eyelids twitched. She looked at the people on stage giving passionate speeches and then at the guests below clapping and smiling fakely.","Under the dim light, she took out the candy Ye Wangchuan gave her before they left and threw it into her mouth."]},{"number":3584,"title":"Chapter 3584: Finally Here","paragraphs":["Chapter 3584: Finally Here","Editor: Atlas Studios","The girl finally calmed down a little. Her gaze wandered around casually, and she inadvertently glanced at the tall foreign man not far away.","The other party seemed to sense her gaze and opened his mouth in surprise. He couldn’t believe she was slacking off.","Qiao Nian ignored him, retracted her gaze, and bit into the candy. Then, she licked her lips and stared at the stage with her dark eyes.","Indeed, in the few minutes she was distracted, Miss Sapor’s “noble” speech ended.","Right on the heels of that, a person in charge went on stage to announce that an auction was going to begin. A portion of the proceeds would be donated to charity.","...","Qiao Nian had seen so-called rich people’s auctions in Rao City in the past. The portion that they spoke of was not even half of what the netizens thought.","In fact, it could be 10,000, 50,000, or 100,000 yuan.","It was already not bad if a seven-figure auction item amounted to a donation worth a few tens of thousands.","An auction item worth tens of millions could come up to a hundred thousand yuan in donation.","As for this charity gala, if nothing went wrong, it would be the same procedure. They just had to donate a few dollars to save face.","In fact, the proceeds from the auction fell into the auctioneer’s hands.","Tonight’s auction was special. In addition, Nie Qingru was in attendance, so the auction items were quite expensive.","Tourmaline, diamond necklaces, and jewelry with some historical collection value were presented.","During this period, Nie Qingru raised her placard and bid for a set of pearls and jewelry of collector value. After whispering a few words to the staff beside her, someone went up the stage and announced that she would donate this set of jewelry to the families of the recently deceased sailors in the open sea.","The price was in the eight figures.","It was nothing too extravagant given her background, but it was still generous and suited her status.","Donating eight-figure jewelry on the spot won her a lot of praise. When her face appeared on the big screen, Nie Qingru only nodded slightly, full of arrogance and nobility.","Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and counted the time with her hands in her pockets.","The banquet lasted for almost two hours.","Besides Nie Qingru, who had bid for a set of jewelry as a show of respect, people from several large families had raised their auction cards only once. They looked relaxed and determined to win. Clearly, they were waiting for the finale item.","Qiao Nian knew what they were waiting for, so she wasn’t in a hurry to leave.","The gaze of the foreign man who had been observing her was attracted by the bustling auction on the stage.","He looked at the seven-figure and eight-figure bids fervently and had seemingly forgotten about her.","Qiao Nian was happy to be free, so she leaned against the wall and watched the commotion.","After a few rounds, tonight’s finale item finally appeared.","The people from the big families who had long received the news all became serious. They sat up straight and stared at the item being wheeled onto the stage.","The lady pulled the golden velvet cloth to reveal a box, inside which was a snow-white pill.","Compared to the expensive jewelry dazzling under the light, the medicine pill looked a little inconspicuous.","At least to ordinary people, this was not as valuable as the box containing the diamonds.","However, the moment the velvet cloth was lifted, the big shots’ eyes lit up. Their unconcealable excitement was much more fanatical than the diamonds and jewelry from before.","“Our last item today is a medicinal pill sent by the Pharmacy Association on Mr. K’s behalf. The starting price is 30 million dollars.”"]},{"number":3585,"title":"Chapter 3585: Sister Nian Snatched Her Medicine Crazily","paragraphs":["Chapter 3585: Sister Nian Snatched Her Medicine Crazily","Editor: Atlas Studios","Not everyone knew about the existence of gene medicine.","Apart from a few families who had received the news that the Pharmacy Association’s gene medicine would be auctioned tonight, most who came to participate in the charity banquet treated it as an ordinary charity banquet of higher standards.","Ordinary charity banquets would only auction some jewelry and jade, plus a few paintings, porcelain, and so on.","This was the first time some had seen medicine being auctioned.","Moreover, the starting price was jaw-dropping.","...","Discussions buzzed below the stage, and many people’s eyes almost popped out.","“30 million? Did I hear wrongly? Isn’t the starting price of that pill wrong? What medicine costs 30 million per pill?”","A collector-class sports car was only worth tens of millions.","A villa in a prime location cost tens of millions.","However, a pill that looked ordinary under the light cost 30 million... Wouldn’t people laugh their heads off if word got out?","But such a ridiculous thing had happened in front of them. They had no choice but to believe it!","“It’s said to be an auction item consigned by the Pharmacy Association. What kind of medicine is this? Could it be some kind of cancer-targeting medicine?”","“If the starting price is 30 million, it means the bid will only get higher. Who would spend tens of millions to buy a pill?”","“Shh. Didn’t you see the reactions of the big shots at the main table? Even the organizers of this banquet, the Sapor family, are looking eager... I’m afraid we can’t estimate the price of this medicine.”","Not only did they notice the reactions of the main guests at the main table, but even the waiters who were in charge of delivering snacks and champagne to the VIPs were shocked.","In the world of the rich, spending 30 million to buy a pill was ridiculous and unbelievable, let alone in the eyes of ordinary people... Some people would spend tens of millions to buy a pill?!","However, that was what was happening right now.","The tall foreign man beside Qiao Nian was shocked and subconsciously turned to look at the Asian woman’s reaction.","As expected, he saw the other party leaning against the wall. Her head was lowered, with her black-framed glasses up her nose bridge.","Then, seeming to have noticed his gaze, she looked up at him—","He didn’t know what he was nervous about for a moment. His palms were sticky with sweat. He suddenly straightened and clenched his palms, looking at the stage as if he had never been in a mess!","Finally—","The auction began.","An elder of the Sapor family was the first to raise his auction card. He smiled at the others and shouted, “Then I’ll warm up the auction for everyone. 32 million.”","He added quite a bit, increasing the bid by two million in one go.","However, this was only heroic in the eyes of outsiders.","In the eyes of people of the same level as him, it was not an exaggeration to say that he wanted to warm up the banquet. Two million was just an addition to sprinkle water. It could be considered a form of modesty as the banquet’s organizer.","Sure enough, after someone broke the tense atmosphere, a second person immediately picked it up.","Number 9 raised his sign and shouted, “40 million.”","This time, he added eight million in one go, directly raising the price to 40 million!","This did not scare anyone who wanted to compete with him.","Next, No. 3, No. 4, No. 7, No. 10... raised their signs one after another.","The bid had already soared from eight digits to nine digits. The latest bid was number 6, with a bid of 100 million.","The key was that the big shots at the main table in the front row had no intention of stopping."]},{"number":3586,"title":"Chapter 3586: It’s Just a Pill, Do They Have To Do That?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3586: It’s Just a Pill, Do They Have To Do That?","Editor: Atlas Studios","At first, whispers abounded in the banquet hall with people discussing the bid’s increasing price.","The whispers almost died down when the price soared to 80 million.","When someone called out 100 million, there was no longer any discussion...","It was just a pill.","Just one pill.","...","But the price was as high as a nine-figure sum.","This was already the bidding price before a certain someone had participated.","That’s right, not only did some of the people at the banquet notice that Nie Qingru, holding the No. 1 auction plate, had yet to bid once, even the members of the Sapor family kept looking in her direction, their expressions becoming increasingly serious as they got restless in their seats.","Miss Sapor was the initiator of this charity gala, so she did not participate in the auction. Instead, she watched her uncle bid.","Her beautiful eyes turned twice and landed on the woman sitting upright like a pine tree beside her. She smiled and leaned over to ask, “Is the Empress not planning to participate in the last round of the auction?”","Nie Qingru wasn’t considered young. She was in her sixties or seventies, with deep traces of age on the corners of her eyes. These traces could not be erased even with the best skincare products.","Miss Sapor leaned closer and spotted lines at the corners of her eyes and lips even more clearly.","However, the woman’s charm caused others to subconsciously ignore her age and wrinkles and focus on the cold aura.","Miss Sapor’s intuition told her that Nie Qingru was determined to get the gene medicine being auctioned. There was no reason. It was just that Nie Qingru’s air of supremacy made her feel that she had long been eyeing the finale item...","“The bid is already at 100 million.”","Nie Qingru raised her eyes and took a sip of champagne. “No hurry.”","Surprised, Miss Sapor carefully asked, “Do you think the current bid hasn’t reached the maximum price?”","“Tsk.”","Nie Qingru let out a soft click this time, her expression inexplicably gloomy. She put down the champagne, and the bottom of the glass knocked against the table with a crisp sound. “I’m afraid the current bid hasn’t even reached half its maximum. Let them bid first. When it’s about time, I’ll naturally bid.”","Miss Sapor’s pupils constricted slightly, barely maintaining proper etiquette.","She sat up straight and looked at the stage again, slightly lost in thought.","100 million was not even half the price of this medicine?","The Empress of the reclusive families estimated the price to be around 300 million?","300 million per pill?","Even though she was the eldest daughter of Sapors and had seen a lot of wealth growing up, she was still stunned by the value of this gene medicine.","It was just a pill...","Was that necessary?","However, none of the bidders gave up just because the price had reached nine digits. Even people continued to bid.","And just as Nie Qingru had said, the price got higher and higher.","The increase of a few million was no longer enough for these people. After the bid got to 100 million, they tacitly agreed to increase each bid by 10 million.","This way, after a few rounds of bidding, the price was quickly raised to 200 million.","After 200 million, the price soared to nearly 300 million.","Even though this was the case, none of the people participating in the bidding at the main table showed any signs of retreating. They were determined to bid for tonight’s finale item.","Robert did not expect the gene medicine could be sold for such a sky-high price.","His seat was at the back. While the lights in the banquet hall were dim, and everyone’s attention was focused on the heated bidding... He secretly glanced in the girl’s direction."]},{"number":3587,"title":"Chapter 3587: The Old Demoness Finally Made a Move","paragraphs":["Chapter 3587: The Old Demoness Finally Made a Move","Editor: Atlas Studios","The girl was hidden in the darkness, with only her outline clearly seen.","Robert looked at the other party’s calm disposition and knew that Goddess Q had long expected such a sensation...","He silently looked back at the stage.","The pill up there was nothing worth paying attention to. It would probably be kicked away if it landed on the ground.","However, such an ordinary pill was being fought over by a group of big bosses from Continent M.","...","He did not understand why this was happening.","...","In the shadows.","Qiao Nian subconsciously reached for her cap before realizing she was not wearing it. Instead, she was disguised as a waiter.","She did not care much about the situation on the stage. She took another candy from her pocket and threw it into her mouth with a calm expression, as if the liveliness had nothing to do with her.","Compared to other people’s surprised or puzzled reactions, she was really too calm.","However, this calmness was not because she was not short of money. Money was just a number to her. It was because she knew too well what these old, rich, and powerful people were thinking.","Perhaps in the eyes of ordinary people, spending so much money to buy a pill was ridiculous.","However, to these people, this pill came from the Pharmacy Association’s Zhong Yiliu. There was only one ‘gene medicine’ pill, and it was worth more than diamonds.","Because they wanted to live on...","The Pharmacy Association was independent from any faction but was respected wherever it went. Why would Lu Zhi, Nie Qingru, and the others not easily offend Zhong Yiliu?","Were they afraid of the Pharmacy Association’s power?","No.","The Pharmacy Association did not have much ability to protect themselves.","But everyone had a tacit understanding.","No matter how much the various factions fought over it, they would not touch doctors.","Everyone was afraid of getting sick and injured!","Even an outlaw on the verge of death would kneel and cry for a doctor’s help.","This was the fundamental reason why the Pharmacy Association was respected wherever they went and no one dared to offend them.","The root cause was this group of people—they were afraid of death.","Qiao Nian’s gaze pierced through the crowd before landing on Nie Qingru again. From this angle, she could only see the back of Nie Qingru’s head.","Every strand of her hair was tied up in an exquisite bun. From afar, one could tell that this person had extraordinary self-discipline and strength.","Qiao Nian felt inexplicably frustrated. She wanted to play with the lighter to divert her attention, but she also wanted to play cards... In the end, Qiao Nian lowered her eyes and bit the fruit candy in her mouth, allowing the sweetness to dilute her destructive frustration.","* * *","Nie Qingru raised her card for the first time when the price was raised to 500 million.","She had the highest status, and her auction card was also No. 1.","She raised her hand. “600 million.”","The banquet hall fell silent.","After a short silence, it was as if a pot had exploded.","“600 ... million?”","“That person actually made a move. I thought she wouldn’t participate in this auction.”","“I remember the final bid in the previous round was 510 million? She raised it by almost 100 million in one go? Oh my god, she’s indeed that person.”","“I want to know this medicine’s origins. Why is it worth a group of great figures fighting over it?” someone muttered absent-mindedly.","Logically speaking, Nie Qingru’s identity was obvious.","After she made a move, out of respect for her, typically no one would compete with her.","However, the situation this time was different.","As the secret research result of the Pharmacy Association’s Zhong Yiliu, and as the only gene medicine in the world, not everyone was willing to let go."]},{"number":3588,"title":"Chapter 3588: Who Is So Blind?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3588: Who Is So Blind?","Editor: Atlas Studios","After the three or four people who were close to the reclusive families reluctantly gave up on bidding, the remaining few briefly considered and gritted their teeth to continue bidding.","At first, out of social courtesy and respect for Nie Qingru, everyone offered a more polite bid.","“610 million.”","“...Then I’ll bid 630 million.”","“Huh? Everyone wants it. I’ll follow the trend. 650 million.”","...","...","The four of them put on a good show and bid with an unspoken mutual understanding. At the same time, they looked at Nie Qingru with a smile, as if they were just bidding. They wanted to convey that they were not trying to be rude to the reclusive families and the Empress.","Nie Qingru knew that not everyone would give up on her account, but she did not expect that four people wanted to fight with her.","Her bones were clearly defined under the light, and her face was cold and solemn. She did not even look at them as she nodded slightly like a proud phoenix with her neck raised.","“800 million.”","His voice was crisp and clear, powerful and resonating.","She was always domineering.","Sure enough, among the four people competing with her, one was timid and seemed to be observing her expression. He hesitated and wondered if he should continue bidding.","It was not that he could not afford to pay 800 million. However, looking at the Empress’ attitude, they would probably not be able to end the auction without parting with at least a billion or two today.","His eyes flickered as he looked at the gene medicine on the stage. He gritted his teeth and squeezed out a smile before saying in front of everyone, “Since you’ve already made a move, I’ll give up.”","Someone went over and took his auction card.","Everyone present was smart. No one believed the nonsense he said at the end to save face.","Seeing that one of their competitors and companions was gone, the remaining three showed varying degrees of hesitation.","However, one of them was much more determined than the other two.","He held up his sign again.","“One billion.”","The crowd was in an uproar.","Even Nie Qingru looked at him.","It was an unfamiliar face.","He had a buzz cut and his face was shaved by a short inch. Dark-skinned, he was wearing a black suit with a tie.","His appearance was not outstanding, but he was energetic and his eyes were bright.","Not to mention that Nie Qingru sized up this unfamiliar face that had appeared out of nowhere, even Qiao Nian, leaning against the wall and waiting for the results, put away her bored expression and looked at the man in the distance.","That person happened to turn his head.","Qiao Nian was far away and could only see the other party’s side profile.","Her dark eyes flashed, and her reaction mirrored Nie Qingru’s...","An unfamiliar face.","In Continent M, not many people had the guts to go against Nie Qingru and still sit here with a straight face after bidding one billion.","This person was definitely not among the few people she could think of.","So where did this person come from?","Qiao Nian’s gaze froze as an inexplicable thought suddenly appeared in her mind.","She felt that it was ridiculous, but at the same time, she felt that... it was really possible.","The man did not care about the gazes. After nodding to Nie Qingru, he sat up straight and looked ahead.","He really did not put her in his eyes.","Nie Qingru’s eyes narrowed and she pursed her lips without saying anything. She wasn’t sure where the other party came from, but she wasn’t someone who could be controlled easily.","She was used to being domineering.","She always got what she wanted.","It was fine if no one fought with her, but if anyone dared challenge her authority, she would definitely hit back.","“1.1 billion.”"]},{"number":3589,"title":"Chapter 3589: An Unfamiliar Face That Appeared Out of Nowhere","paragraphs":["Chapter 3589: An Unfamiliar Face That Appeared Out of Nowhere","Editor: Atlas Studios","Her cold voice carried an imperceptible trace of unhappiness.","Miss Sapor noticed the displeasure under her calm expression. She observed her quietly before quickly looking away.","Under such an atmosphere, anyone with a brain would not continue to go against her.","After all, although gene medicine was abnormally precious, there was no need to offend the Empress of the reclusive families.","Unexpectedly, the man seemed to be blind. It was unknown if he couldn’t see through Nie Qingru’s expression.","...","He raised his auction card again and even gave an extremely face-slapping bid.","“1.5 billion.”","Silence.","The entire venue fell silent again.","This time, not many people dared to whisper.","Everyone stared at the immortals fighting in the front row.","Who was this person? Was he crazy? The person from the reclusive families had raised the bid by 100 million. Not only did he raise the bid, but he even raised it by 400 million. Was he humiliating the reclusive families or was he humiliating that person for being stingy?","Someone swallowed their saliva.","The two people who originally wanted to compete with the reclusive families looked at each other. At this moment, they called the staff and handed over their auction cards to show that they were forfeiting.","Firstly, the bidding price had already exceeded their expectations.","Secondly, the tense situation was a little terrifying. They did not want to get involved and become cannon fodder.","As the two forfeited, only Nie Qingru and the unfamiliar man were still bidding.","Nie Qingru was angered by the other party’s young and frivolous behavior. Especially when the other party continued after she had called out 1.1 billion, her anger reached its peak.","It was rare for her to show emotions. She sneered and slowly raised the auction card.","“Two billion.”","The dead silence was broken by her bidding.","“Oh, my God, it’s already two billion.”","“Hehe, as expected of that person. The reclusive families are still impressive. Under such circumstances, even if they are just fighting for face, they have to increase the price by at least 400 million. However, that person doesn’t lack money. She’s been in that position for decades. How much more foundation does she have than others?”","“I don’t know if the guy’s still with her.”","Everyone was discussing.","Only Shadow in the corner was sensitive enough to notice Nie Qingru’s emotional fluctuations. Her breathing became heavier, and she quietly clenched her fists.","The Empress was rarely provoked, but this time, she was angered.","He observed the man with the buzz cut with a cold gaze and wondered when such a person had appeared in Continent M.","However, too many people were paying attention to them right now. Even if he wanted to ask the Sapor family about that person’s background, it was not good to make it too obvious. Otherwise, it would seem that the reclusive families were too timid.","He could only suppress his urges and look at Nie Qingru worriedly.","Nie Qingru calmly shouted for two billion and waited for the other party’s reaction.","She knew the price was not low, but she guessed that the other party still wanted to continue playing with her. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have provoked her in the last round.","She was already prepared for the other party to follow her, so she continued.","Unexpectedly, the man with the buzz cut looked over in surprise. Then, he quickly shrugged his shoulders and called the staff to hand over his auction card.","He smiled at Nie Qingru and said, “I forfeit.”"]},{"number":3590,"title":"Chapter 3590: Old Demoness Almost Suspected","paragraphs":["Chapter 3590: Old Demoness Almost Suspected","Editor: Atlas Studios","Silence.","Nie Qingru felt like she punched cotton.","This feeling made her very unhappy.","Even though she had won the auction and Miss Sapor had congratulated her, she had yet to recover from the unhappiness of being fooled.","However, no matter what Nie Qingru thought, the auction had already ended. She had won the finale item as she wished, and she still had to get the pill.","...","“Shadow.”","The man in the shadows walked over and lowered his head like a good dog. “Your Majesty, what are your orders?”","Nie Qingru’s expression was indifferent. “Go and settle the handover with the Sapor family.”","“Yes.”","Shadow raised his head and glanced at her.","Nie Qingru had long developed a tacit understanding with him after such a long time together. With just a glance, she understood what he wanted to ask.","“Put it in the same place.”","Shadow nodded. “Okay.”","At this moment, people from the Sapor family walked over. After confirming that he was handling the procedures, they politely asked him to follow them.","At the same time, according to the auction process, the items would be taken backstage after the final buyer was confirmed.","Someone had already asked Robert to be present for a third-party appraisal to ensure that there was no possibility of them changing the goods midway.","The auction ended and the charity banquet came to an end.","However, Nie Qingru had yet to leave. The others were not as qualified or as influential as her, so it was inappropriate for them to leave their seats before her.","After Nie Qingru and Miss Sapor discussed the handover process, she raised her eyes slightly and asked casually, “I think No. 5, who was bidding with me in the end, is a little unfamiliar. When did Continent M have such a person?”","Miss Sapor was no fool and had long expected Nie Qingru to ask about this person. Thus, she had already checked the guest’s identity.","Hence, to Nie Qingru’s question, she did not hide anything. “Mr. Ross is not from Continent M. He’s a guest invited by my father from Continent F. He has some businesses under his name that mainly involve rare earth mineral mining and weapons. He has a close relationship with Continent F’s big weapons merchant, Mr. Cage. My father invited him to this charity banquet because of this relationship.”","She could tell that Nie Qingru had been provoked by Ross this time.","However, the other party was her father’s guest, and he was also someone the Sapor family had always wanted to rope in. Naturally, she had to speak up for him.","Therefore, she only hesitated for a moment before expressing her attitude. “Your Majesty, don’t be angry. Mr. Ross doesn’t understand the situation in Continent M. He shouldn’t have any ill intentions. He heard the Pharmacy Association’s name and bid for it out of curiosity. Didn’t he give up in the end? So, this is a coincidence.”","“Mm.” Nie Qingru’s cold expression had already eased when she heard ‘Continent F’ and ‘big weapons merchant Cage’.","As far as she knew, Cage was eccentric and had no relationship with the Red Alliance, Dark Fort, or David... So, Sapor might be telling the truth.","The other party just did not know the rules and competed with her for two rounds on a whim. Then, he was surprised by something and forfeited. He did not deliberately want to slap her face or provoke her.","Nie Qingru had already ruled out the possibility of being fooled, but what happened tonight still made her unhappy. She wasn’t even interested in talking to the others.","**","At the same time, in a corner of the hall, an oriental waiter silently disappeared from the banquet hall."]},{"number":3591,"title":"Chapter 3591: Sister Nian Is Preparing to Take Action","paragraphs":["Chapter 3591: Sister Nian Is Preparing to Take Action","Editor: Atlas Studios","Besides the colleague not far from her, almost no one noticed her leaving.","Although the tall foreign man noticed she had turned around and left the banquet hall after the auction, he did not know where she was going.","Coincidentally, the head waiter called him.","He thought that the Oriental person couldn’t go too far. At most, she would hide in the kitchen and slack off...","He didn’t overthink and followed the foreman to help.","...","...","The backstage handover went smoothly.","The staff in charge of the handover, under Robert’s witness, packed the gene medicine for the second appraisal and handed it to the man.","Shadow took out a pen from his pocket and signed the contract. Then, he handed a check to the other party.","“This is the auction amount.”","Two billion was not a small sum. Only a few people could write such a large check.","The staff took the check from him and gave it a symbolic check before handing it to Robert, politely saying, “Mr. Robert, take a look at the check.”","Robert took it and nodded at Shadow without verifying it. “The check is fine.”","Shadow took the box with the medicine and said to the others in the room, “Since the medicine and the check are fine, I’ll leave first.”","His words were mainly directed at Robert.","Robert was easy to talk to. “Okay, take care.”","Shadow left the backstage with his men.","Only the Sapor family and Robert were left backstage now.","Since the handover was done, the other party did not want to stay here any longer. He said politely, “Then, Mr. Robert, I’ll go back and report to Miss.”","Robert nodded and gestured for him to get on with his work.","The Sapor family member left in a grandiose manner, leaving him alone backstage.","Robert looked at the check and pursed his lips. He knew that there were surveillance cameras everywhere. Even if Goddess Q was nearby, she wouldn’t come looking for him.","He put away the two billion yuan check and, after thinking for a while, to not affect Qiao Nian, he left the backstage.","In fact, Robert had guessed correctly.","His sixth sense was very accurate.","Someone was watching Robert’s every move.","It was not until he drove into the Pharmacy Association’s building and no one came out that the person called Shadow.","“... That person entered the Pharmacy Association and did not come out again.”","“Did he meet anyone on the way?”","“No.” The man inside the car at the entrance of the Pharmacy Association observed the silent intersection and affirmed, “After receiving the check, he left and came back. He didn’t encounter any suspicious people on the way, nor did he interact with anyone. Even now, no one has come out of the Pharmacy Association’s building, not even the chauffeur.”","...","Shadow had just left the banquet venue and was sitting in a modified armored luxury car listening to the spy’s report.","Upon hearing that Robert had not interacted with anyone along the way and had not come out after returning to the Pharmacy Association, his tightly furrowed brows relaxed and he said coldly, “...Continue to keep an eye on him!”","After hanging up, he rubbed the corners of his cell phone, asking himself whether there was a trap in this matter."]},{"number":3592,"title":"Chapter 3592: Following Behind Them by Surprise","paragraphs":["Chapter 3592: Following Behind Them by Surprise","Editor: Atlas Studios","After they caused the Mingshui Mansion incident in the independent continent, it did not take long for the other party to counterattack, causing them to be overwrought for a long time.","According to Qiao Nian’s style of doing things, under normal circumstances, she would immediately take revenge and would not do anything else. They would maintain peace for some time.","However, this gene medicine came at such a time. Not to mention that the Empress suspected this gene medicine and Mr. K’s identity...","Even he had his doubts.","However, based on the current situation, it seemed like Qiao Nian was not behind this matter, and the Pharmacy Association was not colluding with outsiders...","...","Someone might have really entrusted the Pharmacy Association to sell this gene medicine.","Shadow thought before ordering the chauffeur, “To the warehouse.”","Silence.","The chauffeur silently started the car and drove to the warehouse as instructed.","Shadow did not seem afraid that the chauffeur would know this.","This was because they had found a mute from the beginning. Moreover, he was someone who had been nurtured from a group of children in war-torn areas. He was agile but uneducated.","Such people kept their ears open for orders and lost the ability to speak and write to reveal secrets.","Even if he fell into the opponent’s hands, they wouldn’t be able to get any useful information from such a person.","This was also why Nie Qingru chose such a person as her driver.","She had even nurtured many such people to work for her.","These people had all received strict training from childhood just to make them into handy tools.","The car silently crushed the fallen leaves of autumn.","No one noticed that a minute after they set off a taxi coincidentally followed them in the same direction.","There was a lot of traffic. Even the cautious Shadow did not notice a taxi tailing them. He only checked through the rearview mirror to see if a private car was following them.","He was relieved after discovering no suspicious vehicles.","After all, it was just a gene medicine. It was no big deal.","Shadow leaned back in the seat and closed his eyes to rest.","* * *","The taxi driver kept stealing glances at the girl in the passenger seat. The girl was tall and wore a baseball cap, looking sloppy.","However, when she entered the car, she said the person in front was her uncle. She was here to help Auntie keep an eye on her cheating uncle.","Then, she gave him money and told him to follow the car in front no matter what, but it was impossible to follow too obviously.","This reason did not surprise him.","After all, he had encountered all kinds of passengers in his line of work.","It was not strange to occasionally encounter someone following cheaters.","He was only attracted by the girl’s arrogant and unrestrained aura. He kept feeling that this Asian girl was a little different from the passengers who usually caught mistresses.","But he couldn’t tell exactly what was different.","After Qiao Nian entered the car, she took out her cell phone and started playing. Her lowered eyes and calm expression made it impossible to tell whether she was really helping her aunt catch evidence of her ‘uncle’ cheating on her.","However, her calm behavior caused the chauffeur to find her less eye-catching.","After all, she was so young. Perhaps she was really entrusted by her aunt to follow her uncle, that’s why she was so relaxed.","He stopped paying attention to Qiao Nian and focused on following the car in front.","At this moment, Qiao Nian received a message."]},{"number":3593,"title":"Chapter 3593: This Is Nie Qingru’s True Strength","paragraphs":["Chapter 3593: This Is Nie Qingru’s True Strength","Editor: Atlas Studios","[Y: I got the money.]","Qiao Nian stared at the line of words on WeChat for a while. Then, she thought of something and casually typed a reply.","She didn’t have to wait long before her cell phone vibrated again.","Qiao Nian looked down and saw the reply.","Extremely concise.","...","Just one word.","[Y: Yes.]","Her eyelids drooped as she looked at her question—[Was the man at the banquet arranged by you?]","Ye Wangchuan’s answer was below.","[Y: Yes.]","Qiao Nian was expressionless, but the doubts in her heart disappeared. She had a feeling that it was indeed him.","This was because of the way the man bidded at the start to provoke Nie Qingru and then gave up easily in the end... His series of actions were very similar to someone’s style.","That calm and composed style of toying with people’s hearts.","Like Ye Wangchuan.","She recalled Nie Qingru’s expression when the man easily forfeited the bid. In short, her expression was not good.","The corners of her lips curled up and she chuckled.","She was in a good mood.","However, her good mood was especially strange in the driver’s eyes. He peeked at her several times while waiting for the traffic light to turn green.","This was the first time he had seen someone laugh out loud when trying to catch an adulterous couple.","Coincidentally, they were still waiting for the light to turn green. The driver couldn’t help but ask, “Young lady, is your uncle really in that car? That car is not cheap...”","He recognized the logo. It seemed to be a luxury car.","He didn’t know the exact price, only the logo.","The Asian girl was wearing an ordinary sweater and a baseball cap. She looked like an ordinary person. How could her uncle drive a luxury car?","Just as the driver was feeling puzzled...","The girl put her phone back into her pocket and met his gaze before casually replying, “Yes.”","The driver did not expect the baseball cap to be hiding such an outstanding face.","He suddenly believed the young lady’s aunt could find a rich man. If her auntie looked like this, it would be normal for her to marry a rich man.","The taxi followed the Rolls-Royce to a building in the city center and stopped. Qiao Nian rolled down the window and saw Shadow leaving the car with a suitcase. He looked up at the rows of tall buildings before walking in.","The taxi driver also stepped on the brakes and stopped by the roadside. “Your uncle went in.”","Qiao Nian gave him the money and opened the door.","The taxi driver took the money and tip. Just as she was about to get off, he said, “... I didn’t expect your uncle to be an executive of Smith Bank.”","Smith Bank was the largest private bank in Continent M, controlling 40% of Continent M’s wealth.","Qiao Nian paused before getting out of the car and closing the door. Then, she said to the taxi driver, “Thank you.”","She watched as the taxi disappeared into the distance. Only then did she look across the road at the building.","Rows and rows of buildings bathed in the night lights. The lights were so bright that they did not look like night. Just from the outside, one could imagine the prosperity inside.","She had heard of the Smith Bank settlement system in Continent M a long time ago. Occasionally, their goods would have to be settled through this bank.","However, she had never thought that the owner of this bank was Nie Qingru.","No wonder Nie Qingru could sit firmly in the top position of the reclusive families. Even with the Nie family dragging her down, no one dared to question her.","Because she held 40% of Continent M’s wealth and the settlement system.","Most transactions in Continent M couldn’t bypass her bank settlement system. That was why those families and individuals were so afraid of her."]},{"number":3594,"title":"Chapter 3594: Don’t Wait for Me, Just Go Down","paragraphs":["Chapter 3594: Don’t Wait for Me, Just Go Down","Editor: Atlas Studios","Moreover, they had to show her respect!","At the end of the day, it was nothing more than Nie Qingru choking their economic lifeline.","Qiao Nian felt a sharp pain in her head. The building in front of her was like a monster baring its fangs and brandishing its claws in the night, ready to swallow her at any moment.","For the first time, she realized what kind of enemy she was facing.","Nie Qingru was not as simple as she looked on the surface, but she did not expect her to be so deeply entangled in the interests of the reclusive families and Continent M.","...","If she wanted to go after Nie Qingru in the future, it would be equivalent to making the entire Continent M her enemy.","Qiao Nian did not dally any longer.","After a short headache, she pressed the bone between her eyebrows and forced herself to calm down. Then, she found a spot near a tree and used her phone as a temporary computer to hack into the bank’s security system.","This place was Nie Qingru’s lair. It was different from other places. The security system was complicated to invade from the outside.","If it were someone else, they might have triggered the alarm system seven or eight times before they even touched the door of the security system.","Fortunately, this person was Qiao Nian.","Most of the impressive and awesome security systems on the dark web were created by her!","Nie Qingru probably did not want to use her things. The bank security system was created by other computer experts and was also top-of-the-line.","It took Qiao Nian half an hour to barely get the surveillance rights of the elevator and corridor.","She hacked a few elevators before finally finding the person she was looking for on the fifth try...","She stopped and fixed her gaze on the screen—","* * *","The man in the elevator did not know someone on the other side of the road watching his every move through her cell phone.","He just inexplicably felt that today the elevator was exceptionally dull, and the air seemed unstable.","He pulled at his tie with an unhappy expression and a frown.","This was just a small movement out of discomfort, but it scared the bank executives accompanying him.","A fat Mediterranean man wiped the cold sweat off his forehead and carefully observed him. “Lord Shadow, is there something wrong?”","As he spoke, his eyes darted around.","The small elevator was only the size of a palm. If there was anything wrong, he would notice it at a glance... But there were only him and Shadow in the elevator. How could there be a third person?","Shadow’s eyebrows relaxed, and he returned to his usual expressionless face. “Nothing is wrong. You don’t have to leave when we reach the 8th floor.”","“I know, I know. It’s the old rules.” The fat bank executive heaved a sigh of relief and quickly spoke.","Everyone in Smith Bank knew that the 8th floor was off-limits. Only Shadow and Nie Qingru had the authority to go there.","The 8th floor as displayed on the employee elevator was actually the 9th floor. It was just numbered ‘8’ to cover up the truth.","The real 8th floor was a storage room.","It could also be said to be a large vault.","Only three to five people in the bank knew about this secret.","The elevator soon reached the real 8th floor.","Ding!","The elevator doors opened.","Outside was a brightly lit corridor. From the elevator doors, one could see the high-end carpet in the corridor.","The obese bank executive was smart and did not even look outside as he respectfully said, “Go in. I’ll wait for you in the elevator.”","Shadow walked out of the elevator without looking back. “Don’t wait for me. Go down directly.”","“Will do.”","The bank executive did not dare to disobey and pressed the button for the first floor."]},{"number":3595,"title":"Chapter 3595: Sister Nian Sneaked In","paragraphs":["Chapter 3595: Sister Nian Sneaked In","Editor: Atlas Studios","The elevator doors suddenly closed, and the fat executive disappeared from his sight.","Shadow held the suitcase tightly and slowly walked towards the huge vault.","He vaguely felt that someone was watching his every move, but he saw no one around.","Shadow walked to the door of the vault. He didn’t know why, but he suddenly looked up at the hidden camera in the corner.","* * *","...","It was as if he was meeting Qiao Nian’s gaze.","At this moment, outside the brightly lit building, the girl leaning against a tree raised her baseball cap and narrowed her exquisite eyes as she watched with interest as the man on the screen stared at the camera like a venomous snake.","He seemed to have discovered her existence!","If it were anyone else, they would have panicked long ago.","However, Qiao Nian was not anyone else. She licked her lips, took a fruit candy from her pocket, and tore it open, slowly waiting for the man’s next move.","She believed in her skills.","Shadow couldn’t have guessed that she was here, so the so-called staring at the ‘surveillance camera’ was nothing more than his body’s sharp senses subtly hinting at something.","He could have sensed something, but he had no evidence.","Speculation without proof would not last long.","Qiao Nian pressed the tip of her tongue against the candy and lowered her eyes. As expected, the man looked away from the surveillance camera with a frown.","After a brief hesitation, he pressed on the metal door of the vault.","Information about the patterns on his palm popped up in the blue verification area. After about a minute, Qiao Nian saw through the surveillance cameras that the heavy metal door had opened.","Shadow walked in with the suitcase.","After he entered, the metal door closed, and the surveillance camera only showed an empty corridor.","Qiao Nian supported her chin with her fingers. Her expression was casual as if she had long expected not to be able to see the inside of the vault.","According to her observations, there were two sets of surveillance cameras inside and outside the vault.","She had only hacked into the surveillance system belonging to Smith Bank and had not obtained the authority of the surveillance cameras inside the vault.","Qiao Nian savored the candy for a while.","Not long after, the door of the vault opened again. Shadow walked out, and the suitcase was nowhere to be seen.","Qiao Nian was like a lone wolf ready to hunt. Her lips curled up as she leaned against the tree by the roadside and waited patiently.","Soon, Shadow left the building and entered the Rolls-Royce with a few people. Then, the car drove into the night...","After the Rolls-Royce disappeared and the people at the entrance turned around and went back inside, she pressed down the brim of her cap and walked towards the building at a moderate pace.","* * *","As the largest money transfer point in Continent M, Smith Bank had financial elites working uninterruptedly to ensure that all money transferred through the bank was successfully in place.","So it would not be surprising if someone came to the bank at 9 PM.","Qiao Nian had already created an identity for herself when she hacked into the bank’s security system and obtained the fingerprint code employees used to sign in.","Upon entering the bank, she calmly scanned the QR code with her phone. Then, she walked across the brightly lit marble floor towards the elevator.","Shadow had just left, and the front desk was at its weakest. Almost no one noticed someone waiting for the elevator."]},{"number":3596,"title":"Chapter 3596: She Only Has Half an Hour","paragraphs":["Chapter 3596: She Only Has Half an Hour","Editor: Atlas Studios","The front desk was still discussing the previous episode.","“Oh, did you see that? That’s that person’s right-hand man, right? I saw how respectful the President was and guessed that it was him.”","“I don’t know. I was on leave the last time he came. In addition, that person doesn’t come here often. I haven’t seen the person you are talking about.”","“Didn’t you see it just now? It’s that person. The man in black. He’s the right-hand man. I know the car parked outside.”","...","...","At this moment, the elevator came down.","The girl in the baseball cap listened to the gossip and laughter floating into her ears and entered to pick up the goods without looking sideways.","The elevator doors closed.","Only now did someone at the front desk notice the small commotion at the elevator. She looked at the elevator and said curiously, “I just saw someone enter the elevator.”","“Probably the people from the technical department!” Her companion patted her shoulder and said indifferently, “I saw it too. The people from the technical department are like this. They don’t care about their appearance and don’t wear formal clothes. They just wear whatever is comfortable. They’re all night owls and work overtime for a long time. They often come at this time.”","The young front desk receptionist, who had some doubts, also felt that her friend’s words made sense and threw the thought to the back of her mind.","“Maybe.”","Although she said that, her heart was still beating like a drum.","It was mainly because she had just seen that the figure did not seem to enter the employee elevator, but the elevator that her colleagues had mentioned just now, which was reserved for the big shots.","The others were still talking about the previous topic.","They talked about how powerful that person was and how high his status was.","She felt that she was overthinking again.","Who would dare to come to Smith Bank alone to cause trouble? She must have seen it wrongly just now...","**","The elevator stopped on the 8th floor.","With a ding, the elevator doors opened.","The girl pulled down the brim of her baseball cap to cover her exquisite and eye-catching eyebrows and walked out slowly.","She had already hacked into this layer of surveillance cameras.","Now, the people in the security room would only see the screenshot she had taken previously—an empty corridor and the door of the vault.","Qiao Nian knew that no one would notice her coming up, so she was in no hurry to walk to open the vault’s door.","The dark blue verification area lit up with a faint light. As long as she placed her palm on it, it would definitely trigger a warning and instantly expose her whereabouts...","Qiao Nian stood in front of the metal vault and calmly took a chip the size of a phone card from her pocket. Her eyelashes drooped as she restrained the arrogance in her eyes.","The next second, the A.I. Chip was stuck in the verification area.","Fingerprint patterns appeared at the dark blue verification area and gathered into light spots. A click sounded 0.001 seconds before the alarm was about to blare out.","The verification system that was developed by the most advanced scientists in the world was successfully invaded by the virus. Right on the heels of that, the flashing blue light was replaced by a red light. It was also the process of fingerprint lines converging into a palm print. In the blink of an eye, it replicated Shadow’s previous palm print.","Crack—","The seemingly indestructible vault door opened by itself.","Qiao Nian put the fingernail-sized chip into her pocket and swaggered into the vault...","This virus could paralyze all systems for half an hour. Then, the system would return to normal. This was also to prevent others from discovering the existence of the virus.","In other words, she had to find the antidote within half an hour.","Once the virus paralysis system was overdue, Nie Qingru would immediately discover that she had broken into the vault—"]},{"number":3597,"title":"Chapter 3597: There’s a Safe Hidden in the Wall","paragraphs":["Chapter 3597: There’s a Safe Hidden in the Wall","Editor: Atlas Studios","After Qiao Nian entered, she silently scanned the situation in the vault.","This vault was more than 300m2, and Nie Qingru’s private collection was neatly placed inside—antiques and priceless jewelry.","Due to the uniqueness of this place, not everything could be placed there. Therefore, only things that Nie Qingru thought were important could be placed here.","Qiao Nian walked around and saw many antique calligraphy and paintings. She even saw a controversial portrait.","Mona Lisa.","...","She looked at the ordinary oil painting placed in the third compartment of the antique collection area. She turned her body slightly and looked at the well-preserved oil painting before raising her eyebrows and revealing a surprised expression.","In fact, famous appraisers all over the world had been suspicious of the painting in the museum that was claimed to be authentic, but it had never been verified.","After all, this painting was precious and could not be casually examined.","Seeing the oil painting in Nie Qingru’s vault, Qiao Nian was almost certain that the painting displayed in the museum was a fake!","However, even such a precious collection was casually placed outside Nie Qingru’s vault. It could be seen that there were many good things in her vault.","Qiao Nian... had a little money. Hence, she was not particularly interested in these items. She did not even touch them. Upon reaching the end, her gaze froze slightly.","It was a wall with no gaps. There was a large blue and white porcelain vase on the wall. It looked like a corner to store items.","However, Qiao Nian noticed a subtle difference.","She walked over and touched the wall. Then, she curled her fingers and knocked on it. The unusual sound was confirmation she had not misjudged.","Hence, she retreated a step and looked at the blue and white porcelain on the side before circling it three times.","The bottom of the blue-and-white porcelain was stuck to it like glue. It spun and made cracking sounds. After Qiao Nian tried to spin it three times, the wall changed.","There seemed to be nothing special on the wall, revealing a hidden space. Inside was a small safe.","The safe was embedded in the wall. It was difficult for ordinary people to imagine that there was a vault hidden inside the wall.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes, her expression turning serious.","She walked over and checked how the safe could be opened. Then, she sat cross-legged on the ground and tried to open it.","This safe used the most primitive method. It did not rely on high-tech fingerprints or irises. It required a key.","Needless to say, the key must be in Nie Qingru’s possession. Moreover, Nie Qingru had it with her, so it was very difficult to get it.","Looking around the vault, Qiao Nian found a wire and a metal disc before sitting back down and pursing her lips as she tried to open the safe with the tools.","Seconds ticked by.","The half-hour time limit was right in front of her.","Even though she was calm, she became anxious as time passed. She sped up her hand movements, using the wire to try to unlock the safe through the gap.","Qiao Nian’s back was drenched in cold sweat, and her palm was sticky with sweat. She couldn’t operate the tools accurately several times.","Fortunately, her heart was strong. In the last five minutes, she finally unlocked the safe and opened it."]},{"number":3598,"title":"Chapter 3598: Still Didn’t Guard Against the Mechanisms Inside","paragraphs":["Chapter 3598: Still Didn’t Guard Against the Mechanisms Inside","Editor: Atlas Studios","There were only two shelves in this hidden safe. On the top were some brown folders—probably important contracts.","Qiao Nian did not touch them casually.","Her gaze was mainly focused on the shelf below.","There were only two items on the bottom shelf—an inch-long porcelain bottle and a black agate box. There was also an old photo beside the two items.","Qiao Nian slowly picked up the photo.","...","This should be a photo from decades ago.","Even though it was well-preserved, the edges were yellowed, and the colors had begun to fade.","Qiao Nian narrowed her eyes.","The person in the photo was not Nie Qingru or Ji Qing, but a young man.","When the photo was taken, the man had probably just reached adulthood. His early twenties made him look young and high-spirited.","He smiled brightly at the camera, revealing his white teeth. Even through the photo, she could feel the young man’s momentary happiness.","... Who was this person?","Qiao Nian held the photo, unable to figure out the identity of the person that Nie Qingru had spent so much effort to hide.","She kept the photo and checked the time on her phone.","There were only four minutes left.","In such a short period, she did not have time to think about anything else, nor did she have time to distinguish whether the antidote was in a porcelain bottle or the agate box.","She took both.","The porcelain bottle was smaller and easier to put away.","Qiao Nian took it first.","Then, she reached for the agate box. The moment she picked it up, she saw a hidden button at the bottom of the box.","The box was pressing it down, that’s why she didn’t see it. As long as no one touched the box, the mechanism wouldn’t be triggered.","However, if someone took the box without knowing it, the hidden button would immediately pop out.","Oh no!","Qiao Nian’s mind flashed. Her body reacted faster than her thoughts, and she immediately hugged the box and rolled back. At the same time, crossbows were fired from all directions.","Cold and dark arrows shot towards her from all directions. If Qiao Nian had been a second slower, she would have been turned into a sieve and died on the spot.","Although she was agile and immediately rolled away from the hidden arrows, she could not entirely defend against such a fatal trap.","Her right arm was pierced by an arrow. Qiao Nian’s nerves tensed up. She endured the intense pain that swept through her brain and retreated while holding her arm...","She had just taken a step forward when an alarm went off throughout the vault, and a red light flashed in the vault. It was at least three minutes earlier than she had expected.","Qiao Nian covered her arm and looked up, looking straight at the hidden surveillance cameras in the vault, her face expressionless.","It was almost certain that there was no problem with her chip, but the moment she touched the box, it triggered the alarm system of the entire vault!","With Nie Qingru’s tight control of the box, it was obvious that this alarm must have been connected to her cell phone.","Nie Qingru must have received the news tight after the alarm rang.","**","Reality proved Qiao Nian right.","Outside the charity banquet.","Miss Sapor had just sent this distinguished guest to the intersection and was about to exchange a few last words when Nie Qingru’s cell phone rang. It was not an ordinary call, but a sound similar to a radar alarm.","She was stunned for a moment. Before she could react, Her Majesty’s expression, always arrogant and noble, suddenly changed. She took out her phone and stared at it. Her gaze and aura were terrifying as if someone had stepped on her bottom line."]},{"number":3599,"title":"Chapter 3599: Sister Nian Is Injured","paragraphs":["Chapter 3599: Sister Nian Is Injured","Editor: Atlas Studios","“Empress, what happened?” Although Miss Sapor felt she should shut up, she still had to say something diplomatic at this moment.","Nie Qingru seemed to be in her own world and did not hear her at all. Her eyes were bloodshot and she looked like she wanted to kill someone.","She saw the girl who was supposed to be in the independent continent looking at the surveillance camera, seemingly looking straight at her.","Nie Qingru felt a sharp pain in her head, and her face twisted in anger.","“Qiao Nian!”","...","Nie Qingru did not expect that one day, the Ji family would still dare to touch the wound in her heart that could not be touched. Overwhelming anger swept over her, almost causing her to lose her rationality.","“How dare she! How dare she!”","She did not say what it was that Qiao Nian had dared to do.","Miss Sapor was frightened by her reaction and stood there helplessly, not knowing what to say.","Nie Qingru had completely forgotten about her existence. Enraged, she pressed her temples and forced herself to calm down. Then, she turned around, got into the car, and slammed the door shut.","Her suppressed voice was underlined by anger.","“To the bank!”","The black Rolls-Royce drove towards Smith Bank like a venomous snake slithering into the night.","...","In the car.","Nie Qingru’s face was still cold, and a terrifying aura lingered around her.","She immediately called Shadow.","The other party also received the alarm and immediately picked it up.","“Empress, I’m rushing back. I’ve already instructed them not to let a single person out.”","“I won’t let her get away!”","Hearing his promise, Nie Qingru’s face was still terrifyingly vicious. “If you can’t keep her, you can kill her.”","Even Shadow was stunned for a moment. He didn’t expect her to give such an order.","Nie Qingru’s meaning was clear.","If they couldn’t keep Qiao Nian today, they would eliminate her!","However, the Empress and Qiao Nian were related by blood.","Qiao Nian could be considered the Empress’s only descendant in the world.","Was the Empress going to kill her?","Shadow thought of Nie Qixing and lowered his voice. “Yes.”","Hearing the silence in his voice, Nie Qingru sneered. “She’s not my granddaughter. She’s just an evil creature with Ji Wusun’s blood flowing in her veins!”","That filthy, disgusting blood.","She had thought that it had gone extinct 20 years ago.","Who knew that she would be pecked in the eye by an eagle today?","Nie Qingru was no longer the woman who could only compromise back then. Decades of turmoil catapulted her to the peak of power. How could she tolerate Qiao Nian retreating unscathed?","She would take this little evil creature’s life today!","Sitting in the car, Nie Qingru asked casually, as if she was saying that the weather was good, “I want her to never go back. Do you understand?”","It was not a grandmother talking about her granddaughter.","Shadow was not silent this time. “Yes, Empress.”","**","Qiao Nian did not overthink about the mechanism at the bottom of the safe.","However, she reacted quickly.","She rolled out the moment the vault door started to close. If she had been half a second later, she would have been stuck inside and could only be held back.","She knew she was running out of time.","The people below must be coming up to catch her.","She ran towards the emergency stairs. Then, without hesitation, she ran in the opposite direction.","She did not go to the first floor according to her instincts.","Instead, she ran up to the 9th floor.","The steel arrow had pierced through her arm and torn her muscles. Qiao Nian had to endure immense pain with every step she took, but her footsteps were firm and her movements did not slow down at all."]},{"number":3600,"title":"Chapter 3600: Discovered the Knocked Out Person in the Male Restroom","paragraphs":["Chapter 3600: Discovered the Knocked Out Person in the Male Restroom","Editor: Atlas Studios","She went up to the 9th floor first.","When the others heard the alarm and were still panicking about what had happened, she quickly walked into the female washroom and entered a cubicle. She gritted her teeth and pulled out the 20-centimeter-long steel needle on her right arm.","Blood spewed out and wet her sleeve. Face pale, Qiao Nian tore off the T-shirt’s inside fabric and tied it under the wound to temporarily stop the blood.","She threw the steel needle on the ground and silently left the washroom. Then, she hurriedly pressed down on her baseball cap, turned into the stairwell again, and went to the 11th floor.","Turning the corner and seeing a lone female employee, she rushed over to cover the other party’s mouth, knocked her out, and dragged her into the washroom.","...","This time, she did not enter the female washroom. Instead, she chose the male washroom. She swapped her clothes with the female employee and put her sitting outside the first cubicle of the washroom. Next, she closed the window of the washroom to prevent the other party from catching a cold while unconscious.","Only now did she put her baseball cap on the other party’s head, took off the female employee’s glasses, and put them on before unhurriedly walking out.","The entire building was filled with shrill alarms.","Not everyone knew what had happened. They only knew that it was not a good thing.","Everyone’s attention was on the alarm. No one paid attention when Qiao Nian appeared in her uniform, nor did they see her take out the fire alarm hammer and hit the fire alarm.","When everyone got drenched by the sprinklers, she shouted, “... Fire!”","At this moment, everyone’s nerves were tense.","Everyone was scared out of their wits when they were suddenly splashed by the sprinklers above their heads. Coupled with someone shouting about a fire, everyone panicked to the extreme.","At this moment, someone shouted, “Run! Run downstairs!”","The others suddenly found their backbone and ran downstairs without taking their things.","One person going down alone might be eye-catching. However, with dozens and hundreds of people running down, one person was like a drop of water falling into the sea, completely unremarkable.","The commotion on the 11th floor also affected the other floors. Some people saw others looking down and running. Although they didn’t know what was going on, they also ran down in fear.","More and more people went down.","No one paid attention as an unfamiliar face in a uniform and rimless glasses blended in and followed them to the first floor.","***","Shadow rushed to the vault and opened the door to find it empty. There was no sign of Qiao Nian.","He knew that she had run away.","He immediately blocked the elevator, intending to block everyone coming down this way.","However, he soon realized that Qiao Nian did not use the elevator. He thought of the emergency exit stairs and led his men from the first to the eighth floor.","Surprisingly, there was still no trace of Qiao Nian.","Shadow realized something and led his men upstairs.","They soon found a bloody steel nail in the bathroom on the ninth floor. Shadow ordered a search of the entire floor but could not find the girl.","He rubbed the space between his eyebrows, forcing himself to calm down and continue searching.","On the 10th floor, they went straight to the bathroom.","However, this time, the bathroom was spick clean. There was nothing wrong with it.","On the 11th floor, the female washroom was still empty.","However, his subordinates quickly reported the news to him.","“There’s a female employee in the men’s washroom unconscious in the aisle. Her clothes have also been changed...”","Shadow immediately reacted and said sternly, “Take me there!”"]}]);
